window.SPEECH_RECORDS=[{"title_en":"Start with a measurable model, before asking it to drive","zh":"最早能追溯到的工作，并不是让一个已经学会驾驶的网络继续训练。我先取得一个已有的果蝇连接组实现。它提供筛选后的神经元、连接、正负权重、神经动力学、感觉编码和人工编写的运动读出。保留下来的图有176,422个节点和6,287,749条聚合连接。项目最初保留这些计算规则，另加不依赖Minecraft身体的运行入口、刺激程序、车辆接口和记录工具。这样才能逐层问：输入送到了哪里，哪些细胞有反应，读出有没有变化。这里先采用0.5毫秒积分和50毫秒记录窗。不同于后来可训练的连续核心，此时运行的是固定的Java脉冲网络。先验证它会工作，再讨论它能否转方向。","en":"The earliest recorded work began before there was a trainable driving system. I first took an existing fruit-fly connectome implementation and made it measurable on its own. The upstream project supplied the filtered graph, signed connection weights, neural dynamics, sensory encoders, and an authored motor decoder. The retained graph had 176,422 neurons and 6,287,749 aggregated connections. My first additions were a headless experiment entry point, controlled stimuli, a recorder, and later the vehicle adapter. I removed the need for a Minecraft body and its behavioral fallbacks. I could then inspect input, neural activity, and output separately. This first version uses a fixed Java spiking network, with a half-millisecond integration step and 50-millisecond recording windows. The trainable continuous core came later. First, I needed evidence that the implementation worked.","title_zh":"先把已有连接组程序拆成可独立测量的核心","id":"step-001","summary_en":"I separated the existing fly model from the Minecraft body so I could test its inputs and outputs before connecting it to a car.","summary_zh":"我先把已有果蝇模型从 Minecraft 身体中分离出来，单独观察输入和输出，再准备接入车辆。"},{"title_en":"Check that silence and a known sensory pathway work","zh":"如果视觉刺激没有转向，首先要排除程序根本没在工作。因此先做两个600毫秒控制。无输入时，网络记录到零个脉冲。另一个控制使用上游文档中的糖感觉刺激，共记录到59,957个脉冲，两个MN9神经元的50毫秒群体采样为30到90赫兹。它说明在这套设置下，程序可以从已有感觉入口产生可测的运动相关输出。有了这个参照，后面的视觉零输出才有明确位置：我需要查视觉接口和读出，而不是把所有零结果都归为程序失效。","en":"If a visual trial produced no turn, I first needed to know whether the program was functioning. I therefore ran two 600-millisecond controls. The silent condition produced zero spikes. The documented sugar-sensory stimulus produced 59,957 spikes, including measurable activity in the two MN9 neurons. Their 50-millisecond population samples ranged from 30 to 90 hertz. This checks a known sensory-to-motor path under my chosen settings. It gave me a useful reference for the visual tests: a zero visual output could now be investigated as an input or readout problem, rather than automatically being treated as a program that never ran.","title_zh":"确认网络可安静，也可对已知输入响应","id":"step-002","summary_en":"Silence produced no spikes, while the known sugar pathway produced activity. This gave the later visual tests a working reference.","summary_zh":"无输入时没有脉冲，已知的糖感觉通路却能产生反应。这给后面的视觉测试提供了正常工作的参照。"},{"title_en":"A bright spot reaches the visual input, but produces no turn","zh":"第一个视觉问题很直接：在暗背景中放一个亮点，模型会不会给出左右转向？这最接近最初的虚拟光刺激想法。每条序列从新网络开始，内部按基线、中央、第一侧、中央、另一侧和撤除连续运行。另一条序列反转左右顺序，每段500毫秒。我没有给输出神经元强塞动作，也没有训练参数。记录显示，视网膜和早期视觉群确实接收到刺激，但所有采样窗的原始转向和解码转向都是零。因此下一步没有直接放大输出，而是先让目标动起来，检验静态刺激是否遗漏了当前接口需要的变化。","en":"The first visual question was simple: could a bright spot on a dark background produce a directional readout? This was the closest test of the original light-stimulus idea. Each sequence started a fresh network. Within a sequence, state continued through baseline, center, one side, center, the opposite side, and withdrawal. A mirrored sequence reversed the order, and every phase lasted 500 milliseconds. I did not inject a desired action into the output cells, and I did not train parameters. The records showed that retinal and early visual populations received input. However, both raw yaw and decoded yaw remained zero in every recorded window. The next choice was therefore to test a moving stimulus, before changing gains or the output mapping.","title_zh":"亮点进入视网膜后能否形成转向","id":"step-003"},{"title_en":"Motion alone still does not activate the turning readout","zh":"静态亮点没有转向后，我把刺激换成亮背景上的移动暗目标。核心、读出和内部参数保持原样，上游的高层对象特征仍然关闭。这一步优先只改目标运动，因为它能回答一个具体问题：前一次是不是因为没有足够的视觉变化？结果仍是两条左右镜像序列的转向读出全零。早期视觉输入有效，所以这里保留的是一个真正的负结果。下一步单独启用上游已有的对象特征入口，比较输入层级，而不是把更高层特征的效果混称为原始图像感知。","en":"After the static spot produced no turn, I tried a moving dark target on a bright background. The neural core, readout, and internal parameters stayed fixed. The upstream object-feature channels remain disabled. I changed motion first because it addresses a concrete possibility: perhaps the static trial did not supply the visual changes this interface needed. Both mirrored sequences still produce zero turning readout, although early visual input was engaged. I kept that negative result. The next test enabled an existing higher-level object-feature input as a separate condition. This allowed me to ask whether the level of sensory entry matters, while keeping retinal stimulation and analytic features clearly distinguished.","title_zh":"静态无转向，移动亮度能否有效","id":"step-004"},{"title_en":"A higher-level input produces activity, but not reliable left–right control","zh":"下行神经元是此处选作运动相关输出的群，我读取它们的计算活动。启用对象特征后，下行神经元和转向终于有了非零变化。但问题马上变成：这种变化能否稳定地区分左右？正常顺序中，左目标、后来的右目标和撤除末段的原始转向均值分别为−0.52、−0.64和−0.62。镜像顺序则是+0.14、+0.06和零。两个顺序不只是换了标签，中间目标的运动轨迹和网络状态也不同。尤其是撤除后仍有DNa02左侧活动，说明余波不全来自输出平滑。当前入口能影响模型，但还不能接成可信的双向方向控制。于是我让每侧刺激都从一个新网络开始，减少前面阶段留下的状态影响。","en":"I read selected descending neurons as candidate motor-related outputs. Enabling the object-feature channels finally produced nonzero descending activity and turning output. The question immediately became whether the response reliably distinguishes left from right. In the normal sequence, the raw-yaw tail means were −0.52 for the left target, −0.64 for the later right target, and −0.62 after withdrawal. The mirrored sequence gave +0.14, +0.06, and zero. These sequences differ in both central motion and internal history. In one condition, left DNa02 activity also remained after the target disappears, so decoder smoothing was not the whole explanation. The input could influence the model, but it did not yet provide reliable bidirectional control. I next tested each side from a fresh network, reducing the carryover from earlier phases.","title_zh":"较高层特征能否带动下降读出","id":"step-005"},{"title_en":"The first vehicle connection stops before any experiment","zh":"神经刺激测试之外，我也要建立课程模拟器接口。第一次连接失败时，模拟器进程还没有运行，因此没有发送驾驶动作，也没有车辆行为可解释。这是一个独立的工程停止点。我保留这次失败，然后启动并核验已有的CourseSim程序，再从场景菜单和就绪消息开始检查。","en":"In parallel with the neural probes, I needed a working connection to the course simulator. The first connection failed because the simulator process was not running. No driving action was sent, and there was no vehicle behavior to interpret. I kept this as an engineering failure before the experiment starts. The next action was to launch the existing verified CourseSim executable and check its menu, readiness messages, and telemetry.","title_zh":"先确认课程模拟器能连接","id":"step-006","summary_en":"The first connection failed because the simulator was not running. I started it before trying the vehicle interface again.","summary_zh":"第一次连接时模拟器没有运行。我先启动模拟器，再检查车辆接口。"},{"title_en":"The simulator sends data, but decimal commas break strict JSON","zh":"模拟器启动后，遥测开始出现，但Windows环境把小数写成逗号形式。严格JSON解析因此失败。这里的修复很窄：先尝试标准解析，只对未加引号的对象数字修复小数分隔符，同时保留原始字节、原始错误和每个改动。我没有改系统区域设置或课程资产。修复后，仍需要完整验证从菜单选择场景到收到就绪消息的过程，不能因为已经读到几个坐标就跳过这个步骤。","en":"Once the simulator starts, data arrive, but its Windows locale wrote decimal numbers with commas. Strict JSON parsing failed. I made a narrow compatibility repair: try standard JSON first, repair only the affected unquoted numeric tokens, and retain the original bytes, error, and changes. I did not change the operating-system locale or the course assets. Decoding coordinates was only one part of acceptance. I still needed to observe scene selection and the readiness sequence before treating the vehicle interface as ready.","title_zh":"遥测已来，但小数格式阻止解析","id":"step-007","summary_en":"The simulator wrote decimal commas that the data reader could not parse. I corrected those number fields and kept the original messages for checking.","summary_zh":"模拟器把小数写成逗号格式，接收程序无法解析。我只修正受影响的数字字段，并保存原消息供核对。"},{"title_en":"Fresh starts do not remove the inconsistent response","zh":"为了减少前一个目标造成的状态影响，接下来每个单侧脉冲都使用新网络。三个技术种子各做左、右两次，共六条记录。每条先基线500毫秒，刺激500毫秒，再撤除1000毫秒。左刺激末段原始转向为+0.12、+0.08和+0.06；右侧为−0.04、−0.02和零。这与此前某条连续序列的符号不同。其中一个左侧试验撤除后又出现−0.63的持续偏置，其余五条末段为零。新起点没有带来稳定可恢复的双向行为。我保留结果，下一步检查另一个已有、文档明确的HS自转线索入口。","en":"To reduce carryover from a preceding target, each unilateral pulse now starts a fresh network. Three technical seeds each receive one left and one right trial, giving six recordings. Every trial had 500 milliseconds of baseline, 500 milliseconds of stimulation, and 1,000 milliseconds of withdrawal. Left-stimulus tail means were +0.12, +0.08, and +0.06. Right-stimulus means were −0.04, −0.02, and zero. These signs differ from an earlier continuous sequence. One left trial also develops a persistent −0.63 withdrawal tail, while the other five finish at zero. Fresh initialization had therefore not produced consistent bidirectional, recoverable behavior. I kept these failures and next examine a different documented input: the upstream HS self-rotation channel.","title_zh":"输出偏置是否只是前一个目标留下的状态","id":"step-008"},{"title_en":"Telemetry from an already loaded scene does not verify scene loading","zh":"后续连接碰到另一个状态问题：模拟器已经在场景里。虽然能读到遥测，但原本要核验的菜单选择和加载顺序没有实际发生，因此这次没有通过完整验收。我没有把收到数据改写成成功加载，而是保留该记录，将实验拥有的模拟器重新启动到菜单，再执行同一场景请求。","en":"A later connection reached a simulator that was already inside a scene. Telemetry were available, but the intended menu-selection and loading sequence had not actually occurred. This attempt therefore did not pass the complete acceptance check. I kept the record instead of rewriting it as a successful scene load. I then restarted the experiment-owned simulator at its menu and repeat the explicit scene request. This was a lifecycle check, separate from neural control or driving quality.","title_zh":"已经进入场景的连接不能当成完整加载验证","id":"step-009","summary_en":"Receiving data from an already open scene did not test scene loading. I restarted from the menu and repeated the full loading sequence.","summary_zh":"已经打开场景时能收到数据，还不足以确认加载流程。我回到菜单，重新检查选场景和等待车辆就绪的全过程。"},{"title_en":"The self-rotation input reaches the correct side, but leaves a biased state","zh":"这一轮输入不再是相机或移动目标，而是上游已有的解析HS自转线索。我使用均匀亮度、没有对象，给出±300度每秒的输入。三个种子各测两个方向。正输入驱动左侧HS，负输入驱动右侧，入口侧别按预期工作。可是正刺激的转向尾均值为−0.08、−0.32和−0.32，负刺激为+0.02、−0.04和−0.20。负刺激撤除后，三个种子仍分别保留−0.50、−0.50和−0.46的偏置。我现在看到的是具体输入关联的持续状态，需要用同背景、零自转线索的控制进一步区分。","en":"This condition uses the upstream analytic HS self-rotation input. It was neither a camera image nor rendered optical flow. With uniform brightness and no objects, I supplied +300 or −300 source degrees per second. Three seeds received both signs. Positive input activates left HS, and negative input activates right HS, so the intended input side was engaged. The turning response was still asymmetric. Positive-stimulus tail means were −0.08, −0.32, and −0.32; negative-stimulus means were +0.02, −0.04, and −0.20. After negative stimulation ended, the three trials retain tails of −0.50, −0.50, and −0.46. I next compared these with zero self-rotation under the same background and seeds.","title_zh":"直接提供自转线索后能否双向输出","id":"step-010"},{"title_en":"The matched zero-input control stays at zero","zh":"三个匹配控制保持相同亮度、种子和流程，只让HS自转线索恒为零。它们的HS和转向尾部都为零。这个比较把问题收窄了：先前的持续偏置与被测非零输入有关，不能直接归为任何时候都会出现的同一种输出。但内部为什么保留这种状态仍未查明。下一步我更严格地清除外部驱动，观察内部状态保留后输出是否还能持续。","en":"The three matched controls keep the same brightness, seeds, and timing, but set the HS self-rotation cue to zero throughout. Their HS activity and tail raw yaw were zero. This narrows the observation: the persistent bias seen earlier was associated with the tested nonzero input. It was not simply the same output appearing in every condition. Its internal mechanism remained unresolved. The next diagnostic removes all external drive after stimulation while preserving the internal state, so I could test whether continuing background input was required.","title_zh":"持续输出是否在没有HS输入时也出现","id":"step-011"},{"title_en":"The scene and stationary telemetry chain finally pass","zh":"模拟器重新回到菜单后，我明确请求Warren，等到车辆就绪，再发送零转向、零油门和全制动。最终记录到390条有限位置和朝向遥测，时间从0.0351增加到19.4851秒，末速度约为9.27×10⁻⁸。另有六条短非协议消息单独保留，没有混入遥测计数。这一步证明连接、场景请求、就绪和数据记录可用。它还没有测转向符号、反复重置或神经驾驶，因此后面单独安排动作响应测试。","en":"After returning the simulator to its menu, I explicitly request Warren, wait for vehicle readiness, and send zero steering, zero throttle, and full brake. I recorded 390 telemetry packets with finite position and orientation. Reported time increased from 0.0351 to 19.4851 seconds, and final speed was approximately 9.27 × 10⁻⁸ in simulator units. Six short non-protocol lines remained separate. The connection, scene request, readiness, and stationary-data chain now work. Steering signs, repeatable resets, and neural driving still require their own measurements.","title_zh":"车辆场景、遥测和静止命令终于贯通","id":"step-012","summary_en":"Scene loading and stationary data collection worked. I could next measure steering, braking and repeatable starts.","summary_zh":"场景加载和静止数据采集终于连通了。接下来才有条件分别测转向、刹车和重复起点。"},{"title_en":"Persistent output survives verified removal of external drive","zh":"前一次所谓撤除，只是把自转线索归零，普通亮度背景还在。因此这次专门问：持续输出是否依赖这个外部背景？三个种子各做正常撤除和严格外部清零，共六次。刺激前记录逐项匹配；严格组在编码后把外部脉冲发生器和注入电流都清零，但保留细胞状态、待发突触事件和解码器状态。撤除最后500毫秒，左DNa02仍为28到40赫兹，原始转向仍为负。持续外部输入不是这段1000毫秒残余的必要条件。这里已经能解释为什么只调输出平滑不够，但还不能指定是哪条内部回路造成。因此下一步保留状态，直接给反向刺激。","en":"In the earlier withdrawal condition, only the self-rotation cue went to zero. The normal brightness background remained. I then asked whether that continuing external drive was required for the persistent output. Three seeds each receive normal withdrawal and verified external-drive removal, giving six trials. Their pre-intervention recordings match. In the removal condition, I clear external Poisson drive and injected current after encoding, while keeping cell state, pending synaptic events, and decoder state. During the last 500 milliseconds, left DNa02 still fires at 28 to 40 hertz, and raw yaw remained negative. Continuing external input was therefore not required for this observed 1,000-millisecond residual. The source of the internal persistence was still unresolved. I next preserve state and test whether an opposite stimulus could change the output.","title_zh":"撤掉所有外部驱动后，偏置是否仍存在","id":"step-013"},{"title_en":"A sibling-import error stops the action probe before commands","zh":"独立的车辆动作测试第一次没有进入实验。项目使用的隔离式Python没有自动把脚本目录加到导入路径，旁边的模块因此找不到。修正只显式加入当前脚本的绝对目录，不改运行时配置。这里没有神经计算结果，也没有发送给车的动作。两个新进程检查通过后，才启动真正的短动作序列。","en":"The first independent vehicle-response probe stops during a sibling-module import. The isolated Python runtime did not automatically add the script directory to its search path. I repaired the entry point by adding that resolved directory explicitly, without changing the runtime configuration. No experiment was created and no vehicle command was sent in this failed attempt. Only after fresh-process import and host-guard checks pass do I run the recorded bounded action sequence.","title_zh":"动作响应probe在导入阶段停止","id":"step-014","summary_en":"The action test stopped at a Python import error before sending a command. I repaired how the script found its neighbouring module.","summary_zh":"动作测试尚未发送命令，就因 Python 找不到相邻模块而停止。我修正了脚本的模块搜索路径。"},{"title_en":"Wheel centering does not restore the earlier heading","zh":"这一轮不接神经网络，只测车辆本身。固定油门0.1，分别给−0.15和+0.15转向，中间回到中性轮角，最后制动。144条遥测显示，两个有符号阶段车头分别变化约−2.607和+4.498；中间直轮阶段只变化+0.0125，车头保持在已经转过的方向附近。末速度降到约1.36×10⁻⁷。两个方向开始时速度不同，不能据此比较左右增益。这个结果提醒我：轮角、角速度和车头方向是不同量。接神经模型之前，必须说明输入代表什么、输出对应哪一个车辆量，而不是把所有正负号直接当成同一个方向标签。","en":"This test leaves the neural network disconnected and measures the vehicle itself. I held throttle at 0.1, apply steering −0.15 and +0.15, return the wheels to neutral between pulses, and finish with braking. Across 144 telemetry packets, the signed phases change reported yaw by approximately −2.607 and +4.498. During the intervening neutral-wheel phase, yaw changes by only +0.0125 and stays near the direction already reached. Final speed fell to about 1.36 × 10⁻⁷. The two pulses begin at different speeds, so they were not a matched left–right gain comparison. The practical lesson was that wheel angle, yaw rate, and heading were different quantities. A neural adapter must state which one its input and output represent.","title_zh":"实际轮角命令会怎样改变车头","id":"step-015","summary_en":"Returning the wheels to neutral did not restore the car's previous heading. The controller therefore needed to distinguish wheel angle from turning and heading.","summary_zh":"方向盘回正后，车头仍保持已经转过的方向。因此控制器必须分清转向命令、转动速度和车头朝向。"},{"title_en":"An opposite input does not reliably reverse the readout","zh":"接下来直接检验反向刺激。三个新种子各做负后正、正后负两种顺序，共六条连续状态序列，每段500毫秒。两侧HS在全部有符号阶段都按预期切换，所以输入侧没有卡住。原始下降读出却仍不一致：只有两条序列的两个刺激尾均值为相反非零符号，没有任何种子在两种顺序下都出现这个结果。我还能把每个原始转向值由实际记录的六个下降群贡献重建出来，误差仅约10⁻¹⁶，偏置位于平滑之前。因此下一次只降低HS输入幅度，保留核心、读出和序列，检查是不是驱动过强使方向差被持续状态覆盖。","en":"I next tested opposite stimulation directly. Three new seeds each receive negative-then-positive and positive-then-negative sequences, giving six trials with continuous internal state and 500-millisecond phases. HS activity switches sides in all signed phases, so the recorded input side was not stuck. The descending readout remained inconsistent. Only two sequences have opposite nonzero stimulus-tail signs, and no seed does so in both orders. I could reconstruct the raw yaw from the six recorded descending-population terms to roughly 10⁻¹⁶ error, showing that the bias was already present before smoothing. The next comparison changed only HS input magnitude. The recorded hypothesis was that weaker drive might reduce persistent state while preserving directional distinction. I kept the current core, decoder, and sequences as the reference.","title_zh":"内部状态保留时，反向刺激能否反向读出","id":"step-016"},{"title_en":"Weaker input quiets the tail, but does not solve directional control","zh":"输入从±300降到±150度每秒，其他设置和六种种子顺序保持不变。上游公式使规定的HS发生率从100降到约66.7赫兹，而不是简单减半。匹配检查确认前1000毫秒的初始记录一致。新结果中，六条有五条在撤除末段的十个窗里原始转向完全为零，参考组只有两条。但两个刺激尾部有相反非零符号的序列反而从两条变成一条，仍有一个顺序保留明显负偏置。因此减弱输入改善了安静程度，没有建立可用双向控制。原建议是先审计另一实现；随后我决定先把当前核心接到车上，进入探索性耦合。","en":"I reduced the input from ±300 to ±150 source degrees per second, keeping the seeds, orders, core, and decoder unchanged. The upstream nonlinear formula changed the prescribed HS generator rate from 100 to about 66.7 hertz; it did not simply halve it. The matched audit confirmed identical initial recordings over the first 1,000 milliseconds. Five of the six new trials had exactly zero raw yaw in all ten final withdrawal windows, compared with two reference trials. However, opposite nonzero stimulus-tail signs decreased from two sequences to one, and one order retained a strong negative bias. Weaker drive made the output quieter without producing dependable directional control. The recorded recommendation was to inspect another implementation. I then chose to connect the existing core to the car and observe it.","title_zh":"减弱驱动能否减少持续偏置又保留左右差异","id":"step-017"},{"title_en":"The first real closed loop turns away from its target","zh":"第一次耦合把真实车辆反馈送入神经模型，再把模型输出发回同一辆车。此时相机只负责记录。输入是目标车头方向减去当前方向，再乘15并限制到±150；它被送进上游代表自转的HS入口。解码后的神经转向乘0.15控制轮角，油门固定0.1。每帧保留输入遥测、神经窗口、实际命令和后来收到的车辆遥测。109帧中有10帧制动预热和99帧运动控制。但95次输入正好顶在+150，主要在测几乎恒定的饱和线索。实际转向为负，车头误差从约10度增到14.43度，最后因碰撞停止记录。最终制动发出了，却没有后续遥测确认静止。完整链条已执行，方向语义、饱和和异步时钟则成为下一步具体问题。","en":"The first coupled run sent real vehicle feedback into the neural model and sent its output back to the same car. At this stage, camera images were recorded only. The input was target heading minus measured heading, multiplied by 15 and clipped to ±150. I supplied that desired correction through the upstream HS field that originally represented perceived self-rotation. Decoded neural yaw, scaled by 0.15, controls steering, while throttle stays at 0.1. Every complete frame links input telemetry, a neural window, the sent command, and later telemetry. I obtained 109 frames: ten braked warmup frames and 99 moving frames. However, 95 moving inputs were saturated at +150. Steering was negative, heading error increased from about ten to 14.43 degrees, and a collision ended the run. Braking was requested, but no later telemetry verified stationarity. The chain works; its semantics and timing need diagnosis.","title_zh":"把测得车头误差接到模型，再把输出接回车","id":"step-018"},{"title_en":"A restarted loop records no complete frames","zh":"重开耦合时，一次运行在等待新鲜车辆遥测处停止。记录包含“No fresh vehicle telemetry before 截止时间”，完整帧数为零，最后制动请求有记录。仅凭清单不能进一步指定网络或模拟器调度根因。这次失败保留为工程停止点，不能拿前后其他运行的画面填成它的数据。随后修正入口版本，另开一个短5秒运行检查记录链是否恢复。","en":"One restarted coupled run stops while waiting for fresh vehicle telemetry. Its manifest records “No fresh vehicle telemetry before deadline,” zero complete frames, and a final brake request. The network or simulator scheduling cause remained unknown. This was an engineering stopping point, and it had no driving frames to display. I kept it separately and then use a new source revision for a short five-second run to check whether complete recording had recovered.","title_zh":"耦合重开时没有新鲜车辆遥测","id":"step-019","summary_en":"The restarted driving loop received no fresh vehicle data and saved no complete decision. The cause was unknown, so I kept it as a separate failed attempt.","summary_zh":"重启后的驾驶循环等不到新车辆数据，没有保存完整决策。原因未查明，这次失败单独记录。"},{"title_en":"A five-second follow-up restores complete recording","zh":"短运行使用新的入口版本，继续原来固定油门、目标车头线索和神经转向映射。它实际得到44个完整帧和143条遥测，场景请求与就绪都已发生，状态为探索性运行完成。这只验证短时接口又能形成记录，没有为这次运行另算驾驶性能表，也不借用首次运行的误差数值。之后同一方案被带到第二台Windows主机，检查实际可见行为。","en":"The short follow-up uses a new entry-point revision but retained the original fixed throttle, target-heading cue, and neural steering mapping. It produced 44 complete frames and 143 telemetry packets. The scene request and readiness sequence occur, and the manifest marks a completed exploratory run. This verified that short-form recording was working again. I did not attach another run’s heading-error numbers to it or treat completion as a driving-performance result. The same approach was then observed on the second Windows host.","title_zh":"用短运行检查耦合记录是否恢复","id":"step-020","summary_en":"A short follow-up restored complete camera–model–action recording. I then checked the same connection on another computer.","summary_zh":"短时补验重新保存了完整的相机、模型和动作记录。随后我在另一台计算机上检查同一接口。"},{"title_en":"The second host also shows weak steering and increasing error","zh":"第二主机这一轮仍使用目标车头线索，不使用相机控制。83个完整帧中，73个属于运动阶段；另有一个末尾命令没来得及形成完整帧。模型只有7个运动窗给出非零原始转向，都是−0.4；但平滑把负命令延续到72个窗。目标误差从9.992增到14.464度，最后碰撞。模型50毫秒窗的名义神经时间和车辆实际wall time也不同步：4.15秒神经过程对应约16.84秒记录时间。这里可以看见神经输出确实被发给车辆，同时也看见其幅度弱、方向不利和时钟差异。后来只取回76张图像，七张缺失应直接显示缺图。下一步转向真实相机输入与全部运动通道观察。","en":"On the second Windows host, the controller still uses the engineered target-heading cue rather than camera-based control. There were 83 complete frames, including 73 moving frames, plus one final command without a completed frame. Only seven moving neural windows produce nonzero raw yaw, all at −0.4. Smoothing carries negative steering into 72 windows. Heading error rose from 9.992 to 14.464 degrees before a collision. The clocks were also different: 4.15 seconds of neural evolution correspond to about 16.84 seconds on the recorded wall-time axis. This recording showed that neural output reached the vehicle, while also exposing weak amplitude, unfavorable direction, and asynchronous timing. Only 76 of 83 images were retrieved; missing frames remain missing. The next system version uses recorded camera input and observes the full motor readout.","title_zh":"第二台Windows机器复现了弱转向和碰撞","id":"step-021"},{"title_en":"The first actual-camera run is active internally but does not drive","zh":"真实相机输入第一次接入时，我把160×120的RGB图像转换成连续亮度，再按模型眼柱方向做投影采样。这一视野覆盖335个方向，占模型1769列的18.94%。未看见的方向保持原编码器历史，不被伪造成黑色。动作改为由神经的转向、前进、后退和停止通道决定，不再强加固定前进。83个50毫秒窗口中，网络产生1,112,088个全网脉冲，但21个原始与解码motor通道全零。预热后的73帧动作全零，位置也不变。这个结果不是相机没接上：每窗都有实际亮度。它说明当前配置的被选运动读出没有形成驱动车辆的信号。下一步加中间视觉群测量，看看活动在哪些层存在。","en":"When recorded camera input first enters the model, I converted each 160-by-120 RGB image into continuous brightness and sample it along the model’s eye-column directions. This view covers 335 of 1,769 columns, or 18.94 percent. Unobserved directions retain the encoder’s history; they were not fabricated as black pixels. Vehicle commands now come from neural turning, forward, backward, and stopping channels, without imposed forward throttle. Across 83 fifty-millisecond windows, the model produced 1,112,088 whole-network spikes. Yet all 21 raw and decoded motor channels remain zero. All 73 post-warmup command frames were zero, and position stays unchanged. The camera was connected: every window contained sampled brightness. The specific failure was that the chosen motor interface produced no driving signal. I next added intermediate visual-population measurements.","title_zh":"第一次让真实画面进模型，但车没有动作","id":"step-022"},{"title_en":"Intermediate recordings separate early activity from silent motor output","zh":"第二次相机观察主要增加测量，没有训练或调增益。84个窗里，全网仍有1,125,568个脉冲，但21个motor通道和74个预热后命令仍为零。新记录让我看得更具体：感光与L1、L2、L3群有活动；Mi1的2225个脉冲和T4的521个脉冲只出现在最初一两个窗，T5与选定LC/LPLC群为零。L3还呈左静右动的不对称。大量感光脉冲来自与未采样历史列关联的成员，所以不能把全网总数都算成这张相机造成的反应。单纯再等wall time不会教会固定模型开车。下一阶段因此使用明确的感觉条件、足够的神经时间和对照组，系统测响应与撤除。","en":"The second camera observation mainly adds measurements. I did not train the network or increase its gain. Across 84 windows, there were 1,125,568 whole-network spikes, but all 21 motor channels and all 74 post-warmup commands remain zero. The added records locate activity more precisely. Photoreceptor and L1, L2, and L3 groups were active. The 2,225 Mi1 spikes and 521 T4 spikes occur only in the first one or two windows. T5 and the selected LC/LPLC groups remain at zero. L3 was also asymmetric between sides. Many photoreceptor spikes belong to members associated with unsampled history columns, so the global count cannot all be attributed to the camera. Waiting longer in wall time did not train this fixed model. I therefore moved to controlled sensory conditions with explicit neural durations and matched controls.","title_zh":"加入中间测量后，活动在哪里停止","id":"step-023"},{"title_en":"The long sensory screen stops with resource failures","zh":"相机观察没有运动输出后，我扩大到已有感觉入口的系统筛查。原计划31种条件、三个种子，共93次；每次用新Java进程，内部连续跑30秒基线、60秒刺激和90秒恢复，时间都是神经时间。这个长设计是为了看慢响应、方向差和撤除后的持续状态。实际只完成42次，49次记录失败，一条旧状态仍写运行中，另一条未开始。主机重启后已经没有实验进程；旧运行条目也有明确内存错误。49次失败中31次能确认Windows提交内存不足，另18次的有限日志不支持统一归因。完成结果保留，失败和未完成不当作零响应。后来新增资源错误停止队列的保护，而不是重启整个93次计划。","en":"The camera observations motivated a systematic screen of the supported sensory inputs. The original plan contained 31 conditions and three seeds, or 93 trials. Each fresh Java process ran 30 seconds of baseline, 60 seconds of stimulation, and 90 seconds of recovery in neural time. The longer exposure was intended to reveal slow responses and persistent states. In practice, only 42 trials completed. Forty-nine were marked failed, one stale entry was still labelled running, and one never started. After the host rebooted, no experiment process remained. Thirty-one of the 49 failures had explicit Windows memory-commit errors; the available excerpts did not establish one cause for the other 18. I kept completed results and missing outcomes separately, added a resource-error queue stop, and did not restart the whole matrix.","title_zh":"延长神经时间并系统检查可用感觉入口","id":"step-024"},{"title_en":"Independent CPU queues complete the priority long-screen conditions","zh":"为了更快覆盖优先条件，我在内存更充足的远程计算机上启动四个独立CPU队列。每个试验仍只有一个神经积分线程，GPU虽在机器里，却没有用于这套Java计算。12种条件各三个原种子，共36次，保持30/60/90秒阶段。它们全部完成，没有记录失败。倾斜标量刺激时，brake读出的均值约0.201到0.203，撤除后降到约0.006，但腿和翼读出在90秒恢复末端仍有活动。这里的tilt是双侧共享标量，不是带符号的姿态角。结果提供了具体输入和输出关联，也暴露长尾状态。下一步缩小到looming强度、tilt幅度和接地，做更有针对性的比较。","en":"To cover priority conditions faster, I used four independent CPU queues on remote workstation, which had more available memory. Each neural trial still had one integration thread. The installed GPUs were not used by this Java backend. Twelve conditions receive the same three technical seeds, giving 36 trials with the original 30/60/90-second phases. All complete without recorded failures. During the tilt-scalar stimulus, the brake readout averages about 0.201 to 0.203, falling to roughly 0.006 during recovery. Leg and wing readouts could remain active at the end of the 90-second recovery. The tilt input was a shared bilateral scalar, not a signed posture angle. These observations identify responsive interfaces and long-lived states, motivating a narrower contrast, tilt-amplitude, and ground-contact screen.","title_zh":"用更充足内存并行测量优先感觉条件","id":"step-025"},{"title_en":"A small CPU screen also remains incomplete","zh":"这一段必须保留，因为它确实发生过。当时我在笔记本电脑上另做六个无车辆、无训练的CPU感觉试验：恒亮对照及左右小对象，各两个新种子，两队列运行。三次完整有效，两次流分别停在118.4和124.4秒神经时间，另一次没有开始。稍后的进程检查已没有Java或筛查程序，但两个中断记录的错误文件都为空，原因未确定。我没有把它们算成无反应，也没有仅凭机器内存猜成同一种资源错误。它和其他主机种子、负载不同，不能据此给CPU排速度名次。随后终止这个不完整批次，后续集中到远程计算机的定点短比较。","en":"I also ran six sensory trials on my laptop CPU, without a car: constant-vision control and left and right small objects, each with two new seeds. There was no vehicle or training. Three trials finished validly. Two streams stop at 118.4 and 124.4 neural seconds, and one trial never starts. A later process check finds no Java or screen runner, while the interrupted trials’ error files were empty. Their cause remained unknown. I did not count them as zero responses or assign the same memory explanation without evidence. Different seeds and workloads also prevent a fair CPU-speed ranking. The incomplete batch ended, and the next focused comparison uses remote workstation.","title_zh":"当时授权的本机CPU小批次也留下了不完整记录","id":"step-026"},{"title_en":"A targeted short screen exposes asymmetry and readout saturation","zh":"长筛查已有响应后，我不再把所有感觉模态重做一遍，而是挑出三个具体问题。looming左右在弱刺激时是否对称？强刺激为何到平台？倾斜幅度与制动是否单调？新设计12种条件、三个新种子，每次10秒基线、10秒刺激、20秒恢复，36次在约25分钟内全部完成。弱looming明显左右不对称，高对比的flightYaw到平台，tilt的brake变化并不单调，恢复还有种子差。继续只读原流发现，平台可以定位到单个DNp03神经元的50赫兹归一化上限；底层rate仍在变化。因此下一步补低强度和更长恢复，并保留原读出与共同300赫兹尺度的离线候选。","en":"Once the long screen identifies responsive inputs, I did not repeat every sensory modality. I focused on three questions: weak looming asymmetry, the plateau under strong stimulation, and the nonmonotonic tilt–brake relationship. Twelve conditions and three new seeds use 10 seconds of baseline, ten of stimulation, and 20 of recovery. All 36 trials completed in about 25 minutes. Weak looming was clearly asymmetric between sides. Strong flight-yaw output reached a plateau. Tilt-dependent braking was nonmonotonic, with persistent or seed-dependent recovery. A later inspection locates the plateau in the decoder’s 50-hertz normalization of a single DNp03 neuron; underlying rates still vary. I therefore added lower contrasts and longer recovery, preserving the original readout alongside a fixed common-scale offline comparison.","title_zh":"缩小问题：looming强度、tilt幅度、接地如何改变输出","id":"step-027"},{"title_en":"Lower contrasts and longer recovery separate different output tails","zh":"这一轮只补前一轮留下的缺口。左右looming增加0.05和0.20对比度，保留部分原条件与倾斜组，把恢复从20延到60秒，共13条件、三种子，39次全部完成。重复的27条记录在共同前40秒逐项一致，说明这次延长有真实可比前缀。不同输出不能混在一起说：某些制动、翼或转向通道到60秒末仍有活动，而共同尺度DNp03候选在18个有响应的looming试验中，13个撤除后完全为零，另外五个只在头50毫秒非零。这不是把整个模型宣布恢复，而是分开识别了读出长尾。随后重点转到短事件、换侧和重复事件的时序。","en":"This follow-up addresses specific gaps from the short screen. I added looming contrasts 0.05 and 0.20 on both sides, retain selected earlier conditions and tilt inputs, and extend recovery from 20 to 60 seconds. All 39 trials completed. The 27 repeated recordings have identical scientific prefixes over their common first 40 seconds. Different outputs behave differently: selected brake, wing, or yaw channels remain active at the 60-second endpoint. In contrast, among 18 looming trials with an active common-scale DNp03 signal, 13 have zero output throughout recovery and five have only one nonzero initial 50-millisecond window. This separates a particular steering readout’s release from persistent activity elsewhere. The next question was temporal: could the responsive path follow short, repeated, and reversed events?","title_zh":"低强度到饱和之间怎样过渡，60秒后是否恢复","id":"step-028"},{"title_en":"The analytic flight-yaw path follows short and reversed pulses","zh":"十秒恒刺激不能说明模型能跟随短事件。因此这一轮使用九种事件安排和三个新种子：单个1秒或250毫秒脉冲、同侧两次，以及左右反转，每次从新网络开始，事件之间保留状态。27次全部完成，共36个脉冲。原始flightYaw与共同尺度DNp03候选在每个被记录的脉冲窗都给出规定侧别的符号，首个连续三个正确符号窗落在0到150毫秒。撤除后的连续三个零窗，26次立即出现，10次延50毫秒，观察间隙没有后续反弹。不过brake和wing仍可能在末端持续。这里证明的是解析特征入口到特定读出的时序能力。下一步要查真实图像亮度能不能进入同样有效的路径。","en":"A ten-second constant stimulus cannot show whether the model could follow brief events. I then used nine schedules and three new seeds: one-second or 250-millisecond pulses, repeated same-side pulses, and left–right reversals. Each trial starts fresh, while internal state continued through the events and gaps. All 27 trials completed, containing 36 pulses. Original raw flight yaw and the fixed common-scale DNp03 candidate have the specified sign in every recorded pulse window. The first block of three correctly signed windows fell within zero to 150 neural milliseconds. Three-zero release blocks begin immediately in 26 events and after 50 milliseconds in ten, with no later rebound in the observed gaps. Other brake and wing outputs could still persist. I next tested whether recorded retinal images access a similarly useful path.","title_zh":"短事件和反向事件能否被逐次追随","id":"step-029"},{"title_en":"An empty protocol object stops camera capture before configuration","zh":"为了核对视野，我先抓不同相机方向的真实图像。第一回模拟器已在场景内，探针收到一个精确的空JSON对象后停止，3.26秒内没有发送相机配置，也没有接受图像。修复只把这种精确空对象作为保留字节的未知空操作，其余缺消息类型的对象仍报错。这个窄改动经过离线检查后，另开一次拍摄，不把失败轮当成已经验证视角。","en":"Before deciding how much visual field was available, I tried to capture recorded views. The first attempt reached an already loaded scene and stops on an exact empty JSON object. In 3.26 seconds, it sent no camera configuration and accepts no image. I made a narrow repair: retain exact empty objects as unclassified no-ops, while other missing-type objects remain errors. After offline checks, a new capture attempt began. The failed attempt itself supplied no evidence about camera geometry.","title_zh":"相机视角抓取先被空协议对象挡住","id":"step-030","summary_en":"An empty message stopped image capture before camera setup. I allowed that empty message to pass without treating other malformed messages as valid.","summary_zh":"一条空消息使程序在相机配置前停止。我让这种空消息直接略过，同时继续拒绝其他格式错误。"},{"title_en":"Actual wider, side, and rear views are captured","zh":"第二次拍摄完成八组请求，每组三张160×120图像：前方60、100、120度视野，左右侧、后方A、后方B，以及回到前方。车辆位置只有极小漂移，图像却随配置明显改变；后方A和B相同，不能由此编造立体深度。最后旧前视帧与首张回前方帧逐字节一致，也有更早前帧的细小差异。后视下部可见车体遮挡。它说明协议确实送来不同视图，但没有独立标定准确角度或投影。后续只使用已知前视的真实帧和明确投影假设，做图像与均值亮度控制，不把多视角拼成一次不存在的全景输入。","en":"The second capture completed eight requested configurations, with three 160-by-120 images each: front views at vertical fields of view 60, 100, and 120 degrees; both sides; rear cameras A and B; and a return to the front. Vehicle drift was tiny, while image content changes substantially with configuration. Rear A and B contain matching images. The last initial front image and first return image match byte for byte, although earlier front frames differ slightly. The vehicle body also occludes part of the rear view. I have recorded evidence that the protocol delivers different views, but not an independent angular calibration. The next comparison uses verified front images and explicit projection assumptions, without stitching an invented panoramic input.","title_zh":"记录前、侧、后和宽FOV的实际画面","id":"step-031","summary_en":"The simulator delivered front, side and rear images. I used these saved views to plan input coverage without inventing a panoramic camera.","summary_zh":"模拟器确实送来了前方、侧方和后方画面。我据此检查视觉覆盖，没有把这些画面拼成一次并不存在的全景输入。"},{"title_en":"Retinal brightness and analytic features behave very differently","zh":"现在把两种输入层真正分开比较。99次试验包含完整、当前335列和宽817列覆盖下的扩张、静态、收缩亮度图案，以及解析特征和匹配静态对照。每个事件实际持续两秒，之后观察22秒。60次扩张和9次静态事件的21个原始motor通道都为零。收缩只给出少量起飞读出。扩张撤除后，19次出现稀疏运动通道瞬态；全部retinal试验的flightYaw仍为零。相反，12次解析特征试验都在事件内产生motor输出。扩大视野没有自动解决转向，输入层级差异也不能略过。下一步读取已有早期视觉时间窗，区分刺激出现与亮度恢复，再进行真实相机对照。","en":"I then compared the input levels directly. The 99 trials include expanding, static, and interface requirementsing retinal-brightness patterns under full, current 335-column, and wider 817-column coverage, plus analytic features and matched quiet controls. Each event lasted two seconds, followed by 22 seconds of observation. All 60 expansion and nine static events have zero output on all 21 original raw motor channels. Contraction produced only sparse takeoff readout. After expansion was removed, 19 trials show brief motor-channel events. Retinal flight yaw remained zero throughout these trials. In contrast, all 12 analytic-feature trials produce event motor output. Simply widening coverage did not solve turning. I next inspected existing early visual time bins, separating stimulus presentation from brightness restoration before comparing real camera images with controls.","title_zh":"换成真正的retinal亮度图案后，先前方向反应还在吗","id":"step-032"},{"title_en":"Restoring brightness explains why event averages can mislead","zh":"这一步不再运行模型，只读前面36条已选记录的更细时间窗。原先四秒刺激阶段里，前两秒是图案，后两秒已经恢复亮度，直接平均会混淆两种事件。按实际起始与恢复重新对齐后，扩张时L1和感光群已变化，但Mi1和T4主要在亮度恢复后短暂出现。例如中央扩张恢复后的头250毫秒，三个种子的Mi1脉冲约2147到2215，T4约527到570。T5在导出的全部时间窗仍为零。这个时序与现有工程化ON输入相容，却还没有证明一条完整生物串行通路。接下来才用真实held相机图与同均值亮度比较。","en":"This step reads existing records rather than running the model again. In the previous four-second stimulus phase, the image event occupied only the first two seconds; brightness had already been restored in the next two. Averaging them together mixed different interventions. I therefore align 36 selected recordings to recorded onset and restoration. Photoreceptor and L1 activity already change during expansion, while much of the Mi1 and T4 response appears just after brightness returns. For center expansion, the first 250 milliseconds after restoration contain about 2,147 to 2,215 Mi1 spikes and 527 to 570 T4 spikes across seeds. T5 remained zero in the exported bins. This refines the input-timing interpretation and supported the planned real-image versus mean-brightness comparison.","title_zh":"把视觉起始和恢复亮度分开，避免把撤除反应说成事件反应","id":"step-033","summary_en":"Averaging over the whole stimulus phase had mixed stimulation with brightness restoration. Aligning the saved records showed when the visual responses occurred.","summary_zh":"原来的整段平均值混合了刺激和恢复亮度两个阶段。我重新对齐保存记录，才看清视觉反应发生在何时。"},{"title_en":"A real image changes visual activity beyond its mean brightness","zh":"真实相机比较选择两个前视覆盖，每个分别给中性亮度、固定真实图像和该图像采样列的平均亮度，共六条件、三个新种子。没有车辆，也没有自转或对象特征。18次都完成，108个记录文件的哈希和重新生成摘要得到检查。真实图像与同均值均匀输入产生不同的视觉活动，而原始motor输出主要是出现或撤除时的稀疏瞬态。它确认图像分布携带的变化进入了被测视觉记录，但原motor接口仍没有稳定转向。于是主方向从等待原生动作反射，转为保留固定核心、学习一个明确的外部动作读出；在拟合之前先检查车辆时间、动作和重置。","en":"The real-image comparison uses two front-view coverage masks. For each, I present neutral brightness, a held recorded image, or a uniform field with the same sampled-column mean. Six conditions and three new seeds give 18 trials. There was no vehicle, self-rotation cue, or analytic object feature. All trials finished, and 108 record hashes and regenerated summaries were checked. The held images produce visual activity different from their mean-brightness controls. Original motor output remained sparse, mainly around presentation or removal. This confirmed that image content beyond its mean reached the recorded visual measurements, while the original motor interface still lacks sustained useful turning. I therefore moved toward an explicit learned external action readout, after checking the vehicle’s action, timing, and reset interface requirements.","title_zh":"一张真实图像与同均值均匀亮度有什么差别","id":"step-034"},{"title_en":"Acceleration and braking work, but the first reset rule rejects a real return","zh":"学习环境不能只接收图像，还要可靠开始下一局。第一组动作探针先完成正油门、滑行和制动：速度从约0.000394升到0.210886，中性后仍有0.173192，全制动后降到约3×10⁻⁷。但重置验收要求位置跳动至少0.5，实际返回只有0.30713，所以后面的反向油门和转向没执行。记录还显示返回后的姿态与前次重置位置相同。这里暴露的是过大的工程门槛。我保留失败，改成用同次运行实际观察到的参考起点、前后低速和新鲜遥测共同验证返回。","en":"A learning environment needed more than images: it must reliably start the next episode. The first action probe completed positive throttle, coasting, and braking. Speed rose from about 0.000394 to 0.210886, remained at 0.173192 after neutral throttle, and fell to roughly 3 × 10⁻⁷ after braking. The reset check then rejects a 0.30713-unit return because it required at least a 0.5-unit jump. The reverse and steering groups did not run. Since the returned pose matches the earlier reset pose, I kept the failed check and replace its overly large jump rule with an observed-reference check using fresh low-speed telemetry.","title_zh":"正油门、滑行、制动有效，但重置验收条件太大","id":"step-035","summary_en":"Acceleration and braking worked, but the reset test rejected a real return because it required too large a position jump. I revised that test.","summary_zh":"加速和刹车正常，重置检查却因要求的位置跳变过大，拒绝了一次真实返回。我随后修改检查方法。"},{"title_en":"The revised reset check confirms returns and completes action-sign measurements","zh":"修订后的起点规则不猜服务器是否收到重置，而是检查可见结果：车先离参考点至少0.05，重置后在新鲜低速遥测中回到0.01以内，朝向误差不超过1度。新运行完成三组动作和两次组间重置，总计约10.6秒。负油门−0.08产生沿初始车头反向的位移，中性后继续反向滑行；负转向使车头变化约−0.491度，轮角回零后方向不必恢复。动作和起点返回现已可测。下一步把两个动作轴连续变化，与真实相机和神经测量共同记录。","en":"The revised start rule checks an observable return rather than assuming a reset acknowledgement. The vehicle must first be displaced by at least 0.05 units, then return within 0.01 of the same-run reference with fresh low-speed telemetry and at most one degree of yaw error. The new invocation completed all three action groups and both inter-group resets in about 10.6 seconds. Negative throttle produced reverse displacement, followed by further reverse coasting. Negative steering changes yaw by approximately −0.491 degrees, while wheel centering did not restore heading. I could then test continuous joint actions alongside camera and neural recordings.","title_zh":"用实际参考起点核对重置，并测负油门与转向","id":"step-036","summary_en":"The revised reset test confirmed returns to the measured start and completed the action-sign checks. I could next test continuous actions.","summary_zh":"修改后的检查确认车辆回到实测起点，也完成了动作方向测试。下一步开始检查连续动作。"},{"title_en":"Continuous two-axis actions reveal a route-measurement problem","zh":"这一轮让转向和油门按明确时间表连续变化，同时记录相机、固定核心输出和车辆遥测。神经输出只是旁路观察，不负责发命令；规定动作也不当老师标签。正先和负先两局分别完成74和72个transition，所有动作阶段走完，最后都观测到低速。完整接收间隔平均约209毫秒，也就是每秒4.8次决策，而神经窗仍代表50毫秒，二者异步。新的问题出在路线字段：CTE大幅变化、节点索引跳跃，与位置位移不在同一个直观尺度。如果直接拿这些字段奖励学习，可能把错误跳跃当进步。因此先审计模拟器的路线定义，再设计几何老师和奖励。","en":"This pilot varies steering and forward throttle continuously while recording the camera, fixed-core output, and vehicle telemetry. Neural output was observed in shadow mode; the prescribed schedule drives the car and was not treated as expert labels. The positive-first and negative-first episodes complete 74 and 72 transitions. All phases finish, and low final speeds were observed. The average full receive-to-receive interval was about 209 milliseconds, or 4.8 decisions per second, while each neural window still represented 50 milliseconds. A new problem appears in the route fields: large CTE changes and node-index jumps did not have an obvious relationship to position changes. Before using them as rewards or teacher targets, I audit the recorded simulator geometry and its measurement rules.","title_zh":"相机、神经测量与两个动作轴能否持续同步记录","id":"step-037","summary_en":"Continuous actions exposed jumps in the reported route measurements. I checked how the simulator measured the route before using those values as rewards.","summary_zh":"连续动作测试暴露了路线读数的跳变。我先检查模拟器怎样测量路线，再决定能否把这些值用于奖励。"},{"title_en":"Export the actual route before building progress rewards","zh":"源码审计解释了尺度差：车辆位置、速度已除以8，导出节点和CTE没有；CTE还使用前一个跟踪跨度的无限直线，节点索引可能已到下一段。随后在制动状态逐个读取259个实际路径节点，不重试请求，得到42.929个未标定单位的开放折线。用旧轨迹重算时，原CTE可以精确重建，但全局最近段会在很小位移时跳出约4或6个弧长单位。新的局部关联因此保留上一个有效弧位置，限制可达位移、时间和方向。相邻平缓连接的并列投影可明确处理，真正远段跳跃仍拒绝。这样定义的几何进度才能用来做老师和奖励，不能简单奖励节点增加。","en":"The source audit explains the scale mismatch. Telemetry position and speed were divided by eight, while exported nodes and CTE were not. CTE also uses the previous tracked infinite line, whereas the packet may already carry the next node index. I then queried all 259 recorded path nodes once while braking, obtaining an open 42.929-unit polyline. Reanalysis reconstructs the original CTE accurately, but an unchecked global nearest segment could jump four or six arc units after a tiny vehicle displacement. I therefore built local association around the previous valid arc position, constrained by elapsed time, reachable movement, and heading. Ordinary adjacent gentle joins were handled explicitly, while distant jumps remain rejected. This provided a defensible basis for geometric teacher targets and progress rewards.","title_zh":"先弄清路线坐标，再定义老师和奖励","id":"step-038","summary_en":"Position and route measurements used different scales, and the nearest route segment could jump. I built a local route match that followed the car's recent position.","summary_zh":"车辆位置和路线读数使用不同尺度，最近路段还会突然跳变。我改为结合车辆上一位置，在附近寻找连续匹配的路段。"},{"title_en":"A disclosed geometric teacher supplies real action examples","zh":"有了实际路线，才能建立一个公开说明的老师。它查看车辆位置和路线，取前方0.6单位目标，按车头误差产生转向，再按弯曲程度和速度调整油门，必要时制动。相机被保存，但老师不用相机认路。这个有界试验实际运动25.04秒，101次老师决策都有唯一有效的局部路线关联，转向两个方向都用到。实际命令可由记录精确重建，制动后的末速度约6.58×10⁻⁷。这里建立的是数据生成器和工程参照。下一步先把同一轨迹的命令前图像按序送进固定神经核心，核对特征与标签时间，之后才扩大数据和拟合。","en":"With the recorded route available, I could define a disclosed geometric teacher. It reads vehicle pose and route geometry, aims 0.6 units ahead, converted heading error into steering, and adjusts throttle according to speed and turning demand. It could also request braking. Camera images were saved, but they did not determine the teacher’s actions. The bounded pilot moves for 25.04 seconds and records 101 teacher decisions with unique valid local associations. Both steering signs occur. The commands reconstruct exactly from the records, and braking reduces final speed to about 6.58 × 10⁻⁷. This establishes a data generator and engineering reference, not neural driving. I next replayed its before-command images through the fixed core to check feature and label alignment.","title_zh":"一个明确的几何老师能否连续走路并停下","id":"step-039","summary_en":"A controller using route geometry supplied steering examples and completed a short collection run. These actions came from the geometric teacher, before neural driving.","summary_zh":"我用读取路线几何的控制器采集转向示例，完成了短时采集。此时开车的是几何教师，还不是神经模型。"},{"title_en":"The first feature cache uses real images, but compressed neural time","zh":"先做小规模缓存检查，是为了避免大批拟合后才发现时间或标签泄漏。我只回放既有的104张命令前图像，固定核心每张推进50毫秒，老师动作另放标签文件。生成38项下降/运动测量或62项视觉加下降测量，并保留四窗历史。全部回放闭合，但这里5.2秒神经时间对应原轨迹约25秒运动，是明确的时间压缩试验。符合标签条件的窗口中，motor的32项rate都为零，只有三项膜电位变化；更广视觉集合有21项变化。因此下一轮选明确的密集50毫秒时间关系，采整段独立轨迹，不把这次压缩缓存直接包装成正式训练集。","en":"I started with a small cache check so that timing or label leakage did not remain hidden until after a large fit. I replayed the existing 104 before-command images through a fixed core, advancing 50 neural milliseconds per image. Teacher actions remain in a separate label file. The cache contained either 38 descending/motor measurements or 62 visual-plus-descending measurements, with four-window histories. All images and protocol closure were retained. However, 5.2 seconds of neural evolution represent roughly 25 seconds of recorded movement, so this was explicitly compressed time. At eligible label windows, all 32 motor-rate terms were zero and only three membrane features vary; the broader visual set had 21 varying features. The next round used a specified dense time relationship and whole independent trajectories.","title_zh":"把同一次老师驾驶的相机记录按顺序送入固定核心","id":"step-040","summary_en":"The first feature cache matched images to teacher actions, but advanced neural time faster than recorded driving time. The next cache needed an explicit time match.","summary_zh":"首批特征缓存对齐了图像和教师动作，但神经时间比原驾驶时间压缩得多。下一轮需要明确两者的时间关系。"},{"title_en":"External readouts predict actions, with a large gap between representations","zh":"正式离线读出轮采集12条完整老师轨迹，按整段分成8训练、2验证和2测试，避免把相邻帧随机分到两边。固定神经核心密集回放25,968个真实相机窗，只有外部线性读出学习转向和油门。总共5108个有效标签。两个独立测试轨迹上，恒定均值的转向误差为0.287869，下降/运动历史为0.288148，视觉加下降为0.235526，直接视网膜历史为0.012348。视觉神经表示比常数好，motor-only没有改善，直接相机采样强得多。这还是同一路线上的动作预测，车尚未由新读出驾驶。下一步优先查已记录的信息到底在哪些特征里变化，而不是立即再扫刺激或扩大训练。","en":"The full offline round collected 12 teacher trajectories and split whole trajectories into eight for training, two for validation, and two for testing. Neighboring frames were not randomly split across sets. The fixed neural core replayed 25,968 recorded camera windows, while only an external linear readout learned steering and throttle. There were 5,108 eligible labels. On the two held-out trajectories, steering mean absolute error (MAE: the average size of a prediction error) was 0.287869 for a constant mean, 0.288148 for descending/motor history, 0.235526 for visual-plus-descending history, and 0.012348 for direct retinal history. The broader neural representation beat a constant, while motor-only did not; the direct sensory comparator was much stronger. This was action prediction on one route, not learned driving. I next audited the existing representation before collecting more data.","title_zh":"固定核心的输出能否预测连续老师动作","id":"step-041"},{"title_en":"Inspect which measured columns carry variation","zh":"信息审计只读取原训练与验证记录，没有新神经运行，也不打开测试轨迹。21,633个密集窗和4258个候选动作历史显示，motor集合的128项赫兹历史列全部为零，原来留下的五项其实是DNa02膜电位。另一方面T4有大量脉冲，只是当时的空间注释无法把这些成员分配到眼柱。未关联不等于没活动。视网膜线性读出的较强贡献集中在前下方向，但这也只是冻结模型的项分解，不是因果重要性。这些具体结果决定下一步：保留原有62个测量，追加固定方位分区，不删掉那些有活动却没有空间注释的群。","en":"This audit reads only existing training and validation records. It runs no neural simulation and did not open the test trajectories. Across 21,633 dense windows and 4,258 candidate-action histories, all 128 hertz-valued motor-history columns were zero. The five retained motor features were actually DNa02 membrane-voltage histories. In contrast, T4 had substantial recorded spikes, but the available spatial annotations cannot assign its members to retinal sectors. Unassociated was therefore different from inactive. The fixed-weight direct-image model’s stronger terms were grouped in front and lower directions, although this decomposition was not a causal importance test. These findings determine the next instrumentation change: preserve all 62 original measurements and append fixed spatial sectors, rather than deleting active but unmapped populations.","title_zh":"到底哪些特征有变化，空间信息在哪里丢失","id":"step-042","summary_en":"Most motor-rate features stayed zero, while some visual signals varied but lacked spatial labels. I added measurements instead of treating missing labels as silence.","summary_zh":"多数运动放电率特征始终为零；部分视觉信号有变化，只是缺少位置注释。我增加测量，没有把位置缺失当成神经元沉默。"},{"title_en":"Spatial neural measurements improve validation prediction","zh":"追加空间测量后，每窗由62项变成190项，四窗历史共760槽位。每次回放都核对原输入和旧观测逐窗不变，十条训练与验证轨迹全部通过。这样可以把新增信息与意外改动核心分开。三个固定ridge候选只在原验证轨迹上选参数，旧测试不再打开。新增读出转向误差为0.180148，比原聚合神经表示0.233993低约23%，但直接视网膜比较仍为0.013581。760个名义槽位里还有404项不可用，因此维度也不能当活跃神经元数。结果支持扩展测量接口，仍需要真实闭环驾驶。接下来先完成奖励、时间和重置验收，进入固定核心的外部强化学习。","en":"The expanded instrumentation increased each window from 62 to 190 measurements, or 760 history slots over four windows. All ten training and validation replays preserve the original inputs and observables exactly under the specified timing exclusions. This separates new measurements from accidental changes to the core. Three fixed ridge candidates were selected only on the existing validation trajectories; the old test remained closed. The appended neural representation reached steering MAE 0.180148, about 23 percent below the aggregate neural value of 0.233993. The direct-image comparator was still much better at 0.013581. Of the nominal 760 slots, 404 were unavailable, so width was not an active-neuron count. I next needed a real learning environment with checked rewards, timing, resets, and closed-loop evaluation.","title_zh":"增加按方向分区的神经读出能否减少预测误差","id":"step-043"},{"title_en":"The first RL acceptance fails when a new client reuses a loaded scene","zh":"开始外部强化学习前，先用短运行验收实际采样、重置、运动和优化器。神经臂已经通过这些检查，也完成16次不计入正式训练的更新，但第二个新客户端连接同一个已加载模拟器时，没有获得可接受的相机帧。正式主训练还没开始。我把问题限定为生命周期依赖，改成每个验收臂和评估案例拥有独立模拟器，再验证整个入口。","en":"Before main reinforcement learning, short acceptance runs check real sampling, reset, movement, and optimizer operation. The neural arm passes and performs 16 excluded diagnostic updates. The next new client, however, received no accepted camera frames when it connects to the same already loaded simulator. Main training had not started. I kept this as a lifecycle failure and give each acceptance arm and evaluation case an independent simulator process before checking the complete entry path again.","title_zh":"RL验收第一臂通过，第二连接无相机","id":"step-044","summary_en":"The first learning check passed, but a second client could not collect images from the already loaded scene. I gave each test its own simulator process.","summary_zh":"第一个学习检查通过后，第二个客户端无法从已加载场景采图。我让每个测试分别启动模拟器进程。"},{"title_en":"Policy construction leaves the first camera observation stale","zh":"独立模拟器修正后，两种输入的验收都通过，但正式训练的第一步又被严格时钟拒绝。原因是策略构建用了3.49秒，缓存观测跨过了这个阶段，来源序号从10跳到24。我没有放宽有效动作时钟，而是把发现输入形状的客户端在构建前关闭，模型建好后再进行新学习重置。这使初始化耗时不会被伪装成一条正常训练transition。","en":"With independent simulator processes, both input-arm acceptance checks pass. The first main-training step still failed the strict clock check. Policy construction took 3.49 seconds, leaving a cached observation that jumps from source sequence ten to 24. I did not relax the action-clock limits. Instead, shape discovery closes before policy construction, followed by a fresh learning reset after the model was ready. Initialization time could no longer be mistaken for a valid training transition.","title_zh":"构建策略花费的时间使缓存相机过期","id":"step-045","summary_en":"Constructing the policy took long enough to make the first image stale. I reset the environment after construction and kept the timing limits unchanged.","summary_zh":"构建策略花费的时间使首张图像过期。我改为在构建完成后重置环境，保留原来的时钟限制。"},{"title_en":"Real SAC learning reaches a checkpoint before an episode-info collision","zh":"修复初始化后，第一次真实采样确实推进到1002步，1000步检查点保存了487次优化器更新。检查点在这里是一份可回到的训练快照，包含策略参数等状态，而不是一张表现截图。失败出现在第一个episode结束：我的整数episode编号与SB3保留的episode统计字典撞名。旧批次和权重保留，没有续写成成功。修复把审计编号改名，并让短验收真正走过Monitor、向量重置和日志记账，再启动新的正式批次。","en":"After the initialization repair, learning with soft actor-critic (SAC), which reuses driving experience to update an action policy and its reward estimates, reached 1,002 interactions. Its 1,000-step checkpoint recorded 487 optimizer updates. Here, a checkpoint was a saved training snapshot that let me identify or restore a policy; it was not a screenshot of performance. The run failed when the first episode ended: my integer episode identifier conflicted with SB3’s reserved episode-statistics dictionary. I kept the failed batch and its weights without resuming it as if it had succeeded. The repair renamed the audit field and made acceptance exercise recorded Monitor, vector-reset, and logging behavior before a fresh batch started.","title_zh":"第一次真实SAC学习在episode日志接口停止","id":"step-046"},{"title_en":"The neural SAC arm completes 20,000 steps, but the comparison stays partial","zh":"新的修正批次终于让固定核心神经臂完成20,000次交互和19,488次SAC更新。后面的直接视网膜臂只到1000次交互、488次更新，下一步因密集相机时钟错误停止；其余种子和计划评估没有执行。神经臂25个学习episode中，23个触发工程离允许的路线范围，一个到时间限制，最后一个在样本预算结束时未完。训练早晚的前进量增加了，但末1000步仍有五次包络终止，不能把更快离开路线称为车道保持改善。这是实际训练成果加一项不完整比较。后续要用固定权重独立评估，并解决时钟，而不是把20,000对1000直接排成绩。","en":"The corrected batch finally completed 20,000 interactions and 19,488 SAC updates in the fixed-core neural arm. The direct-image arm then stops after 1,000 interactions and 488 updates when its next interval failed the dense-camera clock check. Remaining seeds and the planned evaluations did not run. In the neural arm, 23 of 25 observed learning episodes end at the route-distance stopping limit, one reached a time limit, and the final episode remained incomplete at the sample budget. Later training collected more forward progress, but the last thousand steps still contain five envelope endings. Faster departure was not better lane keeping. This was a completed neural learner inside a partial comparison. I needed separate fixed-weight policy evaluation and timing diagnosis rather than ranking unequal completed budgets.","title_zh":"修正日志后，neural SAC完成2万步，retinal随后时钟失败","id":"step-047"},{"title_en":"Roihu starts with a CPU portability check","zh":"迁移到Roihu先不启动驾驶和学习，而是单独检验原Java核心在Linux上能不能加载、交换数据并正常关闭。作业2049510在CPU节点运行六秒，两个全新Java进程各走16个合成亮度窗，除计算耗时外的稳定输出字段完全一致。这个结果解决了数据、运行时和协议移植问题。合成输入没有真实相机，也没有证明Windows与Linux驾驶等价。下一步才申请适合现有Linux模拟器的x86 L40图形节点；主计算节点的ARM架构不能直接替代它。","en":"The Roihu migration began without driving or learning. Job 2049510 checks whether the existing Java core loads on Linux, exchanges data, and closes its protocol. On a CPU node, two fresh Java processes each complete 16 synthetic-brightness windows in a six-second allocation. Stable step and closing fields match exactly after excluding compute time. This resolves basic runtime, data, and protocol portability. Synthetic input was not camera or driving evidence. I next needed an x86 L40 graphics allocation compatible with the Linux simulator.","title_zh":"G0 CPU作业：先证明Linux固定核心能加载并关闭协议","id":"step-048","summary_en":"The existing Java model ran on Roihu's Linux CPU and exchanged data correctly. The next step was preparing graphics for the simulator.","summary_zh":"已有 Java 模型在 Roihu 的 Linux CPU 上成功运行并交换数据。下一步是为模拟器准备图形环境。"},{"title_en":"The first GPU job confuses scheduler and visible device indices","zh":"第一次GPU验收只运行一秒，还没有开模拟器。作业2049789里，调度器记录分配编号1，但作业内可见的NVML设备编号是0，CUDA可见编号也是0。入口拿1去查，得到找不到设备就停止。图形依赖还有缺项，但首个实际触发点是编号映射。修复优先用UUID和PCI识别真实分配设备，再准备图形环境，不能把它说成模型或驾驶失败。","en":"The first GPU acceptance runs for one allocated second and never launches the simulator. In job 2049789, Slurm records global GPU index one, but the job-visible NVML inventory and CUDA environment expose index zero. Querying one returns no device, and the guard stops. Graphics tools were also missing, but device identity was the first recorded failure. I repaired identity mapping using UUID and PCI information before preparing rendering. This was neither a neural-model nor a driving failure.","title_zh":"GPU验收r1：GPU编号命名空间不一致，尚未启动模拟器","id":"step-049","summary_en":"The first GPU check used the scheduler's device number inside a differently numbered environment. I changed the check to identify the allocated hardware directly.","summary_zh":"首次 GPU 检查把调度器编号当成运行环境内编号，因而找不到设备。我改为直接核对所分配硬件的身份。"},{"title_en":"Device identity passes, but the renderer still fails","zh":"第二次作业2050459已能确认GPU身份，也启动Xvfb，但VirtualGL和glxinfo在EGL设备处失败，留下Mesa、DRM权限等错误。五秒后作业结束，Unity和学习都没启动。此时尚不能指定唯一driver或权限根因。后续只读审计找到路径比较的具体问题，并检查CSC官方图形容器；下一轮把这些修正作为单独版本验证。","en":"Job 2050459 passes the corrected GPU identity check and starts Xvfb, but VirtualGL and glxinfo fail at EGL rendering. Mesa warnings and DRM-access errors were retained. The allocation ended after five seconds, before Unity or learning starts. The underlying driver or permission cause remained unknown. A later source audit finds a concrete path-comparison issue and inspects CSC’s official graphics container. Those changes were tested together in a separate revision.","title_zh":"GPU验收r2：设备找到，EGL渲染未过","id":"step-050","summary_en":"The corrected device check passed, but graphics initialization failed. I inspected the rendering path and official container before another attempt.","summary_zh":"设备身份检查修好后，图形初始化仍失败。我检查渲染路径和官方容器，再进行下一次尝试。"},{"title_en":"The official graphics container produces real camera frames","zh":"第三次使用实际DRM规范路径和CSC已有的图形容器。作业2051461运行十秒，glxinfo和Unity都报告NVIDIA L40，场景请求后收到21条遥测，其中末20张连续160×120图像满足低速要求。真实图像有纹理与道路标记，说明渲染和相机链可用。两项修正一起成功，不能分别断定哪一项单独解决了前次问题。所有命令仍为制动状态。接着要测真实转向、滑行、制动和返回起点，而不是直接跳到学习。","en":"The third acceptance uses the canonical DRM path and CSC’s existing graphics container. Job 2051461 runs for ten seconds. Both glxinfo and Unity report NVIDIA L40, and 21 telemetry messages arrive after the scene request. The final twenty consecutive 160-by-120 images meet the low-speed criterion. Real texture and markings verify rendering and camera delivery. The path and container changes work together; their separate contributions were not isolated. Commands remain fully braked. The next check measures motion, braking, turning, and reset before learning.","title_zh":"GPU验收r3：官方图形容器与正确DRM路径给出真实图像","id":"step-051","summary_en":"The official graphics container produced real camera frames on the allocated GPU. I could next test vehicle motion and reset on Linux.","summary_zh":"官方图形容器终于在分配的 GPU 上生成真实相机帧。接下来可以在 Linux 上测量车辆动作和重置。"},{"title_en":"Linux motion and reset behavior are measured separately","zh":"作业2052727沿用已验证图形环境，测直行后滑行、直行后制动和两个符号的转向。两个转向窗的车头变化约−6.49和+6.39度；相近初速下，滑行末速度0.3625，制动接近零。四次从已位移处重置均回到固定容差内，最大位置误差约0.000738。495条遥测和34张真实图像保留了过程。它给Linux端建立了独立动作与重置依据，而不是假设Windows参数全部等价。随后测真实相机到固定核心的完整处理延迟。","en":"Using the accepted graphics environment, job 2052727 measures straight coasting, straight braking, and both steering signs. The turning windows produce yaw changes of about −6.49 and +6.39 degrees. From closely matched initial speeds, coasting ended at 0.3625 while braking approaches zero. All four resets return from displaced positions within the specified pose tolerance, with maximum error about 0.000738. The 495 telemetry samples and 34 images preserve the process. Linux now had its own measured action and reset evidence. I next time the real camera-to-core path.","title_zh":"同Linux环境测转向符号、滑行、制动和返回起点","id":"step-052","summary_en":"Linux tests confirmed both steering directions, braking and returns to the start. I then measured the camera-to-model processing time.","summary_zh":"Linux 测试确认了左右转向、刹车和回到起点。随后我测量相机图像进入模型需要多长时间。"},{"title_en":"Cold-start delays recover during a forty-frame camera-to-core test","zh":"Roihu当时拿不到远程计算机上的旧ridge系数，因此明确选择只测核心，不放假权重或偷偷重训。作业2055503把40张真实相机帧按序经过采样、固定神经核心和特征历史，车辆全程制动。接收到特征完成的中位延迟约28毫秒，前六帧超过50毫秒相机间隔，到第七帧队列恢复；末20帧约27到28毫秒。冷解码和核心计算都参与前段耗时。这是短静止场景的吞吐证据。下一步在Roihu重新采真实老师轨迹并拟合读出，免去依赖关机的旧主机。","en":"The old remote workstation ridge coefficients were unavailable, so this job explicitly tests the core-only path. The check used the saved weights. Job 2055503 processes forty recorded camera frames through sampling, the fixed core, and feature history while the car remained braked. Median receive-to-feature latency was about 28 milliseconds. The first six frames exceed the 50-millisecond camera interval, but the queue recovers by frame seven; the final twenty take roughly 27 to 28 milliseconds. Cold image decoding and core execution both contribute. I next collected fresh Roihu teacher data and fit new external readouts.","title_zh":"真实相机到固定核心的冷启动和稳定延迟","id":"step-053","summary_en":"The first image-processing steps were slow, but the queue caught up. I then collected fresh training images on Roihu.","summary_zh":"最初几个图像处理步骤较慢，随后队列追上了采集速度。我接着在 Roihu 采集新的训练图像。"},{"title_en":"Fresh Linux teacher trajectories remove dependence on the old host","zh":"我选择在Roihu从新数据学习，不继续等旧主机。GPU作业2058849先用几何老师采四条训练和两条验证轨迹，共14,289张真实相机帧和3446个有效动作标签。六段都完成，训练与验证按整段分开。第一段到达导出路线末端，净进度48.42，标签位置平均路线偏差0.0223；这些都是老师行为，不是神经控制。老师轨迹和原图随后交给依赖该作业成功的CPU作业，密集回放固定核心并拟合小读出。两个作业分担采集与离线计算，属于同一个G2科学目的。","en":"I chose to collect fresh data on Roihu because the earlier fitted parameters were unavailable. GPU job 2058849 first uses the geometric teacher to collect four training and two validation trajectories. The six completed episodes contain 14,289 real camera frames and 3,446 eligible action labels, split by whole trajectory. The first reached the exported route end with net progress 48.42 and mean labeled route distance 0.0223. These measurements describe the teacher, not a neural controller. A dependent CPU job then consumes the images, densely replays the fixed core, and fits small external readouts. The two jobs perform separate collection and offline stages of the same G2 question.","title_zh":"新环境重新采老师相机轨迹，不等旧主机","id":"step-054","summary_en":"I collected new teacher trajectories on Roihu because the earlier fitted parameters were unavailable. A separate CPU job then used those images for fitting.","summary_zh":"早期拟合参数已不可用，我便在 Roihu 重新采集教师轨迹，再由独立 CPU 作业利用这些图像拟合读出。"},{"title_en":"Neural prediction beats a constant, but misses strong left corrections","zh":"CPU作业2059323等待采集成功后开始，六条固定核心回放和六个ridge候选全部完成。2298个训练标签、1148个验证标签上，神经转向误差0.082109，比恒定均值0.142451小，但直接视网膜为0.010723。神经模型不是只学截距，760项历史中194项被保留。不过平均误差掩盖方向弱项：验证集强左标签很少，神经强左误差0.353337，而直接视网膜约0.0144。先不靠平均表格宣布成功，下一作业把选定读出冻结，给老师、神经和直接视网膜相同的四种起点，看实际车怎样走。","en":"After collection succeeds, CPU job 2059323 completed six fixed-core replayed and six ridge candidates. There were 2,298 training and 1,148 validation labels. Neural steering MAE was 0.082109, below the constant mean’s 0.142451, while direct retinal history achieved 0.010723. The neural fit retained 194 of 760 history features, so it was not merely an intercept. However, average error hides a directional weakness. Strong-left validation labels were rare, and neural MAE there was 0.353337 versus about 0.0144 for the direct-image comparator. Rather than declare success from this table, I froze the selected weights and next compare recorded teacher, neural, and retinal driving across four matched starts.","title_zh":"同批新轨迹先回放固定核心，再拟合外部读出","id":"step-055","summary_en":"The neural readout predicted actions better than a constant, but missed large left corrections. I tested its driving with weights held fixed.","summary_zh":"神经读出的动作预测优于常量，但对大幅左纠偏误差较大。我接着固定权重，直接测试驾驶。"},{"title_en":"The neural ridge controller fails early, while the sensory comparator completes","zh":"冻结读出真正接车后，离线预测与驾驶的差距显现。作业2062867在同四起点依次跑老师、神经和直接视网膜，共12个有效记录，路线几何一致。神经四次只运行8.8到12.6秒，在前段直道碰到0.5路线距离保护；没有走到后面的左右弯。直接视网膜四次都到路线末端。原60秒门槛只记3/4，其中一例是时间边界多出约0.717微秒，实际后续驾驶完成，原门槛记录仍保留。神经失败不是延迟保护触发，末动作方向还与同帧几何纠偏相反。因此下一轮优先补它真正访问到的偏离状态，而不是扩大相同正常轨迹数据。","en":"When the fixed-weight readouts actually drive, offline prediction and closed-loop behavior diverge. Job 2062867 runs teacher, neural, and direct-image controllers from the same four starts, producing twelve accepted records on matched geometry. All neural cases stop at the 0.5-unit route-distance protection after only 8.8 to 12.6 seconds, on the early straight before later bends. All retinal cases reach the route endpoint. The original 60-second check records three of four retinal passes because one checkpoint exceeded its timing boundary by about 0.717 microseconds; the original check and recorded route completion remained separate facts. Neural stops were not latency protection. Their final commands oppose the same-frame geometric correction. I next added correction labels at the states these failed policies actually visit.","title_zh":"离线神经预测有效，接车后却在直道离开保护带","id":"step-056","summary_en":"The neural controller left the allowed route band early; the direct-image comparator reached the endpoint. I collected corrective labels from the failed paths.","summary_zh":"神经控制器很早就离开允许的路线范围，直接图像对照却到达终点。我转向采集失败轨迹上的纠偏标签。"},{"title_en":"Correction replays succeed, but duplicated episode references block fitting","zh":"纠偏轮复用八条既有策略轨迹的2364个同帧老师标签，原六段老师数据也保留。CPU作业2064884先把八段相机完整重放，四条神经轨迹的现场和重放特征在1184个窗、419,368个数值上完全一致。可是组装数据时，一个列表引用被重复追加，使应有的14条独立episode出现22项引用。拟合器正确拒绝重复身份，尚未估计参数。这是数据组装失败，成功的神经回放不用重跑。下一次仅验证重复对确实相同，重建14个唯一episode，再做fit-only恢复。","en":"The corrective round reuses 2,364 same-frame teacher labels from eight existing policy trajectories, while retaining the original six teacher episodes. CPU job 2064884 fully replays all eight camera sequences. Live and replayed neural features match exactly across 1,184 windows and 419,368 values. Fitting then stops before parameter estimation: a list-aliasing defect appends duplicate episode references, producing 22 entries instead of fourteen unique episodes. The fitter correctly rejects duplicate identity. This was a data-assembly failure, not a failed neural replay. I kept the successful replay files and perform a separate fit-only recovery after verifying that the duplicated pairs were identical.","title_zh":"纠偏数据的回放完成，组装重复使拟合拒绝","id":"step-057","summary_en":"Replaying the images worked, but duplicated trajectory references stopped fitting. I kept the completed replay and repaired data assembly separately.","summary_zh":"图像回放成功，重复的轨迹引用却使拟合停止。我保留已经完成的回放，单独修复数据组装。"},{"title_en":"A fit-only recovery preserves successful replay work","zh":"作业2065069只处理文件组装和拟合，不重新运行已经成功的核心回放。它在14秒内完成六个候选，训练3492行、验证2318行。扩大数据后的神经转向误差为0.243121，直接视网膜0.073924，常数0.301092；而在原来的两段验证上，新模型反而比原模型误差高。这提示纠偏与正常状态拟合存在权衡。选定权重被冻结，再安排新的实际驾驶评估，不能把这轮验证误差与旧数据表横比当作整车改善。","en":"Job 2065069 performs only data assembly and fitting; the successful core replayed were not repeated. In fourteen allocated seconds, six candidates fit 3,492 training and 2,318 validation rows. Neural steering MAE was 0.243121, retinal MAE was 0.073924, and the constant baseline was 0.301092 on the expanded validation set. On the original two validation episodes, both new fits have higher error than their predecessors. This suggests a recovery-versus-normal-data tradeoff. I froze the selected weights for a new driving evaluation rather than treating unlike validation tables as vehicle improvement.","title_zh":"修复重复引用后，只重新拟合","id":"step-058","summary_en":"Fitting resumed without repeating the image replay. The expanded data improved some corrections but worsened the earlier validation cases, so driving needed another test.","summary_zh":"拟合恢复时没有重复图像回放。扩充数据改善部分纠偏，却使原验证案例变差，因此还需要直接检查驾驶。"},{"title_en":"Old test names blocked evaluation before the car moved","zh":"纠偏评估的第一份GPU作业2065101九秒就停止，还没有车辆轨迹。旧入口只允许dev01到dev04，新的明确配置使用correct01到correct04，所以被白名单拒绝。模型和配置并没有完成实际比较。修复只允许这两组已声明的标识，并用全部24个新旧运行名检查接口。原失败版本不覆盖，另开作业运行相同冻结科学比较。","en":"GPU job 2065101 stops after nine seconds, before any vehicle trajectory. Its legacy runtime admits only dev01 through dev04, while the new specified evaluation uses correct01 through correct04. The case-name guard rejects it. No model comparison had occurred. The repair admits the two explicitly specified identifier families and checks all 24 recorded old and new run names. I kept the failed deployment and use a separate job for the unchanged fixed-weight scientific comparison.","title_zh":"旧名称检查在车辆移动前挡住评估","id":"step-059","summary_en":"The job stopped before the car moved because old code rejected the new test names. I allowed both name sets and reran the unchanged comparison separately.","summary_zh":"作业在车辆移动前停止，原因是旧程序不接受新测试名称。我允许两组名称后，另开作业重新运行原比较。"},{"title_en":"Corrective fitting changes bias, but does not produce robust neural driving","zh":"修正入口后的作业2065170完成全部12条记录，老师四条都到路线末端。神经臂仍在7.2到13.2秒触发路线距离保护，60秒标准0/4。直接视网膜四条都到120秒上限，60秒标准4/4，但没有一条走到路线末端，某些案例明显变慢。神经末段现在偏到与上一代相反的一侧，同帧老师要求的方向仍与实际弱命令不一致。新起点和旧评估不同，因此不把这个差异当孤立重训因果。结果说明增加纠偏数据尚未形成可靠神经控制。下一步用已保存参数和命令，具体审计基线偏置为什么改变。","en":"With the entry repair, job 2065170 completed all twelve records. All four teachers reach the route end. Neural cases still hit route-distance protection after 7.2 to 13.2 seconds and pass none of the four 60-second checks. Retinal cases all reach the 120-second cap and pass the 60-second criterion, but none reached the endpoint; some were much slower. The neural trajectories now drift to the opposite side from the earlier generation, while weak commands still disagree with same-frame geometric correction. New starts differ from the old evaluation, so this was not an isolated causal estimate of retraining. The correction data have not produced robust neural control. I next inspected the saved parameters and weighting behind the changed bias.","title_zh":"纠偏后神经臂仍短时失败，retinal走得更久但变慢","id":"step-060","summary_en":"Corrective fitting changed the steering bias but still did not produce reliable neural driving. I checked how the training episodes had been weighted.","summary_zh":"纠偏数据改变了转向偏置，却仍未带来可靠驾驶。我随后检查不同训练回合在拟合中占了多大权重。"},{"title_en":"Episode weighting has a measurable link to the reversed baseline","zh":"这次审计只读旧、新ridge参数及已经执行的命令。发现两个很短的神经失败轨迹只有99行，占训练行的2.84%，但按整episode等权后占总目标权重25%。它们的老师纠偏均值为负，足以和其他轨迹均值一起把截距从+0.102742变为−0.044694，重建误差小于10⁻¹²。其他特征均值、尺度和系数也变了，所以截距不是整段驾驶的全部原因。这个精确联系比“果蝇转向偏好反转”更具体。它促使后续学习方案认真区分数据分布、目标权重与闭环行为，而不是手工把输出符号翻回来。","en":"This audit reads the old and new ridge parameters and already executed commands. Two short neural-failure trajectories contain only 99 rows, or 2.84 percent of training rows, but equal episode weighting gave them 25 percent of the total objective. Their mean teacher corrections were negative. Combining all episode means reconstructs the intercept change from +0.102742 to −0.044694 within 10⁻¹². Feature means, scales, and coefficients also change, so the intercept was not the whole explanation of vehicle behavior. This was a concrete link between data weighting and baseline bias. It motivated closer attention to data distribution and objectives, rather than manually flipping steering signs or attributing a learned biological turning preference.","title_zh":"为什么修正后偏转方向反了","id":"step-061","summary_en":"Two short failed trajectories received a disproportionately large share of the fitting objective. That helped explain the changed baseline bias and guided later data balancing.","summary_zh":"两段很短的失败轨迹在拟合目标中占比过大。这与基础转向偏置的变化有关，也促使后面更重视数据分配。"},{"title_en":"Pause the simulator during learner work before trusting action time","zh":"外部强化学习会在采样后计算更新。若车仍继续跑，优化器耗时就会混进动作持续时间。作业2066309先单独测试拥有的Unity进程暂停0.5、2和5秒，检查前后50毫秒相机时钟连续，并验证最终停止与清理。21秒作业完成后，才进入有真实优化器、重置和存档的短cell验收。这里的暂停是保持接口时间的工程机制，不是神经网络的能力。","en":"Reinforcement learning performs computation between samples. If the car kept moving during an optimizer update, learner wall time became uncontrolled action time. Job 2066309 therefore tests owned Unity-process pauses of 0.5, two, and five seconds. It checks dense 50-millisecond timestamps before and after each pause, plus final stopping and cleanup. The 21-second job completed. I could then test short cells with real optimization, resets, and saved policies. Pausing was an engineering timing mechanism, not a neural capability.","title_zh":"工程验收：先证实能暂停拥有的Unity进程","id":"step-062","summary_en":"I verified that the simulator could pause while the learner updated. Otherwise, computation time would become uncontrolled driving time.","summary_zh":"我验证了学习器更新时可以暂停模拟器。否则，计算耗时也会变成车辆继续运动的时间。"},{"title_en":"The first optimizer check compares a timestamp as if it were immutable","zh":"作业2066439进入真实SAC采样，已有52条有效transition和19次更新，随后因ready比较失败停止。审计把启动时间戳也放进不可变身份字段，重新连接时它当然会变。这里已经有真实学习量，不能写成零；但也没有完整比较。下一版只修正稳定身份比较，保留原核心、奖励和学习设置，继续检查完整入口。","en":"Job 2066439 reached real SAC sampling, with 52 valid transitions and nineteen optimizer calls, before an immutable-ready comparison failed. The audit mistakenly treats the startup timestamp as an invariant identity field. It changed on reconnection. I kept the real learning already completed, while recording that the comparison was unfinished. The next revision fixes only the stable-field comparison and leaves the core, reward, and learning settings unchanged before checking the complete entry path again.","title_zh":"优化器验收r1：ready比较混入启动时间戳","id":"step-063","summary_en":"Learning started, but a check wrongly required a startup timestamp to stay constant. I corrected the identity check and kept the completed learning records.","summary_zh":"学习已经开始，检查程序却错误地要求启动时间戳保持不变。我修正身份检查，并保留已完成的学习记录。"},{"title_en":"The next check reaches an episode-info naming collision","zh":"ready比较修正后，作业2066450又推进到53条有效transition和20次更新。新的停止点是审计中的整数episode字段碰到SB3期待的episode统计字典。这个重复出现的接口问题说明只测单次step不够，必须真的走到episode结束、重置和日志记账。我保留50秒失败作业，只改命名空间，再做下一轮短验收。","en":"After the ready comparison was fixed, job 2066450 reached 53 valid transitions and twenty updates. It then stops because the audit’s integer episode field conflicts with SB3’s episode-statistics dictionary. This showed why testing one step was insufficient: acceptance must actually pass through episode termination, reset, and logging. I kept the 50-second failed job, repair the information namespace, and use another short check. The run stopped at an integration bookkeeping error.","title_zh":"优化器验收r2：episode整数再次撞上SB3保留键","id":"step-064","summary_en":"The next test reached episode completion and exposed a field-name conflict with the learning library. I renamed the field before testing again.","summary_zh":"下一次测试运行到回合结束，暴露了记录字段与学习库重名的问题。我先改字段名，再重新测试。"},{"title_en":"One learning cell succeeds; the next cannot reconnect","zh":"第三次作业2066460的SAC神经cell完成128条transition、96次更新，权重有限且已改变，重新载入给出的确定性预测一致，最终静止通过。接着第二cell尝试连接同一个已经加载的场景失败。因此一整个作业没完成四种组合，但首cell的成功也不抹掉。下一次明确给每个cell单独的Unity生命周期，避免把场景连接状态与算法差异混在一起。","en":"In job 2066460, the SAC neural cell completed 128 transitions and 96 updates. Weights were finite and changed, deterministic predictions reload exactly, and stationary stopping passes. The next cell then failed to reconnect to the already loaded scene. The full four-cell job was incomplete, but the successful first cell remained real evidence. The next revision gave every cell its own Unity lifecycle so that scene connection state cannot be mistaken for an algorithm difference.","title_zh":"优化器验收r3：一cell成功，第二cell复用场景连接失败","id":"step-065","summary_en":"One short learning test completed, but the next could not reconnect to the scene. I separated simulator lifetimes for the following tests.","summary_zh":"一项短时学习测试完成，下一项却无法重新连接场景。我让后续测试分别管理各自的模拟器。"},{"title_en":"All four short algorithm–representation checks complete","zh":"每cell独立模拟器后，作业2066512完成SAC、PPO与神经、直接视网膜四个组合，每个128条有效transition。权重变化、数值有限、确定性重载和最终静止都通过。它解决的是能否运行完整学习流程，参数还是短诊断配置，不能据此选最佳驾驶算法。之后优先实际测一个完整worker与四个worker的吞吐，决定是否值得并行，而不是因为有GPU就假定加模拟器一定更高效。这里PPO先保存所执行动作、当时概率和奖励，收完一段后重算并限制策略变化；SAC则重复利用已接纳的经验。两者的动作与观测契约在这次短验收中一致。","en":"With an independent simulator for every cell, job 2066512 completed all four combinations of SAC/PPO and neural/retinal input. Each collected 128 valid transitions, changes finite policy weights, reloads deterministic predictions exactly, and stops stationarily. These were short diagnostic settings, so the result establishes complete learning mechanics rather than the best driving algorithm. I next measured one versus four complete workers to decide whether parallel collection was worthwhile, rather than assuming a GPU automatically made more simulators efficient. PPO first stores executed actions, collection-time probabilities, and rewards, then limits policy change during rollout updates. SAC reuses accepted experience. Both share the specified action and observation interface requirements in this short check.","title_zh":"四种算法与输入组合的短验收全部执行","id":"step-066","summary_en":"All algorithm-and-input combinations completed short learning and reload checks. I then measured whether running complete copies in parallel would help.","summary_zh":"各算法与输入组合都完成了短时学习和重新加载检查。随后我测量并行运行完整副本是否能提高效率。"},{"title_en":"One parallel worker started with a stale image","zh":"作业2066603先测单worker，128条transition用73.00秒；再开四worker，其中三条各完成128，另一条在首条有效样本前因相机已经超过端到端延迟界限而停。四worker波次约80.15秒，幸存者总吞吐虽更高，预先要求却是全部worker有效，并且单位GPU预算吞吐改善至少10%。因此没有采纳四worker配置。这个早期负结果很重要：后来的32模拟器并不是一开始就自然可用。当前科学screen按已声明的单worker顺序回退继续。","en":"Job 2066603 first measures one complete worker: 128 transitions take 73.00 seconds. In the four-worker wave, three workers each finish 128 transitions, while one failed before its first valid sample because its camera already exceeded the end-to-end lag bound. The wave lasted about 80.15 seconds. Surviving aggregate throughput was higher, but the prespecified check required every worker to be valid and at least ten-percent improvement in valid transitions per GPU budget. Four-worker deployment was therefore rejected. This matters historically: later large-scale parallel collection was not available from the start. The current scientific screen uses the specified sequential fallback.","title_zh":"一个并行副本以过期图像开始","id":"step-067","summary_en":"Three parallel workers completed, but the fourth began with a stale image. The configuration failed its all-workers requirement, so the next screen ran sequentially.","summary_zh":"三个并行副本完成，第四个却以过期图像开始。该配置未满足全部通过的要求，后面的比较先按顺序运行。"},{"title_en":"A float32 timing boundary interrupts the first scientific screen","zh":"短验收通过后，正式四组合screen的第一项SAC神经臂跑到772条有效transition和260次更新。作业2066647随后因下一动作过长失败，其余三cell没有开始。实际第四张相机时间比计算目标早18.31微秒，超过旧容差，于是等第五张，再加排队帧，动作变成约300毫秒。有效772条保留；摘要误报零是失败路径统计缺项，原文件不改。这是明确时钟边界问题，因此下一版按已验证的50毫秒密集窗计数暂停，奖励和学习率不变。","en":"The first scientific screen reached 772 valid SAC-neural transitions and 260 updates before job 2066647 failed on an excessive action interval. The other three cells never start. The fourth camera timestamp was 18.31 microseconds earlier than the computed target, beyond the old tolerance. The client waits for a fifth frame, then drains another queued frame, extending the action to about 300 milliseconds. The 772 valid samples remain. An original failure-summary zero was a reporting omission, not zero interaction. This was a concrete clock-boundary mechanism. The next revision counts validated dense 50-millisecond windows before pausing, without changing reward or learning rate.","title_zh":"科学screen r1：float32边界使动作超过时长","id":"step-068","summary_en":"A tiny timestamp difference made the program wait for an extra frame and hold an action too long. I changed how it counted valid camera intervals.","summary_zh":"很小的时间戳差异使程序多等一帧，导致动作持续过久。我修改了有效相机时间段的计数方式。"},{"title_en":"Pausing at the fourth frame still leaves queued camera time","zh":"第二次正式作业2067259保留803条有效transition和291次更新。虽然已按第四帧暂停，仍有两张排队画面跟来，把一个动作延长，下一间隔被拒绝，其余三cell仍未运行。失败策略也保存，最终停止通过。可见只修浮点目标还不够，神经表示本身处理每帧约花一个相机周期，排队会累积。下一版在每张帧做神经表示之前暂停生产者，暂停中排空，再只为剩余窗口恢复运行；原动作时长界限和所有真实帧都保留。","en":"The second scientific job, 2067259, retained 803 valid transitions and 291 updates. Pausing on the correct fourth frame was still insufficient: two queued camera frames follow and extend an action beyond its allowed interval. The other three cells again did not run. A failed-policy snapshot was saved and stationary cleanup passes. The evidence showed that the floating-point target was not the whole problem; neural representation took about a camera period per frame, allowing a backlog. The next revision pauses the producer before representing every frame, drains while paused, and resumed only for remaining windows. It retained the original duration limit and every frame.","title_zh":"科学screen r2：暂停前排队画面仍延长动作","id":"step-069","summary_en":"Pausing at the intended frame still left queued images. I moved the pause earlier and processed the queue while the simulator was stopped.","summary_zh":"在目标帧暂停后，队列里仍有旧图像。我把暂停提前，并在模拟器停止时处理队列。"},{"title_en":"Longer sampling exposes a genuine stale-action echo","zh":"逐帧暂停版越过前两次的失败位置，最终收1610条有效transition、1098次更新，保存1024步检查点。但作业2067563仍在第一cell停止。它发出新转向0.12029和油门0.03445，随后四张相机却一直回显上一命令0.22865和0.04859。这是明显旧动作，不是小数精度差。无效间隔在奖励和replay之前排除，具体命令传递或Unity调度根因仍未查明。最终静止判据未通过，虽所有拥有进程已退出，也必须分别记录。下一步先做有限传输诊断，不直接重跑长训练。","en":"The per-frame suspension version passes both earlier failure regions and reached 1,610 valid transitions and 1,098 updates, retaining a 1,024-step checkpoint. Job 2067563 still stops in its first cell. It sent new steering 0.12029 and throttle 0.03445, yet all four following camera frames echo the preceding command, 0.22865 and 0.04859. This was a substantial stale action, not a decimal-precision difference. The invalid interval was excluded before reward and replay. Its command-delivery or Unity-scheduling cause remained unresolved. Final stationary stopping failed, although owned processes exit. I kept both facts and move to a finite transport diagnostic rather than immediately repeating long training.","title_zh":"科学screen r3：真正遇到动作回显仍为前一命令","id":"step-070","summary_en":"The camera messages reported the previous command throughout a new action. I excluded that interval and investigated command transport before longer training.","summary_zh":"新动作期间，相机消息始终报告上一条命令。我排除这段数据，先调查命令传输，再考虑长时间训练。"},{"title_en":"The transport diagnostic ends on excessive duration, not the same stale-echo pattern","zh":"有限传输候选启用TCP_NODELAY、暂停时不刷新控制，并用有界等待确认末端静止。作业2067982不做学习，目标2048次规定制动动作，实际787次有效。第788次用了七张密集相机帧，共0.34999秒，超过动作界限。第一张仍回显旧命令，后六张及终点已是新命令，所以这次不是先前四帧全旧的同一症状。排队和暂停的精确调度原因仍未解开。全部真实帧保留，最终静止与进程退出通过。后续改成声明的有限变时长交互，并在真实学习中验证拒绝后恢复，避免普通无效间隔结束整个学习器。","en":"The finite transport candidate enables TCP_NODELAY, suppresses control refresh while paused, and uses bounded waiting to confirm final stationarity. Job 2067982 performs no learning. Of 2,048 intended prescribed braked actions, 787 were valid. The next action consumes seven camera windows, or 0.34999 seconds, exceeding the duration bound. Its first frame echoes the old command, but the next six and the endpoint echo the new command. This was not the previous all-four-stale pattern. The detailed producer–receiver scheduling cause remained unresolved. All frames were retained, and final stationarity and process exit pass. I next declare bounded variable-duration interaction and test recovery inside learning.","title_zh":"传输诊断：终点回显正确，但7帧动作仍过长","id":"step-071","summary_en":"The transport test stopped on an action that lasted too long, with a different echo pattern from the earlier failure. I next tested bounded recovery during learning.","summary_zh":"传输测试因一次动作过长而停止，但命令回传模式与上次不同。我接着测试学习过程中能否有界恢复。"},{"title_en":"An injected interruption verifies recovery during real learning","zh":"反复因为接口中断退出整作业，会把已有学习进度一起截断。这一轮明确允许有效动作在一秒内有限变时长，但无法用的间隔不给奖励、不进经验库。作业2068257还在第768个有效样本后故意注入一次中断，验证不是口头说能恢复。它保住同一学习器、优化器和已经接纳的经验内容，6.59秒重置恢复，之后又完成1018次更新。最终因动作前wall预算保护正常停止，目标2048步实际完成1786步、1274次SAC更新、38个episode，末端静止和进程清理通过。恢复机制已经实测；驾驶质量仍需要独立固定权重评估。","en":"Repeated interface failures have been ending entire jobs and cutting off valid learning. This revision explicitly permits finite valid action intervals of up to one second, while unusable intervals receive no reward and never enter replay. Job 2068257 deliberately injects one interruption after 768 valid samples. Recovery was therefore tested inside real learning, not only claimed in code. The same learner, optimizer, and accepted replay data were preserved. Reset recovery took 6.59 seconds, followed by 1,018 further updates. The pre-action wall-budget guard ended collection normally at 1,786 of the intended 2,048 samples, with 1,274 SAC updates and 38 episodes. Stationary stopping and process cleanup pass. Recovery mechanics were verified; separate fixed-weight evaluation was still needed to assess driving.","title_zh":"在真实学习中故意中断一次，验证保住学习器与有效经验","id":"step-072","summary_en":"A deliberately interrupted run resumed learning after a reset. I then evaluated the saved policy separately to see whether driving had improved.","summary_zh":"一次人为中断后，程序通过重置恢复了学习。我再单独评估保存的策略，检查驾驶是否改善。"},{"title_en":"The learned bias helps one start and hurts the other","zh":"独立作业2068846冻结恢复试验的初始和最终策略，再用左右两种初始化及几何老师做六个案例，不做更新。左案例最后有效进度从2.21增到3.19，持续5.6到7.4秒；右案例从2.97降到2.42，持续7.0到6.0秒。四次策略驾驶全部触发允许的路线距离范围，两个老师完成路线。策略的确定性转向几乎恒定，主要变化是均值由约−0.0916翻为+0.0862。因此结果是混合改善和偏置改变，不能只挑左案例作成功视频。接下来我选择更长神经学习，并要求保留共同样本检查点与直接视网膜比较。","en":"Job 2068846 independently freezes the recovery experiment’s initial and final policies. Two initializations and geometric-teacher references produce six cases with zero updates. For the left case, last valid progress rose from 2.21 to 3.19, and duration increased from 5.6 to 7.4 seconds. For the right case, progress fell from 2.97 to 2.42, and duration decreased from seven to six seconds. All four policy drives hit the allowed route-distance band; both teachers finish the route. Deterministic steering was nearly constant, with its main change being a mean-bias reversal from about −0.0916 to +0.0862. The outcome was mixed, so both cases remain visible. I next chose longer neural learning, saving checkpoints at common training amounts and planning a direct-image comparison.","title_zh":"恢复试验学到的策略：一个起点进步，另一个退步","id":"step-073","summary_en":"The learned change helped one start and harmed the other. I kept both outcomes and moved to longer learning with saved intermediate models.","summary_zh":"学习后的变化帮助了一个起点，却损害了另一个。我保留两种结果，并在更长学习中保存中间模型。"},{"title_en":"Long neural learning completes, then full-archive export blocks the other arm","zh":"长作业2068970计划神经臂三小时、直接视网膜臂一小时，同一固定核心和SAC设置，保存1024至16384步等共同检查点。神经学习实际完成19,233个有效经验、18,721次更新，479个完整episode全在工程允许的路线范围终止，最后还有一次无动作重置。学习客户端和清理已经成功，随后旧运行层试图把庞大的逐帧记录全压缩，外层超时终止导出，整个batch失败，视网膜臂根本没启动。独立紧凑导出保住权重、经验库、随机状态和日志。训练前后100局的均值进度反而下降，原因未定。这里要同时讲完成的学习、失败的打包和缺失的比较，不能用一个completed或failed概括全部。","en":"Long job 2068970 plans three hours for the neural arm and one hour for the direct-image comparator, keeping the fixed core and SAC settings and saving common-sample checkpoints. The neural learner completed 19,233 valid experiences and 18,721 updates. All 479 complete episodes end at the engineering allowed route-distance band, with one final reset receiving no action. The learning client and cleanup succeed. The old runtime then tries to compress the enormous per-frame record set, and the outer timeout terminates export. The batch failed and the direct-image arm never starts. An independent compact export preserves weights, replay, random state, and logs. Mean training progress also declines between the first and last hundred episodes, for an unresolved reason. I kept completed learning, export failure, and the missing comparison as separate facts.","title_zh":"三小时神经学习完成，整包压缩超时使retinal臂未启动","id":"step-074","summary_en":"The neural training finished, but exporting the huge image archive timed out before the comparison arm started. I kept training and export outcomes separate.","summary_zh":"神经训练完成了，但导出庞大图像档案超时，对照条件尚未启动。我分别记录训练完成和导出失败。"},{"title_en":"The Windows demonstration first fails before model execution","zh":"拿已有Roihu最终策略回Windows做冻结演示，最初两次都停在依赖入口。一次脚本找不到旁边模块；修正后，复制来的运行时锁文件因换行字节不同，选中了不存在的哈希目录，又报找不到NumPy。解析后的依赖内容其实相同。恢复原锁字节后使用已经安装的运行时。两次没有新学习，也没有车辆数据。它们解释了为什么“演示已发起”不能直接写成“看见策略开车”。","en":"Bringing the saved Roihu final policy to Windows first encounters two entry failures. One attempt cannot import a neighboring script. After that repair, different newline bytes in the copied runtime lock select a nonexistent hash-derived dependency directory, producing a NumPy import error even though the parsed requirements were identical. Restoring the original lock bytes selected the installed runtime. Neither attempt performs new learning or records vehicle behavior. Starting a demonstration was not yet evidence of a visible policy drive.","title_zh":"把Roihu策略带回Windows先遇到两个启动依赖错误","id":"step-075","summary_en":"The Windows demonstration first failed at imports and dependency lookup. Neither attempt reached the model or the vehicle.","summary_zh":"Windows 演示首先被模块导入和依赖查找挡住，两次尝试都尚未进入模型或车辆运行。"},{"title_en":"The saved policy loads, but the Windows scene parser stops","zh":"第一次正式冻结演示确实载入19,233步策略，前后数字权重哈希相同，历史更新数保持18,721。随后场景握手里一个timeStamp使用小数逗号，JSON解析停止，驾驶transition为零。直接回放六条已存原始消息就能定位需要的窄修复，无需重跑模拟器猜原因。Windows适配器随后复用既有数字修复并保留原字节，另开第二次演示。","en":"The first recorded fixed-weight demonstration does load the 19,233-step policy. Numeric weight hashes match before and after, and its historical update count remained 18,721. A decimal-comma timestamp in the Windows scene handshake then stops JSON parsing, leaving zero driving transitions. Replaying the six saved raw messages identifies the narrow repair without rerunning a simulator to guess the cause. The Windows adapter reuses the inspected numeric repair, preserves original bytes, and starts a separate second demonstration.","title_zh":"Windows策略载入成功，scene握手的小数逗号再度阻断","id":"step-076","summary_en":"The saved policy loaded unchanged, but a decimal-comma message stopped scene parsing. I repaired the reader using the saved messages.","summary_zh":"保存的策略原样加载成功，但逗号小数消息使场景解析停止。我用已有消息检查并修复接收程序。"},{"title_en":"A short transferred policy drive uses exactly constant commands","zh":"第二次演示真正运行了11个有效决策、44张策略相机窗，共约2.2秒模拟时间。每个动作都完全相同：转向−0.56745，油门0.09420，最终在0.5路线距离保护之外结束。车辆没有完成路线，末端静止通过，权重和更新计数始终不变。展示共有161帧时必须说明包含预热和停止，不是161次驾驶决策。这还是Windows转移案例：导出路线长42.929，Linux训练路长49.219，环境和二进制也不同。于是下一步先审计这11个决策实际接收到的输入是否同样没变。","en":"The second demonstration actually produced eleven valid decisions and 44 policy camera windows over about 2.2 simulated seconds. Every action was exactly the same: steering −0.56745 and throttle 0.09420. The case ended outside the 0.5-unit allowed route-distance band, without completing the route. Stationary stopping passes, while weights and the historical update count remain unchanged. A 161-frame viewer includes warmup and cleanup; it was not 161 driving decisions. This was also a Windows transfer case: its exported route length was 42.929, versus 49.219 in Linux training, with different binaries. I therefore inspected the eleven recorded preceding inputs before assigning a cause to constant commands.","title_zh":"Windows短演示真实运行，输出却始终相同","id":"step-077"},{"title_en":"The constant commands did not come from identical cached inputs","zh":"只读输入审计逐个匹配reset终点和前十个动作终点，它们才是11次决策真正使用的前置观测。按实际除100、float32和可用性mask重建后，11个1520维输入向量都不同。760项神经数值中179项变化，404项不可用；817个相机亮度列也都变化。因此相机冻结或缓存同一输入不能解释这段恒动作。策略对这段差异不敏感，但原因仍未知。这个诊断把下一阶段的目标拉回内部可训练路径：不再只调原固定Java模型或外部读出，先用C1查参数路径，再构建能训练连接的连续循环核心。","en":"The file-only audit matches each action to its true preceding observation: the reset endpoint and the previous ten action endpoints. After applying the recorded division by 100, float32 representation, and availability masks, all eleven 1,520-entry input vectors were distinct. Of 760 neural-value columns, 179 vary and 404 were unavailable. All 817 observed retinal-brightness columns vary as well. A fixed-weight camera or identical cached input therefore did not explain these constant commands. The policy was insensitive to these observed differences, but the reason remained unresolved. The next direction returned to an internal learning path: first verify exposed parameters in C1, then construct a continuous recurrent core with trainable connections.","title_zh":"输入确实在变化，恒动作不能归于缓存同一画面","id":"step-078","summary_en":"The recorded inputs were different even though every action was identical. I therefore investigated the policy's response rather than blaming a unchanging camera feed.","summary_zh":"虽然动作完全相同，记录的输入却各不相同。我因此检查策略对输入的反应，没有把原因归为相机卡住。"},{"title_en":"A manually changed gain reaches the model, but the warmup times out","zh":"C1仍使用原Java神经模型，只开放五个全局或共享参数，不做优化器学习。这一轮对原增益和提高25%的增益，各计划两个起点。原增益两例都完成15秒，神经转向和油门全零；少量前进来自初始化油门后的滑行。提高增益的第一例在33个预热窗后撞到10秒整段wall预算，另一个没启动。每张帧延迟都未越界，支持先修整段计算预算，而不是放宽有效数据标准。原结果保留，接着只补缺失的增益条件，不重跑已经完成的基线。","en":"C1 still uses the original Java model and exposes only five global or shared parameters. It performs no optimizer learning. The plan compares original gain with a 25-percent increase under two starts each. Both original-gain cases finish fifteen seconds with zero neural steering and throttle; small progress comes from initialization coasting. The first increased-gain case then times out after 33 warmup windows under the ten-second phase wall limit, and the other never starts. Individual frame lags remain within bounds. I therefore repaired the C1 processing-time allowance, preserve the baseline records, and run only the two missing changed-gain cases.","title_zh":"C1：增益路径可改，但原模型不主动开车","id":"step-079","summary_en":"The changed gain reached the model, but the warmup time limit stopped the test. I adjusted that processing allowance and ran only the missing cases.","summary_zh":"修改后的增益已进入模型，但预热耗时超限使测试停止。我只调整处理时限，再补跑缺失案例。"},{"title_en":"More activity produces one-sided steering, not learned driving","zh":"补验只改变C1整段预热预算，神经时间、单帧时钟和总截止时间不变。提高增益的左案例75动作到15秒，右案例70动作到14秒因无进度结束。两例油门都为零，非零转向分别64和60次，全部为负；车头变化约−18.9和−18.6度。更多下行神经元活动确实变成车辆命令，但没有学出方向选择或推进。膜电位还出现约−190毫伏极值，不能把更多脉冲直接称为健康计算。于是我决定超出五个全局量，允许学习独立连接、感觉注入与外部输出，进入C2。","en":"The follow-up changes only C1’s whole-phase processing allowance. Neural duration, per-frame validity, and the global deadline remain. The increased-gain cases finish 75 actions over 15 seconds and 70 actions over 14 seconds, the latter ending for no progress. Throttle stays zero in both. There were 64 and 60 nonzero steering commands, all negative, with heading changes around −18.9 and −18.6 degrees. Greater descending activity reached the vehicle, but it was neither learned directional selection nor propulsion. Membrane minima near −190 millivolts also caution against equating more spikes with healthy computation. I then decided to make more than five global settings learnable. C2 added trainable connections, an input map and an output layer.","title_zh":"C1补验：增益改变引起单向转向，油门仍为零","id":"step-080","summary_en":"More neural activity produced one-sided steering and no throttle. I decided to make individual connections learnable instead of tuning only global gains.","summary_zh":"神经活动增加后，只有单向转向，油门仍为零。我决定让独立连接参与学习，而不再只调全局增益。"},{"title_en":"Replace fixed spiking dynamics with a trainable continuous recurrent core","zh":"C2是计算实现的重要改变，不是给原Java程序装一个优化器。连接图、边的正负号和已有连接关系保留，动力学换成可求梯度的有界连续计算。每个神经元保存一个带符号的数；下一轮把邻居状态按连接加权，加上当前输入和偏置，再与旧状态混合。一次驾驶决策做四轮，所得数继续带到下一决策，这就是本项目的循环状态。输入先是8×8灰度的64个值，加四项公开路线或车辆辅助量，这68个数共同经过68到3324的可学习全连接层和tanh，注入3324个选定R1–R6细胞。1314个下降读出再接小动作头。C2让每条已有边有自己的有界增益，也开放神经元泄漏和偏置。CUDA小图与稀疏求导检查相同，真实大图有615万余边参数改变，才开始车辆PPO。","en":"C2 changed the computation, rather than attaching an optimizer to the old Java program. It kept the connectome’s existing edges and their signs, but replaced spiking dynamics with bounded, differentiable continuous calculations. Each neuron stored a signed numerical state. A new round combined connected neighbors, current input, and bias, then mixed the result with the previous state. Four rounds ran per driving decision, and the resulting values carried into the next decision. That was this project’s recurrent state. Initially, the input was 64 values from an eight-by-eight grayscale image plus four openly specified route or vehicle cues. All 68 values passed through a learned dense 68-to-3,324 map and tanh, which injected drive into 3,324 selected R1–R6 cells, and 1,314 descending features fed small action heads. Each existing edge had a trainable bounded gain, alongside neuron leak and bias parameters. CUDA checks matched sparse and dense derivatives, and real-graph updates changed over 6.15 million edge coordinates before vehicle training began.","title_zh":"C2：把连接组变成可求梯度的连续循环核心","id":"step-081","summary_en":"I replaced the fixed spiking calculation with a continuous recurrent core whose connection gains could learn from recorded driving.","summary_zh":"我把固定脉冲计算改为连续循环核心，让连接增益能够根据驾驶记录学习。"},{"title_en":"The first integrated PPO run changes internal connections","zh":"内部可训练后，第一项要证明实际驾驶经验能更新这些参数。C2先完成128个有效动作、32次优化器更新，约618万边的增益坐标改变。这里的PPO操作是：采样时保存观测、实际动作、当时动作概率和环境奖励；收完一小段后，重算当前策略对相同动作的概率，再限制新旧变化来更新。环境普通离路线会结束一局并重置，不能用的接口间隔则不进训练。图像还是8×8，四个公开辅助量也进入核心，没有直接绕到动作的捷径。四次固定权重驾驶都在约五秒离开保护带，初末持续时间相同。学习链可用，驾驶改善还没出现，因此显式继续短预算。","en":"With internal parameters trainable, the first task was to show that real driving experience updated them. C2 completed 128 valid actions and 32 optimizer updates, changing about 6.18 million edge-gain coordinates. In this project, PPO stored observations, executed actions, their collection-time probabilities, and environment rewards. After a short rollout, it recomputed probabilities for those same actions and limited policy change while updating parameters. Ordinary route-envelope endings reset the episode; unusable interface intervals never became training rows. Input was still eight-by-eight grayscale plus four specified auxiliary cues, all routed through the core without a direct action bypass. Four driving tests with fixed weights ended near five seconds, with unchanged initial-versus-final survival. The learning path worked, but useful control had not improved. I next continued from explicitly saved state under a larger bounded budget.","title_zh":"C2首轮：真实相机PPO确实更新了内部连接","id":"step-082"},{"title_en":"Continue from saved weights and optimizer state","zh":"续学不是随意打开一个文件就算继承。C2第二轮读取第一轮参数和Adam状态，包括优化器的历史一阶、二阶数值与步数；车辆、循环状态和采样种子重新开始，所以不说是同一段物理轨迹接着开。它增加1024个有效动作、256次更新，累计1152动作、288更新，30个完整episode，约615秒wall time，没有接口恢复。内部参数继续改变，训练完成。这里记录新量与累计量、参数与优化器继承，为后来多轮检查点谱系建立了基本做法。接下来把训练结果冻结，独立看初始和末策略驾驶。 Adam 会利用此前梯度的累积统计调整后续更新幅度，因此续训时也恢复这些数值。","en":"A continuation needed a clear definition of what to restore. C2’s second run restored the first run’s parameters and Adam state, including its running estimates of recent gradients and its update count. Adam uses these saved values to set later parameter updates. The vehicle, recurrent state, and sampling seed started fresh, so this was not an uninterrupted physical trajectory. It added 1,024 valid actions and 256 updates, reaching cumulative totals of 1,152 actions and 288 updates. Thirty complete episodes ran in about 615 wall seconds with no interface recoveries. Internal parameters continued changing and training completed. Keeping new and cumulative counts separate, and distinguishing weights from optimizer history, became essential for the later checkpoint lineage. I next froze the trained policy for an independent initial-versus-final driving comparison.","title_zh":"从保存权重和优化器状态继续","id":"step-083"},{"title_en":"A PowerShell warning pipeline interrupts the evaluation","zh":"训练已完成，第一次后续评估却被启动方式中断。PowerShell把标准错误合并送入Tee-Object，在终止式错误处理下把PyTorch的CSR警告当成失败，Python因此停止。完整训练检查点没有受影响。后续核对精确拥有的模拟器进程已退出，时间倍率原字节恢复，但没有观测到最终静止，不能把强制退出写成成功制动。修复改为隐藏启动、标准输出和错误分别存文件，另开新评估，旧失败记录不覆盖。","en":"Training was complete, but the first subsequent evaluation was interrupted by its launcher. PowerShell merges standard error into Tee-Object under terminating-error handling, so a PyTorch CSR warning aborts Python. The completed training checkpoint was unaffected. Later process control checks confirm the exact simulator process had exited and original time-scale bytes were restored. No final stationary observation exists, so forced exit was not described as verified braking. I switched to a hidden process launch with separate output and error files, preserve the interrupted record, and run a fresh evaluation.","title_zh":"C2训练后的评估被PowerShell警告管线中断","id":"step-084","summary_en":"A launcher treated a library warning as a fatal error and interrupted evaluation. The completed checkpoint was intact; I changed the launcher and evaluated again.","summary_zh":"启动器把库警告当作致命错误，打断了评估。已完成的检查点完好，我修改启动方式后重新评估。"},{"title_en":"The trained controller lasted slightly longer, then left the route band","zh":"新评估四个案例完整运行。初始策略两例24、25动作，最终策略28、27动作，分别约5.6和5.4秒，全部在允许的路线距离范围结束。最终均值转向约+0.423，两例都只向正侧输出；多两到四个动作不是可靠驾驶。记录还显示，叫“左”“右”的初始化脉冲并没有保证第一观测需要相反纠正，实际姿态必须另看。最后有效进度与没有终点投影的终止记录也分开。于是下一步用固定权重、相同初始状态的输入干预，问这条计算链到底对什么敏感。","en":"The fresh evaluation completed all four cases. Initial policies lasted 24 and 25 actions; final policies lasted 28 and 27, or about 5.6 and 5.4 seconds. All end at the allowed route-distance band. Final mean steering was about +0.423, with positive-only commands in both cases. The drives lasteded only two to four actions longer. The pulse labels “left” and “right” also did not guarantee that the recorded first observations require opposite corrections, so recorded pose must be inspected. Last valid progress remained distinct from an unavailable terminal projection. I next hold weights and starting state fixed and intervene on inputs to measure which parts of the calculation respond.","title_zh":"训练后稍微多开了一段，仍离开允许路线范围","id":"step-085"},{"title_en":"A strong autonomous background dominates the measured visual differences","zh":"输入诊断让模型从同一状态重放合成左右亮图和已有左右记录，不让车再次运行。合成图像在注入端产生0.431的RMS差，到下降读出只有约2.13×10⁻⁵，转向差约5.95×10⁻⁵。更直接的是，零外部注入仍给+0.42373转向，和有合成图的+0.42482很接近；强制下降读出为零则降到+0.04453。模型有活跃计算，却有很强的共同自主背景。既然随便放大可能把背景一起放大，下一步改为让同一个核心同时推进有输入和无外部输入两份状态，再减去共同轨迹。这个改变进入C3。","en":"The diagnostic replays synthetic left/right brightness patterns and existing recorded sequences from matched states without running the car. Synthetic image differences have injection RMS 0.431, but descending-readout difference was only about 2.13 × 10⁻⁵, and steering difference about 5.95 × 10⁻⁵. More directly, zero external injection still gave steering +0.42373, close to +0.42482 with the synthetic image. Forcing the descending readout to zero reduces it to +0.04453. The model was active, but a common autonomous trajectory dominates these visual differences. Simply increasing gain could amplify that background too. The next change therefore runs the same core with both input-driven and zero-external-drive states, then subtracts their descending outputs. This became C3.","title_zh":"C2为什么像恒定右转：输入差异远小于核心背景输出","id":"step-086","summary_en":"The model produced almost the same steering with no input. I added a parallel no-input calculation to separate image-related activity from that background.","summary_zh":"模型在无输入时也产生了几乎相同的转向。我增加同步无输入计算，把图像相关变化与自身背景活动分开。"},{"title_en":"A paired no-input reference removes a common autonomous trajectory","zh":"C3的无输入参考不是把原状态清零，也不是另一个网络。每个环境有两份数值状态，共用同一组当前连接和偏置：信号分支把64个图像值和四项辅助量共同经过可学68到3324全连接层、tanh，注入3324个R1–R6细胞，参考分支不接外部注入。两份状态都在四轮计算中推进，下降读出相减，再归一化后给动作头。它针对前轮测到的自主背景，让动作头更容易看到由输入造成的差异；偏置本身仍可训练，两条梯度也都保留。先在Desktop做源码匹配的数值和求导检查，记录增加的状态与反向计算开销，合格后才新开车辆学习。图上这是一种工程测量构造，不把相减动画画成已证实的生物机制。","en":"C3’s no-input reference was not a reset of the original state and not a separately trained network. Every environment carries two numerical state columns with the same current connections and biases. The signal branch maps all 64 image values and four specified cues through the learned dense 68-to-3,324 layer and tanh into selected R1–R6 cells; the reference branch received no external injection. Both advance through the same recurrent calculations. I subtract their descending readouts, normalize the difference, and pass it to the action head. This directly targets the autonomous background measured in C2, making input-associated differences easier to read. Core biases remain trainable, and gradients pass through both branches. Source-matched numerical and derivative checks run first on Desktop, with added state and backward costs recorded. This was an engineered measurement construction, followed by a fresh vehicle-learning experiment.","title_zh":"C3先检验无输入参考分支的数值行为","id":"step-087","summary_en":"Both calculations used the same network, but only one received the image. Their output difference became the input to the steering readout.","summary_zh":"两路计算使用同一网络，只有一路接收图像。两路输出之差随后送入转向读出。"},{"title_en":"The differential architecture trains on real vehicle experience","zh":"新架构数值检查后，C3重新训练，不把C2权重原样解释为同一实验。它保留连接图、68项带辅助观测、奖励和动作时间，新增差分归一化读出，仍没有直接辅助动作捷径。1024个有效动作形成256次更新，41个完整episode，没有接口恢复或丢弃rollout，训练和最终停止均完成。它证明两分支梯度可以在实际车辆数据上运行。接着必须冻结参数看控制效果；更清楚的数值信号不会自动变成合适的驾驶动作。","en":"After numerical acceptance, C3 starts fresh vehicle training rather than relabeling C2’s weights as the same experiment. It kept the graph, 68-value assisted observations, reward, and action timing, while adding the differential normalized readout and retaining no direct assistance-to-action bypass. The run completed 1,024 valid actions, 256 updates, and 41 complete episodes, with no interface recoveries or discarded rollouts. Training and final stopping finish normally. This establishes that the paired gradient architecture works on real vehicle data. I then froze parameters to test behavior; a clearer numerical signal did not automatically create appropriate steering.","title_zh":"C3差分读出可以训练，但仍需实际驾驶验证","id":"step-088"},{"title_en":"Reference subtraction does not improve this driving comparison with fixed weights","zh":"冻结比较初始和最终策略后，C3四例都在23到25动作离开保护带。初始两例约4.8、5.0秒，最终4.8、4.6秒，持续时间没有改善。末策略均值转向约+0.47，虽然范围有变化，仍是强正偏。某些最后有效进度较大，但速度和油门也变了，不能把它单独说成路线跟随变好。四例的静止和进程退出都得到核验。我保留这次失败，继续用已冻结的模型诊断输入差异，而不是再给同一PPO配置更多预算。","en":"The fixed-weight initial-versus-final comparison ended all four C3 cases at the allowed route-distance band after 23 to 25 actions. Initial durations were about 4.8 and five seconds; final durations were 4.8 and 4.6. Survival did not improve. The trained mean steering was around +0.47, retaining a strong positive bias despite a varying range. Some last valid progress values were larger, but throttle and speed also changed, so they cannot alone establish better route following. Stationary stopping and process exit were verified in every case. I kept this negative result and inspected input sensitivity in the fixed-weight model rather than immediately extending the unchanged PPO budget.","title_zh":"减去参考后，末策略还是过早离开路线","id":"step-089"},{"title_en":"The path responds numerically, yet keeps a large common steering bias","zh":"固定C3最终权重重放不同输入，确实改变特征和动作。第16次决策，合成左、右亮图分别转0.48679和0.49574，两条真实记录约0.50036和0.49987。它不是完全没视觉响应，但差异围绕共同正偏。全部68观测为零仍转0.11528，因为可学输入层有偏置，零观测不等于零注入；强制归一化读出为零才接近0.00107。这个诊断没有开车，也没有更新参数。短PPO继续没有直接回答怎样学到纠偏，所以后面C4改用公开的几何老师转向目标，固定速度，分别测拟合和真正驾驶。","en":"The fixed-weight C3 model responds numerically to changed inputs. At decision sixteen, synthetic left and right brightness give steering 0.48679 and 0.49574; two recorded sequences give about 0.50036 and 0.49987. The path was not completely visually insensitive, but differences sit around a large common positive bias. All 68 observation values set to zero still produce 0.11528 because the learned input map had a bias; zero observation was not zero injection. Forcing the normalized readout to zero gave about 0.00107. No car or optimizer runs in this diagnostic. I next moved to explicit geometric steering supervision in C4, fixing throttle and evaluating fitting and recorded driving separately.","title_zh":"差分输入不是完全无效，但变化仍围绕共同偏置","id":"step-090","summary_en":"The new path responded to images but still had a large common steering bias. I next supplied explicit steering examples for supervised learning.","summary_zh":"新路径会随图像变化，但仍带有很大的共同转向偏置。我接着提供明确转向示例，改做监督学习。"},{"title_en":"C4 supplies explicit steering examples instead of extending the same PPO trial","zh":"前三轮已经验证能求梯度、能在线更新，但固定权重驾驶仍很差。C4因此改变学习信号：用明确的几何老师转向目标教同一类核心，不再只延长原PPO。物理油门固定0.05，让初末策略不因速度不同掩盖比较。六段采集实际得到354个有效动作，四段用于训练，两段整个保留做验证。标签包含正、负和近零方向，记录实际起点；相反脉冲并不产生对称车头误差。老师要求制动时，该段保留前面的转向例子后结束。这个数据集是带公开路线和姿态辅助的监督学习资料，接下来先看拟合，再看冻结神经控制。","en":"The previous rounds establish gradients and online updates, yet driving test with fixed weights remaineded poor. C4 therefore changes the learning signal rather than simply extending the same PPO trial. A disclosed geometric teacher supplied explicit steering targets to the same kind of trainable core. Physical throttle was fixed at 0.05, making initial and final vehicle tests easier to compare. Six collected episodes produce 354 valid actions: four whole episodes train the model, and two were retained for validation. Targets include negative, near-zero, and positive steering, with recorded starting poses recorded. Opposite initialization pulses did not create symmetric heading errors. When the teacher requests braking, the preceding steering examples remain and the segment ended. This was assisted supervised data. I next measured fitting and then fixed-weight neural driving separately.","title_zh":"C4：先明确教转向，不再仅靠短PPO探索","id":"step-091"},{"title_en":"Supervised core learning fits both steering signs","zh":"训练读取这批既有轨迹，让连接增益、感觉注入和输出层共同学习转向。每次只对一小段16步计算梯度；前面的输入仍从局首按当前参数重算，避免改了权重却沿用旧状态。这种限制反传长度的做法就是这里使用的TBPTT。128次更新约256秒完成，最佳验证点也是第128次。验证平衡误差从0.1544降到0.0713，方向符号准确率93.6%，内部约618万边坐标改变。负目标虽然能判负，幅度仍偏小。这里先证明老师标签可以学进去，下一项才让这份权重自己驾驶，老师不接管转向。","en":"Training reads the saved trajectories and updates connection gains, sensory injection, and the output layer for steering. Gradients cover a selected sixteen-step chunk. Earlier inputs were still replayed from the episode beginning with current parameters, avoiding a hidden state computed with old weights. Limiting the gradient history in this way was the project’s truncated backpropagation through time, or TBPTT. All 128 updates finish in about 256 seconds, and the best validation point was also update 128. Balanced validation MAE fell from 0.1544 to 0.0713, directional sign accuracy reached 93.6 percent, and about 6.18 million edge coordinates change. Negative targets were predicted with the correct sign but insufficient magnitude. I next let these fixed-weight weights drive without teacher steering intervention.","title_zh":"C4学会双符号标签，先确认这不是只学会固定顺序","id":"step-092"},{"title_en":"Driving lasts longer after supervision, but still ends off course","zh":"冻结初始和128次更新的最佳策略，用相同0.05油门与两种保留起点驾驶。初始只到5.2和5.6秒，学习后到14.4和13.6秒，最后有效进度也明显增加，而且两种转向都实际出现。这是真实改善，同时四条都在路线保护带处结束，没有完成路线。读旧数据还发现，单按动作序号平均的标签预测比神经策略更好：负转向集中在共同的后半段，数据没有充分区分“记住一套转向顺序”和“根据偏离纠正”。所以下一步不是手工加转向增益，而是采集学习器自己访问到的错误状态，补对应纠偏目标。","en":"I froze the initial policy and the selected update-128 policy, then drive both at the same 0.05 throttle from two held-out initialization cases. Initial drives lasted 5.2 and 5.6 seconds; learned drives lasted 14.4 and 13.6. Last valid progress increased, and both steering signs were actually used. This was a measured improvement, while all four runs still end at the allowed route-distance band without route completion. A saved-data check also finds that an action-index mean predicts validation labels better than the neural policy. Negative labels cluster later in a common sequence, so the data did not clearly distinguish memorized steering timing from deviation-sensitive correction. I next collected labels at states visited by the learner itself, rather than manually increasing output gain.","title_zh":"C4实车时间变长，但全部仍在保护带处结束","id":"step-093"},{"title_en":"Corrective data cover states reached by the learner","zh":"C5从C4最佳128次权重出发，把物理油门降到0.03，并在新旧固定权重评估都使用这个速度。六段采集里，较大初始化脉冲用学习器自己开车，另两段明确混合一半老师、一半学习器，验证段仍由学习器控制。共639条有效观测和老师标签，训练467条，验证172条，300个混合动作单独标记。纯学习器段会离开保护带，混合段达到150动作上限。这样补到了原策略真正走偏的状态，而不是只重复理想老师轨迹。下一步从原权重开始、使用新的Adam状态拟合这些纠偏标签。","en":"C5 starts from C4’s selected update-128 weights. Physical throttle became 0.03, and both old and new policies would later be tested at that same speed. In six collection episodes, larger initialization pulses use learner-only steering; two other training episodes explicitly mix teacher and learner actions equally. Validation episodes remain learner-controlled. I collected 639 valid observations and teacher labels, split into 467 training and 172 validation labels. The 300 mixed actions were labeled separately. Learner-only segments leave the envelope, while mixed segments reach the 150-action horizon. This adds states the existing policy actually visits when it goes wrong, rather than repeating only ideal teacher trajectories. The next fit warm-starts the weights with a fresh Adam optimizer.","title_zh":"C5把老师标签带到学习器自己走偏的位置","id":"step-094"},{"title_en":"Better corrective fit selects update 224, while training stops at 227","zh":"C5监督训练仍从局首按当前权重重算历史，在16步片段反传。它计划最多256次更新，实际因预留保存时间的wall预算在227次停止，最佳验证权重是224次，最终权重是227次，二者分别保存。平衡验证误差从0.5013降到0.4346。这里三个符号类别被等权处理，只有14条近零训练目标却获得三分之一目标权重，这可能影响更新波动，但还没有因果证据。误差改善不能代替驾驶结果。后面使用选定224次模型，与C4在相同0.03油门和新起点冻结比较。","en":"C5 again replays each episode prefix with current weights and backpropagates through sixteen-step chunks. It permits up to 256 updates, but the wall-budget guard stops at 227 with time reserved for saving. Validation selected update 224, while the final checkpoint was update 227; both identities remained separate. Balanced validation MAE fell from 0.5013 to 0.4346. The objective weights the three sign classes equally, giving fourteen near-zero training labels one third of the total weight. This may affect update variance, but it was not a demonstrated cause. The next check measures recorded driving. I next compared the selected update-224 policy with C4 under matched 0.03 throttle and new initialization cases.","title_zh":"C5监督误差下降，但最佳与最终检查点要分开","id":"step-095"},{"title_en":"The corrective policy regresses under matched driving conditions","zh":"同样0.03油门下，C4两例持续14.6和18.6秒，C5最佳224次权重只持续14.0和14.8秒，全部触发允许的路线范围。最后有效进度也从4.118、5.558降到3.873、4.272，C5负转向更少且更弱。两组命令起点匹配，实际位置和朝向的小差异另记。这个结果必须与标签误差改善同时讲：监督fit变好，固定权重驾驶没有变好。暂时也没有唯一的优化或生物原因。中断一段时间后，我优先把核心冻住，只让小输出头学习，检查特征是否有纠偏信息。","en":"At matched physical throttle 0.03, C4 drives lasted 14.6 and 18.6 seconds, while C5’s selected update-224 policy lasted only 14.0 and 14.8. All cases hit the allowed route-distance band. Last valid progress fell from 4.118 and 5.558 to 3.873 and 4.272, with fewer and weaker negative steering commands in C5. Nominal starts matched, and small recorded pose differences were recorded. This result belonged alongside the improved label fit: supervised error improved, but driving performance regressed. After a pause, I held the core fixed and trained only small output heads to ask whether useful correction information was already present in the features.","title_zh":"C5反而比相同速度的C4更早离开保护带","id":"step-096"},{"title_en":"Fixed-weight representations support much better small steering heads","zh":"C6是一项保存数据诊断，不再采新车轨迹。分别冻结C4和C5核心，把同639条观测按原局内顺序重放，取归一化下行神经元特征；另有原68项观测的诊断比较。每种表示都用均匀和符号平衡两种损失，共六个小头，各512次更新。C4回放重建原动作误差约6×10⁻⁸，原核心哈希不变。C5均匀头的平衡验证误差为0.0998，方向准确率98.77%，比此前共同优化明显更容易拟合。它显示当前神经读出里有可用区分，不能把问题概括成核心没信息。选定头单独保存，再与C5核心组合做真实驾驶。","en":"C6 was a saved-data diagnostic, not new vehicle collection. I froze C4 and C5 cores separately and replay the same 639 observations in their original within-episode order, extracting normalized descending features. Raw 68-value observations provide an explicitly diagnostic comparison. Uniform and sign-balanced objectives give six small heads, each trained for 512 updates. C4 replay reconstructs collector actions within about 6 × 10⁻⁸, and original core hashes remain unchanged. The C5 uniform head reached balanced validation MAE 0.0998 and 98.77-percent directional accuracy. Stable features could therefore support a much better-fitted output head; the earlier failure was not adequately described as a core containing no information. I saved the selected head separately and combine it with the preserved C5 core for recorded driving.","title_zh":"C6：先冻住核心，看看输出层是否能读出有效纠偏信息","id":"step-097"},{"title_en":"Changing only the selected head extends both drives to thirty seconds","zh":"组合前先核对算术一致，并确认输入层、核心和未用油门行没变。C5核心加C6均匀下降头在相同0.03油门、±0.65脉冲下，两例都到150动作、30秒上限，没有触发允许的路线范围。进度约9.84，明显超过C4和C5先前失败段。实际双符号转向始终由组合策略输出，老师混合为零，参数冻结。不过方向幅度接近全负、正向也很大，明显摆动依旧。它是当前最强的短时带路线辅助控制，不是一次重新训练核心的改善。下一步先不改参数，延长时间并增加起点，看看优势能保持多久。","en":"Before driving, I verified the composition arithmetic and confirm unchanged input mapping, core, and unused throttle row. The C5 core plus C6 uniform descending head reached the 150-action, thirty-second horizon in both matched cases at 0.03 throttle, without envelope termination. Progress was about 9.84, beyond the earlier C4 and C5 failure segments. Both steering signs come from the composed policy, teacher mixing stays zero, and parameters remain fixed. However, commands sometimes approach full negative steering, with large positive commands too; oscillation remained obvious. This was the strongest measured short assisted controller so far, achieved by selecting an output head rather than retraining the core during evaluation. I next extended the unchanged policy’s horizon and starting conditions.","title_zh":"只重新学读出后，两次驾驶都到30秒，但转向明显摆动","id":"step-098"},{"title_en":"The same assisted policy reaches five ninety-second horizons","zh":"C7不训练，保持C5核心加C6头的完整参数，重复原两脉冲再加零和±0.90，共五种起点。每例450动作、约90秒，五例都到上限，没有无效间隔或老师动作。路线进度约31.06到31.41，相当于42.929单位开放路线的72%到73%，route_finished全部为假。转向每局在近零带外翻向39到46次，并接近正负极值。这个记录扩展了多弯和长时跟随的证据，却仍有摆动，也没有足够时间看路线末端。依据后段速度估算，走完约需123秒，因此C8只把本轮独立环境上限明确延到150秒，其余不变。","en":"C7 performs no training. It preserves the complete C5-core/C6-head composition, repeats the two previous pulses, and adds zero and ±0.90, giving five starts. Every case reached 450 actions and approximately ninety seconds, without invalid intervals or teacher actions. Progress ranges from 31.06 to 31.41, about 72 to 73 percent of the 42.929-unit open route, and every route-finished flag was false. Steering reverses outside the near-zero band 39 to 46 times per case and approaches both extremes. This extends the evidence to longer, multi-bend assisted following while retaining obvious oscillation. It still did not observe the route end. Measured late speed suggests about 123 seconds for traversal, so C8 explicitly extends only its own environment horizon to 150 seconds.","title_zh":"C7：同一策略到90秒，仍没走完整路线","id":"step-099"},{"title_en":"Five repeated starts reach the end of the exported open route","zh":"这时64个灰度值和四项路线/车辆辅助量仍共同经过68到3324的可学习全连接映射、tanh，送入3324个R1–R6细胞；本轮映射权重冻结。C8的改变很窄：沿用同一固定权重策略、同五起点、同0.03油门，把内部120秒限制明确延长到150秒。最终五例分别609到612动作、约121.8到122.4秒，全到导出开放路线末端。这个结论还用连续局部弧长、最后第257段和端点余量独立核对，不只信一个完成标记。平均路线距离约0.071到0.073，最大约0.21；老师动作和新更新都是零。这里可以完整展示真实路线完成，也要保留显著转向摆动和公开的路线辅助。下一步不先庆祝分辨率，而是在这些保存记录上干预图像与辅助量，查哪些输入实际影响动作。","en":"The 64 grayscale values and four route or vehicle cues still pass together through the fixed-weight learned dense 68-to-3,324 map and tanh into 3,324 R1–R6 cells. C8 made a narrow change: the same fixed-weight policy, five starts, and 0.03 throttle now have an explicit 150-second environment horizon instead of the inherited 120 seconds. All five cases reach the exported open-route endpoint after 609 to 612 actions, or about 121.8 to 122.4 seconds. Independent checks confirm continuous local arc progress, final segment 257, and the endpoint margin rather than trusting a summary flag alone. Mean route distance was about 0.071 to 0.073, with maxima near 0.21. Teacher actions and new updates remain zero. I could show genuine route completion while preserving steering oscillation and specified route assistance. The next step intervenes on saved camera and auxiliary inputs to measure what actually changes the action.","title_zh":"C8：有路线辅助的固定权重策略五次到达导出路线末端","id":"step-100"},{"title_en":"Saved-stream interventions show visual dependence without inventing alternative drives","zh":"C9从C8的3056个真实动作历史重放，原动作复现误差小于预先容差。每局五个锚点复制同一对循环状态，再各自运行固定画面、水平镜像、车头误差、横向误差和速度改动，共200分支、3200行。仅镜像图像，第一步平均绝对转向差约0.0525；往后15步约0.5526，冻结画面也改变后续动作。相机差异确实经过注入、下降差分和归一化传到转向。但这些分支继续读取原来未来画面，车没有随改后命令重新走，所以是保存输入干预，不是反事实驾驶视频。辅助量改动尺度也不同，不能算视觉贡献百分比。接下来查看原图压成8×8到底丢了什么。","en":"C9 replays all 3,056 recorded C8 action histories, reproducing original actions within the specified tolerance. At five anchors per episode, it copies the same paired recurrent state and branches into fixed-camera, horizontal-mirror, heading, lateral-error, and speed edits. There were 200 branches and 3,200 rows. Mirroring only the image changes immediate steering by mean absolute 0.0525, rising to about 0.5526 over the following fifteen recorded decisions. Freezing the image also changes later actions. Camera differences therefore propagate through injection, descending subtraction, normalization, and steering. However, branches continue consuming the original future images; no car was rerun under altered commands. These were saved-stream interventions, not alternative driving videos. Auxiliary perturbation scales differ too, so they did not define contribution percentages. I next examined the eight-by-eight compression itself.","title_zh":"C9：8×8图像和辅助路线线索各自会改变输出吗","id":"step-101"},{"title_en":"Eight-by-eight compression and retinal coverage are separate design choices","zh":"我从C8原始字节流恢复12张160×120图像，按时间和哈希对应，再重新计算历史8×8观测，数值匹配。把原图、8×8和32×24并排，可以直接看见低分辨率怎样丢掉车道边缘与标记细节。这是已有图像分析，没有运行新驾驶策略。8×8最初是工程简化，并不是已证明的生物或算力上限。进一步审计模型眼柱发现，3324个R1到R6输入细胞只占819列，在前方可见817列中只有216列含这些输入。提高像素数还不够，必须决定亮度送到哪些真实模型位置。于是C10保留原图，直接采817可见方向，并明确补充到L1/L2。","en":"I recovered twelve original 160-by-120 C8 images from the raw byte stream, match their times and hashes, and reproduce the historical eight-by-eight observations. Placing the originals beside eight-by-eight and 32-by-24 views made lost lane-edge and marking detail visible. This was analysis of saved images, not a new driving policy. Eight-by-eight was an engineering simplification, not an established biological or compute limit. A separate retinal audit finds that the 3,324 selected R1–R6 cells occupy only 819 model columns, and just 216 of the 817 visible front columns contain them. More pixels alone therefore did not solve spatial assignment. C10 retained original images, samples all 817 visible directions, and explicitly supplements the input through L1/L2.","title_zh":"8×8只是工程简化；保留原相机再对齐真实模型方向","id":"step-102","summary_en":"Saved images showed what the coarse grid lost, while cell annotations exposed a separate coverage gap. The next input used spatial samples and L1/L2 cells.","summary_zh":"原图展示了粗网格丢失的细节，细胞注释则暴露了另一个覆盖缺口。下一种输入采用空间采样和 L1/L2 细胞。"},{"title_en":"Recover the original C5 images before changing the input path","zh":"C10先做数据准备，不另采新驾驶来混淆变化。此前C5保存的相机原始流恢复出639张不同JPEG，整局训练和验证划分保持原样。重新生成旧8×8值的最大差约3×10⁻⁸，确认这批原图确实对应旧输入。646个导出文件逐项核验后，才把这些图像按817个实际可见方向采样。这样新输入不是把8×8放大，也不是借用其他案例的画面；它来自当初同一批观测。接着从C5核心和C6读出建立新的空间适配器试验。","en":"C10 first prepares data without collecting new drives that would mix up the comparison. The saved C5 camera byte stream yields 639 distinct original JPEGs, preserving the whole-episode training and validation split. Recreated legacy eight-by-eight values differ by at most about 3 × 10⁻⁸, confirming correspondence with the historical inputs. All 646 exported payloads were verified before sampling the images along 817 visible model directions. This was not upscaling the old grid or borrowing images from another case. The next pilot started from preserved C5 core and C6 head ancestry with a new specified spatial adapter.","title_zh":"C10先从旧C5数据恢复真实原图，保持整段划分","id":"step-103","summary_en":"I recovered the original training images so the input change could use the same trajectories and data split.","summary_zh":"我恢复原训练图像，让新的输入方式继续使用同一批轨迹和训练、验证划分。"},{"title_en":"Use visible eye-column brightness to drive L1/L2 explicitly","zh":"C10每次从原图提取817个0到1亮度，按眼柱映射送到L1/L2目标。选择它们的具体理由是R1到R6在当前前视缺很多列，而L1/L2可为全部可见列提供声明的工程入口；这不是重建完整生物视网膜。四个路线或速度辅助量仍经独立分支存在。256次监督更新约442秒，内部边、神经元参数和输入层都改变，但转移来的动作头几乎负向饱和，验证误差只从1.1793变1.1415。更细输入能运算并不保证旧头兼容。下一步因此保留新核心与输入不变，只训练新的小输出头，而不是将此误差直接说成817输入没有信息。","en":"C10 extracts 817 brightness values between zero and one from each original image and maps them to specified L1/L2 targets. The concrete reason was coverage: R1–R6 cells were absent from many visible columns, while L1/L2 provide an engineered entry for all visible columns. This was not a reconstruction of a complete biological retina. Four route or speed cues remain in a separate disclosed branch. The pilot completed 256 supervised updates in about 442 seconds, changing internal edges, neuron parameters, and input mapping. Yet the transferred action head was strongly negative-saturated, and validation MAE improves only from 1.1793 to 1.1415. The changed input required a newly fitted readout. I therefore kept the new core and input and recalibrate only a new small output head.","title_zh":"C10：用817个方向把可见亮度直接送到L1/L2","id":"step-104"},{"title_en":"A new head reads the new spatial representation","zh":"独立读出校准把C10核心、空间输入和辅助分支冻结，先提取神经特征，再训练新头512次，验证选择第480次。误差从1.1415降到0.1220，训练均值常数为0.5921，定义好的非零标签子集方向准确率95.1%。安装时核对所有非头参数未变。这一步清楚区分256次核心训练与512次外部头训练，不能把它们说成同一批新驾驶经验。组合检查点SHA以5e837开头，后来C11、C14与C15的谱系都必须追到这个具体C10表示。下一步先冻结组合，做两次真实30秒驾驶。","en":"The separate recalibration freezes C10’s core, spatial input, and auxiliary branch, extracts neural features, and trains a new head for 512 updates. Validation selected update 480. MAE fell from 1.1415 to 0.1220, compared with a constant training-mean predictor at 0.5921. Directional accuracy was 95.1 percent on the defined nonzero-target subset. Installation checks confirm unchanged non-head parameters. This clearly separates the 256 core-learning updates from the 512 external-head updates; they were not newly collected driving experience. The composed checkpoint hash began 5e837. Later C11, C14, and C15 provenance must refer to this exact C10 representation. I next froze the composition for two real thirty-second driving checks.","title_zh":"C10独立校准读出，避免把旧head失配当核心无信息","id":"step-105"},{"title_en":"The spatial-input policy drives, but oscillates more than the older assisted baseline","zh":"组合C10自己驾驶两例，各150动作、30秒，没有老师动作或直接绕路，参数不变。两种转向都出现，说明817路径和动作链可以运行。但相对C6，同样起点与0.03油门，平均路线距离从约0.043、0.046变成0.118、0.121，最大距离接近0.5工程界限，动作摆动也更大，进度略低。输入、核心和头都改变，因此不能只归因于分辨率。旧C6/C8完整路线辅助基线继续保留。之后C11单独从C10出发关辅助做可训练核心PPO；另一条后来主线则回到C10冻结核心，让C14重新学习纯视觉外部读出。","en":"The composed C10 policy drives two cases for 150 actions and thirty seconds each, with no teacher steering or direct bypass and unchanged parameters. Both steering signs occur, so the 817-sample control path operates. However, at the matched 0.03 throttle and reused starts, mean route distance rose from about 0.043 and 0.046 in C6 to 0.118 and 0.121 in C10. Maxima approach the 0.5 engineering limit, steering oscillation increased, and progress was slightly lower. Input mapping, core, and head all change, so image resolution alone was not the isolated cause. I kept the stronger C6/C8 assisted baseline. C11 next branches from C10 for camera-only trainable-core PPO; the later main line returns to the fixed-weight C10 representation for fresh C14 heads.","title_zh":"C10两次到30秒，却比旧辅助策略摆得更大","id":"step-106"},{"title_en":"C11 is a separate camera-only internal-learning branch","zh":"C11明确关掉四个辅助输入，辅助注入权重归零并冻结。运行时只有817相机采样和循环历史进入动作计算，路线几何只在外部算奖励与评估；油门固定0.03，PPO只学一个转向动作。它从已有辅助训练历史的C10组合权重开始，但本轮是纯相机运行。实际1024个新transition、128次更新、29个完整离路线episode，样本复用两轮共2048次，没有无效间隔或丢弃。内部约618万边坐标改变，每次当前参数重算历史的概率校验通过。这是一条独立内部学习分支。它的最终权重没有成为后续C14/C15主策略祖先，接着先看它自己的冻结初末比较。","en":"C11 explicitly zeros all four auxiliary input values and zeroes and freezes the assistance injection weights. During operation, only 817 camera samples and recurrent history enter action computation; route geometry remained outside the policy for reward and assessment. Throttle was fixed at 0.03, and PPO learns one steering action. The warm start was the assisted-ancestry C10 composition, while this run itself was camera-only. It completed 1,024 new transitions, 128 updates, and 29 complete offroad episodes. Two epochs give 2,048 sample uses, with no invalid intervals or discarded rollouts. About 6.18 million edge coordinates change, and current-parameter history probability checks pass. This was a separate internal-learning branch. Its final weights did not become the ancestor of the later C14/C15 main policy. I next examined its own fixed-weight initial/final behavior.","title_zh":"C11独立分支：关掉路线辅助，第一次让视觉核心在线PPO学习","id":"step-107"},{"title_en":"C11 learned internally but did not improve driving","zh":"同样两脉冲的冻结比较里，初始策略持续6.8和7.8秒，最终策略6.2和7.0秒，最后有效进度也下降，四例全部触发路线保护。训练时随机探索两个转向都有，最终确定性策略却只给负向，约−0.1225到−0.0227。这个差别应在回放中直观看见，不能选训练里一个好瞬间当最终表现。C11证明相机在线经验确实更新核心，没有在这次小样本中改善控制。原因没有唯一诊断。后面探索保存图像预测和信息读出时，仍回到C10表示做新的独立对照，不把C11末权重悄悄接成主线。","en":"In the matched fixed-weight comparison, initial policies lasted 6.8 and 7.8 seconds, while final policies lasted 6.2 and seven. Last valid progress also fell, and all four cases hit the allowed route-distance band. Stochastic training uses both steering signs, but the final deterministic policy produced only negative steering, approximately −0.1225 to −0.0227. C11 verified that online camera experience updated the internal core, but this bounded sample did not improve control. Subsequent saved-image prediction and readout studies returned to C10 for separate comparisons; C11’s final weights were not silently promoted into the main lineage.","title_zh":"C11完成内部学习，但驾驶没有改善","id":"step-108"},{"title_en":"The first prediction diagnostic stops at dependency loading","zh":"C12第一启动0.216秒就因找不到Torch退出，没有构造模型、训练或车辆。新入口误把依赖包当成直接位于工具目录，实际在锁版本的子目录。修复改用已经核验过的统一运行时加载器，原试验参数不动，旧失败文件也保留。第二次另开空目录执行同一个预测对照。这个小失败说明依赖准备和科学结果必须分开，不能把启动失败算作一个预测负结果。","en":"The first C12 launch exits after 0.216 seconds because Torch cannot be found. It constructs no model and performs no training or vehicle work. The new entry point assumes packages sit directly in a tools directory, while the recorded installation was in a lock-versioned subdirectory. I used the existing verified runtime loader, leave the scientific parameters unchanged, preserve the failed files, and launch the comparison in a new empty directory. This was a dependency failure, not a negative prediction result.","title_zh":"C12第一启动在Torch依赖目录选择处停止","id":"step-109","summary_en":"The prediction test stopped because its entry point could not find Torch. I fixed dependency loading before running the comparison.","summary_zh":"预测测试因入口找不到 Torch 而停止。我先修正依赖加载，再运行比较。"},{"title_en":"A bounded visual-prediction trial does not beat simple persistence","zh":"C12比较同一起点的冻结核心与可训练核心，都只读已有639张原相机图派生的817采样，不开模拟器，不使用老师转向或路线输入。各臂64次更新，495次重复相邻对呈现来自463个独立训练对；验证有170对。138秒后，可训练臂651万余参数元素改变，冻结臂没变，但验证MAE几乎相同：0.043653对0.043651。直接把当前帧复制成下一帧反而为0.031857。它没有建立这个一步预测任务的实用优势，也没有测驾驶。下一步不立即扩大同配置，先冻结C10，比较视觉神经元、下降读出和直接图像控制里还能读出什么信息。","en":"C12 compares fixed-weight and trainable cores from an identical starting point, using 817 samples from the saved original camera images. No simulator runs, and there were no teacher steering targets or route inputs. Each arm completed 64 updates and 495 reused adjacent-pair presentations from 463 unique training pairs, with 170 validation pairs. After about 138 seconds, more than 6.51 million parameter elements change in the trainable arm and none in the fixed-weight arm. Validation MAEs were almost identical: 0.043653 and 0.043651. Simply copying the current frame as the next frame performs better at 0.031857. This one-step prediction trial showed no practical advantage. Driving was tested separately. I next froze C10 and inspect information available at different readouts before scaling it.","title_zh":"C12：训练核心预测下一帧，并没有胜过复制当前帧","id":"step-110"},{"title_en":"Both tested neural readouts carry visual information","zh":"C13用相同C10核心、关闭辅助，对639个原观测重放。下行神经元和T4/T5各取1314项，另有原视网膜、动作加时长两个诊断对照。八个相同容量小头各更新256次，分别学当前画面重建或下一帧变化。当前画面的验证误差，T4/T5为0.08134，DN为0.09539，都比动作控制与训练均值好；把图像固定为第一帧后误差升高，说明读出确有相机依赖信息。下一帧指标则混合，神经改善很小，直接相机RMSE改善却MAE变差。较早读出更会重建不代表更会开车，因此C14在真实相机在线PPO中用相同预算比较DN和T4/T5。","en":"C13 replays the same 639 observations through the unchanged C10 core with assistance disabled. It compares matched 1,314-entry DN and T4/T5 readouts with raw-retinal and action-plus-duration controls. Eight equal-capacity diagnostic heads received 256 updates each, learning either current-scene reconstruction or next-frame change. Current-scene validation MAE was 0.08134 for T4/T5 and 0.09539 for DN, better than action-only and mean-scene controls. Holding the camera at its first frame raises neural errors, demonstrating camera-dependent information in both readouts. Next-frame results were mixed: neural improvement was tiny, while raw-image RMSE improves but MAE worsens. The next comparison tested whether that readout could steer. C14 therefore compares DN and T4/T5 in recorded camera-only online PPO under a matched budget.","title_zh":"C13：视觉和DN都保留可解码图像信息，预测收益仍很弱","id":"step-111"},{"title_en":"The main policy line starts a fresh DN head on the fixed-weight C10 representation","zh":"C14的继承关系要从文件核对：两臂都恢复同一份5e837开头的C10核心和输入映射，全部冻结；没有使用C11最终核心。下降臂重新初始化1314到64的动作与价值头，与T4/T5臂的初始头一致。输入817相机值，四辅助量零，只有外部头做PPO。它完成1024个新transition、128次头更新、27个普通离路线episode。冻结初末两起点从6.8/7.8秒到7.4/8.8秒，仍全部离开包络，末策略正向偏置。这个短比较没有可靠驾驶，但这份DN头和Adam被明确保存，SHA以4add01开头，之后C15沿此续学。","en":"C14’s ancestry must be read from files, not inferred from its number. Both arms restored the same C10 core and input mapping, with hash beginning 5e837, and held them fixed. They did not use C11’s final core. The DN arm initialised fresh 1,314-to-64 actor and value heads, identical initially to the visual arm. Input consisted of 817 camera values with four auxiliary zeros; only external heads received PPO updates. It completed 1,024 new transitions, 128 head updates, and 27 ordinary offroad episodes. driving test with fixed weights changed from 6.8/7.8 seconds to 7.4/8.8, still ending offroad in every case with a positive steering bias. Reliable driving was not achieved, but this DN head and Adam were explicitly saved under hash beginning 4add01. C15 continued that exact state.","title_zh":"C14 DN臂：回到C10核心，重新学纯视觉外部读出","id":"step-112"},{"title_en":"Reading earlier visual neurons does not win this short driving comparison","zh":"T4/T5臂只把读出位置换到较早视觉群，宽度仍1314，使用同初始头、种子、奖励、相机、起点和训练量。它也收1024个新transition、做128次更新，26个完整离路线episode。初始两例6.8和7.8秒，最终7.0和8.0秒，仍全部离开包络，表现没有超过这一次DN臂。两臂上游参数都未改变，所以它测试读出位置，不是内部核心学习。读取视觉群也绕过下游生物motor电路，作为工程控制器明确说明。基于这次有限发展性结果，下一轮选择DN头继续增加经验，不把DN一般优越当既定结论。","en":"The T4/T5 arm changes only readout location to an earlier visual population. Width remained 1,314, with matched initial heads, seed, reward, camera, starts, and interaction budget. It also collected 1,024 new transitions and performs 128 updates, with 26 complete offroad episodes. Initial drives lasted 6.8 and 7.8 seconds; final drives lasted seven and eight, all ending at the envelope. It did not outperform the DN arm in this short campaign. Upstream parameters remain unchanged, so the comparison tests readout location rather than internal-core learning. Reading visual neurons bypasses downstream biological motor circuitry and was an explicit engineering controller. I chose the DN head for the next bounded continuation without claiming DN was generally superior.","title_zh":"C14视觉臂：更早的神经读出没有在短驾驶中胜出","id":"step-113"},{"title_en":"Continue the exact C14 DN head and optimizer, with a larger learning budget","zh":"C15准确恢复C14下降头和完整Adam历史，继续用冻结的C10核心。重新开始车辆和循环状态，不假称接续父轮同一物理轨迹。它同时改变经验预算与更新配方：每收128步，分64样本小批，重复四轮，最多8192个新动作。实际8192条全部优化，512次新更新，128个完整训练episode，没有恢复、丢弃或训练错误，约4136秒。这里每条新样本被重复使用四次，与新增经验数分开。0、2048、4096、8192新步都存检查点并固定权重评估。后来的主线来自这条C10表示加C14/C15读出训练关系，而不是C11末核心。","en":"C15 restored the exact C14 DN head and saved optimizer state while keeping the C10 core fixed. The vehicle and recurrent state restarted, so this was not the parent’s uninterrupted physical trajectory. It changed both experience budget and update recipe: collect 128 steps, form 64-sample minibatches, and reuse them over four epochs, up to 8,192 new actions. All 8,192 were optimized, with 512 new updates and 128 complete training episodes. There were no recoveries, discarded rollouts, or training errors, and the run took about 4,136 seconds. Four uses of each sample remained separate from newly collected experience. Checkpoints at zero, 2,048, 4,096, and 8,192 new steps received fixed-weight evaluations. This C10 representation plus C14/C15 readout lineage was the later main-policy ancestry, not C11’s final core.","title_zh":"C15：续C14的DN读出，更长训练先改善又退步","id":"step-114"},{"title_en":"The four-thousand-step milestone is strongest; the final policy regresses","zh":"C15的完整曲线比只给最终成绩更有解释力。四个检查点各用五种已声明起点，全部20次固定权重评估都完成。平均驾驶时长依次8.16、15.96、19.32和10.90秒。4096新步时每例都用双向转向，8192步仍有四例双向，但所有评估都最终离开允许的路线范围。4096到8192，持续时间降43.58%，记录进度降51.74%，所以“训练更久就更好”在此不成立。5760到6016附近较大更新支持稳定性假设，却没有确定因果；探索也没有崩成单向。最佳中途点和最终退步都保留，后面才研究并行、效率与更新稳定性。","en":"C15’s full curve was more informative than a final score alone. Each of four checkpoints received five specified starts, and all twenty fixed-weight evaluations complete. Mean duration changes from 8.16 to 15.96 to 19.32, then fell to 10.90 seconds. At 4,096 new steps, every case uses both steering signs; at 8,192, four still do. Nevertheless, all evaluations eventually leave the allowed route-distance band. From 4,096 to 8,192, duration fell 43.58 percent and recorded progress 51.74 percent. Longer training was not monotonically better here. Larger updates around 5,760 to 6,016 support an update-stability hypothesis, but did not establish its cause, and recorded exploration had not collapsed. I kept both the strongest intermediate checkpoint and final regression before the later work on parallelism, efficiency, and update stability.","title_zh":"C15四千步最好，最终八千步退步；20次全部offroad","id":"step-115"},{"title_zh":"先让同一模型在Roihu上使用正确的计算环境","title_en":"First, make the same model run in the right environment","zh":"这时模型和读出已经在Windows上运行过，但Roihu现有的x86计算包是CPU版。给作业分配GPU，并不会自动改变软件。我先准备同版CUDA计算环境。第一次安装器要求应用目录有24 GiB空间，而那里整个文件系统只有15 GiB，所以立即停止。随后把临时下载放到scratch，又依次修正NVIDIA下载来源和三个辅助包缺少哈希的问题。最终27个安装包都核验通过。这些是安装准备，下一步才用保存的真实输入检查两台机器算得是否一致。","en":"At this point, the model and its readout had already run on Windows. Roihu's existing x86 package was a CPU build. Allocating a GPU would not change that software. I therefore prepared a matching CUDA environment first. The first installer stopped because it demanded 24 GiB in an application filesystem whose total size was only 15 GiB. I moved temporary downloads to scratch, then corrected the NVIDIA download allowlist and missing hashes for three auxiliary packages. All 27 packages were eventually verified. This established the software environment. The next step was to replay saved real inputs and check numerical agreement.","sequence_zh":["初始APP24GiB守卫拒绝，未创建工作区/下载包。","scratch-aware版本24.791s完成解析，来源allowlist拒绝，未安装。","r2暴露三wheel缺hash。","r3精确版本hash核验后安装。"],"sequence_en":["The original 24-GiB application-space guard refused before workspace creation or downloads.","The scratch-aware version resolved dependencies but rejected the NVIDIA download source before installation.","The next revision exposed missing hash metadata for three auxiliary wheels.","The final revision verified exact-version hashes and completed installation."],"id":"step-116","summary_en":"Roihu's installed package could not use the GPU. I prepared and checked the matching CUDA environment before testing the migrated model.","summary_zh":"Roihu 已装的软件包不能使用 GPU。我先准备并核对匹配的 CUDA 环境，再测试迁移后的模型。"},{"title_zh":"容器里的Python路径与主机不一样","title_en":"The Python path inside the container was different","zh":"安装完成后，提交准备又在解释器身份检查处停下。原因是程序只认识通用路径，没有认识CSC容器里实际使用的Python文件。它在预算操作和提交作业之前就拒绝了。修正版明确核验实际解释器路径和文件哈希，保留原失败记录。模型公式和检查点没有因此改变。之后才进入GPU上的数值迁移检查。","en":"After installation, submission preparation stopped at an interpreter identity check. The guard recognized a generic path but not the Python executable actually exposed inside CSC's container. It stopped before changing the budget or submitting a job. The revised preparation pinned the observed executable path and its hash. The model equations and saved checkpoint were unchanged. Once that identity issue was resolved, the project could perform the numerical migration check on an allocated GPU.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-117","summary_en":"The container exposed Python at a different path from the one the check expected. I corrected that identity check without changing the model.","summary_zh":"容器中的 Python 路径与检查程序预期不同。我修正身份检查，没有改变模型。"},{"title_zh":"相同的真实输入，在Linux上能否给出相同转向","title_en":"Would the same recorded inputs produce the same steering?","zh":"先不让车重新开，也不更新权重。我把四段C15已保存的输入，从各段开头的零循环状态依次送入Linux模型。这是在检查迁移有没有改变计算含义。两个读出检查点共237个观测全部通过既定误差范围，最大转向差约为一千万分之一。作业只用了10秒。这证明这批输入的Linux计算与原结果吻合。它还没有回答完整相机、车辆和学习程序一起运行时能有多快，所以下一步测完整工作进程。","en":"I first avoided new driving and weight updates. Four saved C15 input sequences were replayed on Linux, each beginning with a zero recurrent state. This tested whether the migration preserved the calculation. Across the two readout checkpoints, all 237 observations passed the specified tolerance. The largest absolute steering difference was about one ten-millionth. The allocation lasted ten seconds. The bounded numerical port therefore worked for these recordings. I still needed to measure the complete camera, vehicle and learner loop, so the next experiment tested complete workers.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-118","summary_en":"The same saved inputs produced matching steering after migration to Linux. I could next test the full simulator-and-learner loop.","summary_zh":"迁到 Linux 后，同一批保存输入得到了匹配的转向。接下来才测试完整的模拟器和学习器循环。"},{"title_zh":"第一个完整工作进程在身份检查处失败","title_en":"The first complete worker failed at process verification","zh":"数值一致后，我准备比较一个、两个和四个完整工作进程。这里每个进程都有自己的车和独立学习器。第一组还没收集训练数据，就因为没有权限读取渲染进程的可执行文件而退出；清理也遇到了同样的问题。归档里另有一个渲染日志的实际大小与清单不符。因此这次既没有吞吐结果，也没有完整清理通过的证据。下一版把这项可执行文件信息改为可选，同时保留其他进程身份检查，并统一归档与哈希读取的字节快照。","en":"After numerical agreement, I planned to compare one, two and four complete workers. Each worker had its own car and independent learner. The first cell failed before collecting training data because it could not read the renderer's executable path. Cleanup encountered the same permission problem. A renderer log also differed from its specified archive size. This attempt produced neither a throughput result nor verified complete cleanup. The next version made that executable metadata optional, retained the other process identity checks, and used the same byte snapshot for archive contents and hashes.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-119","summary_en":"The first parallel test stopped because it could not inspect the renderer process. I repaired process verification and archive consistency before retrying.","summary_zh":"第一次并行测试因无法检查渲染进程而停止。我先修复进程核对和归档一致性，再重新测试。"},{"title_zh":"第二次启动跨过图形阶段，又被路径身份误判挡住","title_en":"The second startup passed graphics, then failed another identity check","zh":"第二次保留了前次失败，并只修进程检查和导出。图形与Unity这次实际启动了，归档也完整一致。但容器内的客户端把主机启动包装程序和容器解释器当成同一个文件来核验，于是连接车辆前又停下。仍然没有训练样本。全部12个受管进程已退出，但没有车辆静止收尾结果。下一版把主机包装程序和容器解释器分别核验，再进行同样的吞吐测量。","en":"The second attempt preserved the first failure and applied the process and export repairs. Graphics and Unity now started, and the archive passed its checks. However, the client compared a host launcher wrapper with the interpreter file visible inside the container. It rejected that identity before connecting to the car, so there were still no training samples. All twelve tracked processes exited. A stationary vehicle shutdown was not established because the vehicle connection had never completed. The next version separated host and container identity checks before repeating the planned throughput measurement.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-120","summary_en":"Graphics started, but another check confused the host launcher with Python inside the container. No training began; I separated those identities.","summary_zh":"图形程序启动了，另一项检查却把主机启动脚本与容器内 Python 混为一谈。训练尚未开始，我随后分开核对。"},{"title_zh":"四个独立工作进程带来约四倍有效吞吐","title_en":"Four independent workers delivered about four times the throughput","zh":"第三版终于完成一个、两个和四个工作进程的比较。每个都从C15同一检查点和优化器状态开始，只训练外部读出，核心保持冻结。三组分别每秒优化约2.07、4.22和8.36个新样本。四个工作进程约为一个的4.04倍，但其GPU平均利用率只有3.49%。记录显示很多时间在等相机与接口。这说明并行能隐藏部分等待，下一步值得扩大规模；它还不是驾驶质量评估，也没有找到最优并发数。","en":"The third version completed the one-, two- and four-worker comparison. Every worker resumed the same C15 checkpoint and optimizer state, trained its own external readout, and kept the neural core fixed. Useful optimization throughput was approximately 2.07, 4.22 and 8.36 new driving transitions per second. Four workers delivered about 4.04 times the single-worker rate, while average sampled GPU utilization remained only 3.49 percent. Much of the recorded host time was inside camera and interface waiting. Parallelism was helping to overlap that waiting. The next question was capacity, rather than driving quality or an established optimum.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-121","summary_en":"Independent copies increased throughput almost in proportion to their number. The next test explored how many copies the allocation could support.","summary_zh":"独立副本增加时，吞吐量几乎同比增加。下一次测试转向检查这份资源能支持多少副本。"},{"title_zh":"曾提出分级扩展，但没有执行这条方案","title_en":"A gradual scaling proposal was not executed","zh":"看到四个工作进程近线性提升后，最初提出过先测八个，再有条件测十六个，并保留四个作当期对照。文件中的速度是根据已有结果推算的计划值。实际没有找到这套八个、十六个比较的作业。随后我选择直接测试六十四个完整工作进程。因此这里保留这个未执行的选择，说明决策怎么转向，不能把推算速度画成实验结果。","en":"After the near-linear improvement with four workers, the initial proposal was to test eight, then conditionally sixteen, with a fresh four-worker reference. Its projected rates were planning estimates derived from the earlier measurements. No job implementing that eight- and sixteen-worker comparison was found. I then chose a direct test of sixty-four complete workers. This unexecuted option remains in the timeline because it explains the change in direction. Its estimated rates must not appear as measured results.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-122","summary_en":"The gradual scaling proposal remained a plan. I chose a larger direct test instead, so its estimated speeds stayed separate from measured results.","summary_zh":"逐步扩容方案停留在计划阶段。我选择直接进行更大规模测试，原方案的预测速度不作为实测结果。"},{"title_zh":"六十四个完整模型没有全部成功","title_en":"Sixty-four complete workers did not all succeed","zh":"这次直接把六十四个独立模型放到一块L40上，由三十二个CPU支持。六十四个尝试中三十二个完成，三十五个曾更新读出，峰值同时达到学习就绪的有四十九个。失败包括十一个模型加载时显存不足、一个旧启动消息，以及二十个暂停后读相机队列超时。总共优化了11,520个新样本。调度器显示完成，实验本身却是部分完成。下一步把并发降到三十二，并修正已排队相机消息的读取规则。","en":"This test placed sixty-four independent models on one L40, supported by thirty-two CPUs. Thirty-two workers completed, thirty-five updated their readouts at some point, and peak learning-ready concurrency reached forty-nine. Failures included eleven model-loading GPU memory errors, one stale startup handshake, and twenty paused-camera drain timeouts. The recorded total was 11,520 newly optimized samples. The scheduler reported completion, but the campaign was only partial. The next attempt reduced concurrency to thirty-two and corrected how already queued camera messages were drained. Both changes must remain visible when comparing throughput.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-123","summary_en":"The large parallel test only partly completed, with memory and camera failures. I reduced concurrency and repaired queue handling for the next test.","summary_zh":"大规模并行测试只完成一部分，出现显存和相机故障。下一次降低并发，并修正队列处理。"},{"title_zh":"暂停后仍在队列里的相机帧需要读完","title_en":"Queued camera frames still needed to be read after pausing","zh":"六十四个进程的失败中，有二十个发生在暂停后的相机队列读取。接口把40毫秒的软空闲窗口当成了必须立即返回的硬截止，即使队列里还排着完整帧。纯模拟消息测试复现了这个问题。修正后仍保留动作、全局和读取的硬界限，也继续拒绝不完整帧。下一次三十二进程试验实际使用了新规则。不过它同时减少了并发数，所以这两种改变的效果没有被单独分开。","en":"Twenty failures in the sixty-four-worker test occurred while draining camera messages after pausing. The interface treated a forty-millisecond soft idle window as a hard return deadline, even when complete frames were already queued. Pure message tests reproduced that mechanism. The repair retained the action, global and drain hard limits and continued rejecting incomplete frames. The following thirty-two-worker test exercised the new rule. Because worker count also changed, that result did not separately measure the effect of the transport repair and the lower concurrency.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-124","summary_en":"Queued complete images were being rejected by an idle timer. I changed the receiver to finish reading those frames while keeping the hard deadlines.","summary_zh":"已经排队的完整图像被空闲计时规则拒绝。我让接收程序先读完这些帧，同时保留硬时限。"},{"title_zh":"三十二个工作进程全部跑完","title_en":"All thirty-two workers completed","zh":"修正读取后，三十二个独立工作进程全部完成，每个优化384个新样本、执行24次更新。合计有效优化12,288个样本，每秒约60.98个，超过先前六十四个尝试的测得速度。这次没有无效动作或运行时恢复，所有车辆和进程收尾通过。它确认了这套三十二环境负载能稳定工作。车辆仍多次触发普通偏离终止，因此这一步解决的是采集容量，下一步才把环境共享给少数策略，比较核心学习。","en":"With the revised drain, all thirty-two independent workers completed. Each optimized 384 new driving transitions in twenty-four updates. The combined total was 12,288 samples, at about 60.98 useful samples per second, above the earlier partial sixty-four-worker result. There were no invalid intervals or runtime recoveries, and vehicle and process cleanup passed. This established stable operation under this thirty-two-worker load. Ordinary deviation endings were still frequent, so the result addressed collection capacity. The next stage let several environments feed each shared policy and tested internal neural learning.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-125","summary_en":"Every worker completed under the smaller configuration. I then moved from independent learners toward several cars sharing a policy.","summary_zh":"较小配置中的所有副本都完成了。下一步从各自学习改为多辆车共享策略。"},{"title_zh":"部署检查先误判了两个存储区的需求","title_en":"The deployment check confused two storage requirements","zh":"转入共享策略前，准备程序又因为存储检查停止。它要求应用目录和scratch各有25 GiB，但应用文件系统总共只有15 GiB，实际应用副本远小于这个要求。修正版把应用目录要求改为2 GiB，scratch仍保留25 GiB。第一次在创建部署、修改台账和提交作业之前退出，因此没有额外训练作业。准备通过后，才一次性提交四策略比较。","en":"Before shared-policy learning, deployment preparation stopped at a storage check. It demanded 25 GiB in both application storage and scratch, although the application filesystem was only 15 GiB in total and the bounded application copy needed much less. The revision required 2 GiB for the application area while retaining 25 GiB for scratch. The first attempt stopped before deployment creation, budget changes or submission. It therefore created no extra training job. The four-policy comparison was submitted once after the revised preparation passed.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-126","summary_en":"A disk check demanded more application storage than the filesystem could hold. I separated the application and scratch requirements before submission.","summary_zh":"磁盘检查对程序区的要求超过了文件系统总容量。我在提交前分开设定程序区与临时区的需求。"},{"title_zh":"多辆车共享一个策略，比较核心冻结与核心学习","title_en":"Several cars shared each policy to compare fixed-weight and trainable cores","zh":"此前三十二个工作进程各学各的。这次把它们分为四组，每组八辆车共同收集经验、更新同一套权重，这就是共享策略。两个随机种子各有一个冻结核心和一个训练核心连接增益的条件，四个外部读出都学习。四组实际优化18,432、15,360、19,456和12,288个新样本，末期驾驶平均时长都比初始约7.9秒更长。但在共同的8,192样本检查点，每对只有四个完整匹配案例，结果略偏向冻结核心。于是当时保留全部版本，先看回放：开得更久究竟是学会纠偏，还是只减少了单向转向偏置。","en":"Previously, the thirty-two workers learned independently. Now they were divided into four groups. Eight cars in each group collected experience for one shared set of weights. Two seeds each paired a fixed-weight neural core with a core whose existing connection gains were trainable. All four external readouts learned. The groups optimized 18,432, 15,360, 19,456 and 12,288 new driving transitions. Their final mean driving durations exceeded the initial level of about 7.9 seconds. However, the common 8,192-sample comparison had only four complete matched starts per seed pair, and both pairs slightly favored fixed-weight cores. The final groups also had unequal training amounts. The decision was to preserve all checkpoints and examine recorded behavior before adding more training. Longer driving might reflect better correction, or simply less constant steering bias. The recordings and displaced-start tests would help distinguish those possibilities.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-127"},{"title_zh":"四个策略的样本总数不是一个策略的学习量","title_en":"The combined sample count was not one policy’s experience","zh":"这四个策略在同一个计算作业内运行。整个作业用了7,486秒，共接受78,943条记录、优化65,536个不同样本，执行4,034次更新。这个65,536是四组相加，恰好等于每组原本的上限；没有任何一组达到自己的上限。十七个不可用动作间隔被排除并恢复，三个中间评估接口失败也保留。作业正常完成，驾驶效果仍要按每个策略、每个检查点和完整案例分别判断。","en":"All four policies ran inside one allocation lasting 7,486 seconds. Together they accepted 78,943 records, optimized 65,536 distinct samples and performed 4,034 updates. That total of 65,536 happened to equal the target ceiling for each policy; no individual policy reached its own target. Seventeen unusable training intervals were excluded and recovered, and three intermediate evaluation interface failures were retained. The job completed normally. Driving quality still had to be assessed separately for each policy, checkpoint and complete evaluation set.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-128","summary_en":"One allocation trained several policies, so their combined sample total was not the experience of any one policy. Each policy needed its own comparison.","summary_zh":"一份资源里训练了多个策略，合计样本量不属于任何单个策略。结果必须按各自的模型和检查点比较。"},{"title_zh":"更长生存还没有变成可靠纠偏","title_en":"Longer survival had not become reliable correction","zh":"我从回放看到固定权重策略偏左、可训练策略偏右，明显修正仍少。我回查发现，训练开始时车辆几乎都在中心，初始化的转向脉冲只造成很小航向差；近中心的偏离代价也很弱。参数确实在更新，探索仍在进行，但最容易得到的改善可能只是减小常量转向偏置。当时因此把大量延长固定权重评估放到次要位置，优先设计真正左右偏移和朝外航向的恢复学习。","en":"In the replays, I saw the fixed-weight policies drifting left and the trainable policies drifting right, with little clear correction. The audit found that training starts were almost centered. Initialization steering pulses produced only small heading differences, and the near-center deviation cost was weak. Parameters and exploration were still changing. Reducing a constant steering bias was therefore a plausible early improvement, while reliable correction remained absent. The decision was to make extended fixed-weight evaluation secondary and prioritize recorded displaced starts with outward headings for recovery learning.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-129","summary_en":"The longer drives still showed little active correction. I shifted attention from nearly centred starts to measured offsets and outward headings.","summary_zh":"驾驶虽然延长，主动纠偏仍很少。我把重点从接近中心的起点转到实测偏移和朝外朝向。"},{"title_zh":"把车放到左右偏移处，观察它能否主动回来","title_en":"Start off target and watch whether the car actively returns","zh":"C18不再靠小转向脉冲代表恢复任务，而是把停止的车辆放到左右偏移位置，部分起点再朝外偏五度。连续二十帧确认位置与静止后才计分。一个神经策略继续C17的权重和完整优化器状态；另一个普通相机循环模型从头开始。两者各优化32,768个新样本。恢复要求偏移不超过0.05、航向误差不超过三度，并连续保持两秒。最终两者四个开发起点都没有通过。神经模型在8,192样本时曾短暂通过一个案例，后来没有稳定保留。于是下一步检查奖励、表示饱和与短暂恢复过程，而不是直接宣布成功或再延长同一训练。","en":"C18 replaced small steering pulses with measured displaced starts. The stopped car was placed on either side of the target, with some starts also pointing five degrees outward. Twenty consecutive frames had to confirm the pose and stationary condition before scoring. The neural policy resumed C17 weights and saved optimizer state. A compact recurrent camera model started fresh as a diagnostic. Each optimized 32,768 new driving transitions. Recovery required an absolute offset no greater than 0.05 and heading error no greater than three degrees, held for two seconds. Neither final policy passed any of the four development starts. The neural model briefly passed one case at 8,192 samples, but later checkpoints did not retain that result consistently. The next step was to inspect reward, representation saturation and the recorded recovery traces. Equal new driving transitions made the budgets comparable, while their different architectures and training ancestry remained explicit.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-130"},{"title_zh":"两组都完成样本目标，恢复结果仍然阴性","title_en":"Both sample targets completed, while final recovery remained absent","zh":"C18的计算作业跨夜完成，共分配8,370秒。两组各完成32,768个新优化样本和2,048次更新。神经组接受34,624条记录，普通相机组接受33,528条；九个接口无效间隔被排除并恢复，不能算进训练样本。车辆和进程收尾都通过。这是一次完成目标的学习作业，而最终恢复为零是另一项结果。之后的分析全部读取保存文件，不再开车或重新加载模型推理。","en":"The C18 allocation completed overnight after 8,370 allocated seconds. Each arm reached 32,768 newly optimized samples and 2,048 updates. The neural arm accepted 34,624 records and the camera arm accepted 33,528. Nine invalid interface intervals were excluded and recovered rather than added to training. Vehicle and process cleanup passed. This was a completed learning job, while the absence of final recovery was a separate behavioral result. Subsequent analysis read saved files only; it did not drive again or load the model for new inference.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-131","summary_en":"Both training targets completed, but neither final policy recovered reliably. I next inspected the saved representations and rewards.","summary_zh":"两个训练目标都完成了，但最终策略都未可靠恢复。我接着检查保存的内部表征和奖励。"},{"title_zh":"普通相机模型的内部表示几乎卡在极值","title_en":"The camera diagnostic’s internal representation saturated","zh":"普通相机组最后没有恢复，选中的甚至是未训练版本。为判断这个对照是否健康，我读取它已保存的循环特征。末期六十四个维度的绝对均值都超过0.99，几乎卡在正负一，而相机输入仍在变化。神经组的1,314维读出则保持变化。这给出了一个具体表示问题，也使普通相机组不适合作为健康学习基线。下一轮主比较因此改为两个同祖先神经策略，只改变偏离惩罚。","en":"The camera arm did not recover, and its selection procedure retained the untrained checkpoint. To assess that diagnostic, the project inspected its saved recurrent features. Late in training, all sixty-four dimensions had absolute means above 0.99, almost fixed at their positive or negative limits, despite changing camera inputs. The neural arm's 1,314-dimensional readout remained variable. This identified a concrete representation problem and weakened the camera arm as a healthy learning reference. The next main comparison therefore used two neural policies with the same ancestry and changed only the deviation penalty.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-132","summary_en":"The small camera model's hidden values stayed near their limits even as images changed. I used matched neural models for the next reward comparison.","summary_zh":"小型相机模型的隐藏值在图像变化时仍贴近上下限。下一次奖励比较改用起点一致的神经模型。"},{"title_zh":"先确认奖励方向与视觉响应，再选择改动","title_en":"Check reward direction and visual response before changing training","zh":"两个模型都没形成稳定恢复，原因不能只凭最终画面判断。我先把C18的68,152条接受记录和120次评估回报重新核对。奖励没有倒置，但偏离代价相对前进奖励较弱。随后在同一次C19作业内固定权重，分别输入原相机序列和重复第一帧的序列。下行神经元读出与转向随序列改变，说明视觉路径有响应。这个检查不让模拟器开车，也不更新参数。下一步就在同一个神经祖先上比较原惩罚和十倍惩罚。","en":"The final recordings alone could not explain why neither model achieved stable recovery. The project first rechecked all 68,152 accepted C18 records and 120 evaluation returns. Reward was not reversed, although deviation cost was weak relative to progress. Within the C19 allocation, weights were then fixed-weight and saved camera sequences were compared with sequences that repeated only their first frame. Neural readouts and steering changed with the visual sequence. The visual path was responsive in this probe. It involved no simulator driving or parameter updates. The next comparison therefore kept neural ancestry fixed and tested the original penalty against a tenfold penalty.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-133","summary_en":"Saved records showed weak deviation costs and a working visual response. I kept the neural starting point fixed and tested a stronger penalty.","summary_zh":"已有记录显示偏离代价偏弱，视觉路径也确实有反应。我固定神经模型起点，测试更强的惩罚。"},{"title_zh":"十倍偏离惩罚没有带来稳定的双侧恢复","title_en":"A tenfold deviation penalty did not produce stable bilateral recovery","zh":"C19的两个神经策略都从C18最终检查点和完整优化器状态开始。一个保留偏离系数0.05，另一个改成0.5；相机输入、动力学、学习设置和三十秒任务都保留。这样做是因为此前偏离代价较弱，但还需要原方案作对照。共同的16,384样本检查点上，原奖励四例中两例恢复，强惩罚只有一例。原奖励两次保持3.4秒和8.6秒后仍漂出。最终原奖励零例、强惩罚一例，且最终训练量不同。当时判断是出现了短暂、偏一侧的恢复，十倍惩罚没有稳定优势。接着回查任务覆盖，发现三十秒上限让所有评估都到不了第一弯。","en":"Both C19 neural policies resumed the same final C18 checkpoint and complete optimizer state. One retained a deviation coefficient of 0.05; the other used 0.5. Camera input, dynamics, learning settings and the thirty-second task were retained. The earlier weak penalty motivated the change, while the original recipe provided a comparison. At the common 16,384-sample milestone, the original reward produced recovery in two of four starts, compared with one of four under the stronger penalty. The original cases held the band for 3.4 and 8.6 seconds, then drifted out. Final results were zero and one recovery, with unequal final training amounts. The contemporary conclusion was limited, asymmetric and temporary recovery, without a stable advantage from the stronger penalty. A subsequent coverage review changed the next priority: the thirty-second cap prevented training and evaluation from reaching the first bend.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-134"},{"title_zh":"到时限时，两组保留了不同数量的新样本","title_en":"The two policies reached the time limit with different sample totals","zh":"C19的实际作业用了12,051秒，正常结束于学习时限，没有达到每组65,536样本的上限。原奖励优化31,424个新样本，强惩罚优化30,656个。十一个不可用动作间隔都单独保存并恢复。原奖励的最后一次参数更新已完成，但时限打断了它之后的额外诊断，所以有1,926次更新、1,925条完整更新后审计。这个缺口要原样保留。比较效果时优先看共同的中间检查点，不能把不同最终训练量当成严格等量对照。","en":"The C19 job ran for 12,051 seconds and ended normally at its learning deadline. Neither policy reached the ceiling of 65,536 new driving transitions. The original reward optimized 31,424 samples, while the stronger penalty optimized 30,656. Eleven unusable action intervals were preserved and recovered. The original arm completed its last parameter update, but the deadline interrupted the additional post-update diagnostic: 1,926 updates were completed and 1,925 full diagnostic records exist. That gap remains explicit. Behavioral comparison should prioritize common intermediate checkpoints rather than treating unequal final budgets as a clean matched experiment.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-135","summary_en":"The deadline gave the two conditions unequal training totals. I compared their shared intermediate checkpoints before interpreting final scores.","summary_zh":"截止时间使两个条件完成了不同训练量。我先比较共同中间检查点，再解释最终分数。"},{"title_zh":"三十秒上限把第一弯挡在所有评估之外","title_en":"The thirty-second cap excluded the first bend","zh":"回放中一直看不到弯道，因此我重新检查任务时间线。454个训练回合中326个因为时间上限结束。39个完成的策略评估全部到时截断，另一个是接口失败。评估最远路程仍在第一弯之前。因此最终“零恢复”是没有满足中心和航向保持条件，不是四次撞车，也不表示已掌握的驾驶技能被忘掉。这个回看改变了下一步：同时延长时间、动作和循环历史上限，并从道路不同段落开始，让训练真实访问弯道。","en":"Because no bends appeared in the replays, I rechecked how long each episode lasted. Of 454 completed training episodes, 326 ended at the time limit. All thirty-nine completed policy evaluations were also time-truncated; one further case failed at the interface. Even the furthest evaluated position remained before the first bend. Final zero recovery therefore meant failure of the centering-and-heading hold criterion, rather than four crashes or loss of an established driving skill. This retrospective review changed the next priority: extend the time, action and recurrent-history limits together and add measured starts along the road so learning actually encounters bends.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-136","summary_en":"The episodes ended before the first bend. I extended the task and added starts along the route so the learner could encounter turns.","summary_zh":"回合在到达第一处弯道前就结束了。我延长任务，并增加沿途起点，让学习器真正接触弯道。"},{"title_zh":"让一个策略从四段道路学习更长的驾驶","title_en":"Let one policy learn longer drives from four road sections","zh":"C20继续原奖励16,384样本的神经检查点，连同优化器的历史状态一起恢复。既然短任务没有提供弯道经验，这次把回合延长到180秒或900个动作，并在道路四段各设置左右两个起点。三十二辆车共同更新一个策略，减少两个学习器争用计算的情况。网络为每辆车保留自己的历史；权重改变后，要用保存的输入重新算出与当前参数一致的状态。真正向过去传递学习误差的窗口仍是十六个决策，这叫截断反向传播，或TBPTT。奖励和学习率先保持。我要观察不同方向弯道、起点与中间检查点，避免把一个晚路段的成功当成从起点完成全程。","en":"C20 resumed the original-reward neural checkpoint at 16,384 new driving transitions, including its optimizer history. Since the short task had supplied no bend experience, episodes were extended to 180 seconds or 900 actions. Four route locations each received left and right offset starts. Thirty-two cars now supplied one shared policy, reducing competition between separate learners. Each car retained its own recurrent history. After weights changed, saved inputs were replayed to reconstruct a state consistent with the current parameters. Learning errors were propagated through only sixteen decisions at a time; this is truncated backpropagation through time, or TBPTT. Reward and learning rates were initially retained. Evaluation would follow both bend directions, all start locations and intermediate checkpoints. A completion from a late start would describe only the remaining open route, while reliable driving from the beginning remained a separate goal.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-137"},{"title_zh":"长路线基线开完，第一次训练重置却没有通过","title_en":"The longer baseline finished, but the first training reset failed","zh":"C20第一次作业完成八个策略基线和八个零转向对照，确实把旧策略带到了弯道。但准备三十二个训练环境时，不计分的制动预热超过旧时长界限，整个作业在136秒后失败。没有接受任何新训练样本，也没到原定梯度一致性检查。旧策略在八个起点中六个比零转向进展更远，这属于继承策略的表现。下一步先修重置的静止边界和失败后的收尾时序，再独立继续训练。","en":"The first C20 job completed eight policy baselines and eight zero-steering controls, exposing the inherited policy to bends. It then failed while initializing thirty-two training environments because an unscored braking warmup exceeded the old duration bound. The allocation ended after 136 seconds. No new training samples were accepted, and the planned gradient parity check was not reached. The inherited policy progressed further than zero steering in six of eight starts, but that was baseline behavior. The next step repaired stationary reset acceptance and failed-child cleanup timing before a separate continuation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-138","summary_en":"The longer baseline evaluations completed, but training initialization failed during braking warmup. I repaired that reset check before continuing.","summary_zh":"更长的基线评估完成了，但训练初始化在刹车预热时失败。我修复重置检查后再继续。"},{"title_zh":"静止预热完整可信时，给它单独的重置验收","title_en":"Give stationary warmup its own reset acceptance rule","zh":"失败发生在车停止时的预热，而不是计分驾驶动作。我逐项核查完整相机帧、时间、暂停状态、执行命令回显和静止位置，只在这类不计分制动预热中采用有界的新验收。真实驾驶动作的时间规则保持原样。下一次运行里2,246段预热通过，其中76段会被旧时长规则拒绝。另一个修改让失败子程序先完成自己的收尾，再必要时终止进程。正常结束没有触发这个失败收尾分支，随后进入更长学习。","en":"The failure occurred during stationary warmup rather than a scored driving action. The repair checked complete camera representation, clocks, pause state, command echoes and stationary pose, then applied a bounded acceptance rule only to those unscored braking warmups. The scored driving interface requirements was retained. In the next run, 2,246 warmups were accepted, including seventy-six that the old duration rule would have rejected. A separate cleanup change gave failed children time to finish their own shutdown before process termination. Normal completion did not exercise that failure branch. The project then continued substantive learning.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-139","summary_en":"Stationary warmup needed its own bounded rule rather than the rule for scored driving. The following run used that distinction.","summary_zh":"静止预热需要自己的有界检查，不能直接套用计分驾驶规则。后一次运行采用了这个区分。"},{"title_zh":"局部转弯明显改善，最终版本却不处处更好","title_en":"Local turning improved, but the final checkpoint was not better everywhere","zh":"修正版C20实际优化100,352个新样本。初始、65,536样本和最终版本在同八个起点评估。平均前进由7.116个单位增到约10.5至10.7；中间版本在四个起点累计通过五段定义弯道，覆盖两种转向方向。最终版本在晚路段更强，却在另一些负向弯段变弱。所有48次策略评估仍触发了距目标路线0.5的旧截止，没有评估完成剩余路线。训练中三个终点事件都从晚路段开始。因此当时保存中间与最终版本，接着调查样本分配偏向以及旧截止是否过早。","en":"The revised C20 run optimized 100,352 new driving transitions. Initial, 65,536-sample and final policies were evaluated from the same eight starts. Mean forward progress increased from 7.116 units to approximately 10.5–10.7. The intermediate policy accumulated five defined bend passes across four starts, covering both turning directions. The final policy became stronger on later sections but weaker on some negative-direction bend starts. All forty-eight policy evaluations still crossed the old 0.5 distance-to-target-route cutoff; none completed its remaining route in evaluation. Three endpoint events during exploratory training all began from the late route section. The conclusion was real but limited local improvement, with a tradeoff between situations. Both intermediate and final checkpoints were preserved. The next work examined exposure imbalance and whether that old stopping rule was cutting drives short.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-140","summary_en":"Training improved some bends but weakened others. I kept the intermediate and final models and investigated data imbalance and early stopping.","summary_zh":"训练改善部分弯道，却使另一些变差。我保留中间与最终模型，检查数据分配和过早停止问题。"},{"title_zh":"旧“越界”测的是目标路径距离，不是物理路边","title_en":"The old cutoff measured target-path distance, not the physical road edge","zh":"回放中车好像还在路上就停了，促使我回查停止条件。程序测量的是车辆参考点到计分路径的距离，超过0.5就终止；它没有测道路网格边界或整辆车的轮廓。因此旧的“离开道路”表述比原证据更宽。这个审查只改解释，没有改历史数据或已提交的C21。下一步单独注册道路参照，用固定权重实际继续开过旧阈值，看能否继续行驶或返回。","en":"In the replays, the car appeared to stop while still on the road. Source inspection showed that termination used the distance from the vehicle reference point to the scoring path. Exceeding 0.5 ended the episode; the rule did not measure a road mesh edge or the whole car footprint. Earlier descriptions of leaving the road were therefore broader than the evidence. This review changed interpretation, not historical data or the already submitted C21 run. The next test independently registered a road reference and continued fixed-weight driving beyond the old threshold.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-141","summary_en":"The stopping rule measured distance to a scoring path, not the visible road edge. I tested whether driving could continue beyond that old limit.","summary_zh":"停止规则测的是到计分路径的距离，不是画面中的路边。我随后测试超过旧阈值后能否继续行驶。"},{"title_zh":"固定起点配额，保留中间版本的转弯能力","title_en":"Fix start quotas to preserve the intermediate policy’s turning ability","zh":"C20后期较长寿的起点贡献了更多训练动作，最晚路段的份额升高，而较弱弯段没有跟着增加。C21因此继续65,536样本的中间检查点，把三十二个通道固定分给八个起点，让完整批次每个起点占八分之一。同时让已准备好的车辆继续采集，另一辆重置时不必全体等待；更新前仍要等重置全部结束。奖励和学习率保持。实际最好的98,304新增样本版本在八个起点中四个完成剩余路线，都来自后路段；早起点仍卡在首个长右弯。更晚版本又退为三例。于是保存最佳中间版本，并继续追查一致性守卫失败。","en":"Late in C20, longer-surviving starts contributed more training actions. The latest route section gained exposure while the weaker bend did not. C21 therefore resumed the intermediate 65,536-sample checkpoint and permanently assigned the thirty-two simulators to eight starts. Each complete batch gave every origin one eighth of its samples. Ready cars could also keep collecting while another car reset, although every reset still had to finish before updating weights. Reward and learning rates were retained. The best evaluated version, at 98,304 additional samples, completed the remaining route from four of eight starts, all on later sections. Early starts still failed in the first long right bend. The later evaluated checkpoint fell back to three completions. This was useful later-route learning with localized regression. The selected intermediate candidate was preserved, while the eventual replay consistency failure required separate diagnosis.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-142"},{"title_zh":"准备脚本用了旧Python没有的哈希接口","title_en":"Preparation used a hashing API absent from the system Python","zh":"C21第一次准备停在Python兼容问题：系统Python 3.9没有脚本调用的快速文件哈希接口。它尚未创建部署目录，也没有提交计算作业。修正版用分块读取计算同样的文件哈希，同时保留原检查规则。之后源文件、父检查点和运行环境都完成核验，才提交真正的C21。这个失败属于部署工具，不是模型计算或驾驶退步。","en":"The first C21 staging attempt stopped at a Python compatibility issue. The system's Python 3.9 lacked the file hashing API used by the preparation script. No deployment directory or compute job had been created. The revision calculated the same hashes with chunked file reads and retained the verification rules. Source files, the parent checkpoint and runtime then passed preparation before the recorded C21 submission. This was a deployment-tool failure, separate from model arithmetic or driving regression.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-143","summary_en":"Preparation failed because the system Python lacked the chosen hashing function. I changed the helper while keeping the same file checks.","summary_zh":"系统 Python 缺少所用哈希函数，准备过程因此停止。我修改辅助程序，保留相同文件核对要求。"},{"title_zh":"一次很小的重算差异让学习在118784样本停止","title_en":"A small replay discrepancy stopped learning at 118,784 samples","zh":"C21在完成118,784个新优化样本后失败。程序准备更新下一批权重时，先用收集该批数据时的相同策略重算动作概率。最大差异为约0.000010967，略高于0.00001的既定范围，因此该批没有执行任何更新，2,048条记录被舍弃。已有更新和检查点全部保留。差异有限，但原记录没有保存具体出错行与状态，原因不能定为单纯舍入。下一步应补完整量化诊断，保持守卫，而不是直接放宽阈值。","en":"C21 failed after completing 118,784 newly optimized samples. Before updating the next batch, the program replayed action probabilities under the same collecting policy. The maximum discrepancy was approximately 0.000010967, slightly above the existing 0.00001 bound. That batch performed no updates and discarded 2,048 rows; earlier updates and checkpoints were preserved. The discrepancy was small, but the offending row and state trace were not retained, so its cause could not be assigned solely to rounding. The next step was better quantitative diagnostics while retaining the guard.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-144","summary_en":"Learning stopped when replayed action probabilities differed slightly beyond the limit. The missing failing-row trace made better diagnostics necessary.","summary_zh":"重算动作概率时，差异略超阈值，学习因此停止。失败行的详细轨迹没有保存，下一步需要补充诊断。"},{"title_zh":"先在静止状态下建立道路参照","title_en":"Establish the road reference while stationary","zh":"为检验旧0.5截止是否过早，C22先做单独的道路注册作业。它把上游道路样式、实际路线节点、车辆位置和五组静止相机画面互相核对，建立保守的道路参照。作业61秒完成，八组车辆静止和图形进程收尾都通过。这一步没有训练，也没有量到整辆车或车轮的连续边界。它给下一步十二次固定权重继续驾驶提供同一把观察尺。","en":"C22 began with a separate registration job before testing the old cutoff. Source road styles, recorded route nodes, vehicle poses and five stationary camera records were checked together to establish a conservative road reference. The job completed in sixty-one seconds, with all eight stationary and graphics cleanups passing. It performed no training and did not measure continuous whole-car or wheel containment. It supplied a consistent observer for the following twelve fixed-weight continuation drives.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-145","summary_en":"I registered a consistent road reference while the car was stationary, then used it to observe driving beyond the old cutoff.","summary_zh":"我在车辆静止时建立一致的道路参照，再用它观察超过旧截止条件后的驾驶。"},{"title_zh":"准备过程中的失败也逐项保留","title_en":"Keep the preparation failures in the timeline","zh":"C22准备时还遇到几次独立阻碍。上传界面报错，但文件哈希已正确；解包程序把内容数量与包括清单的总数量混淆；quota查询又用了不对应的目录键。它们都在提交前停止。评估准备后来发现scratch不足，也先停止，再对已结束作业的相同模拟器文件做逐字节核验的硬链接整理，释放重复占用。研究数据和检查点保留。完成这些准备后，才分别一次提交注册和评估。","en":"C22 preparation encountered several separate obstacles. The upload interface reported an error although the remote file hash was correct. Extraction confused payload count with total archive entries, and a quota lookup used the wrong project directory key. These stopped before submission. Evaluation preparation later found insufficient scratch space and also stopped. Verified identical simulator files from completed jobs were then consolidated with hard links, retaining research data and checkpoints. Registration and evaluation were each submitted once after those preparation steps passed.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-146","summary_en":"Upload, archive, quota and disk checks delayed preparation before submission. I resolved these separately and preserved the research files.","summary_zh":"上传、归档、配额和磁盘检查先后阻挡了提交。我分别处理这些问题，并保留研究文件。"},{"title_zh":"跨过旧阈值后，有的车能继续，但可靠恢复仍少","title_en":"Beyond the old threshold, some drives continued but recovery stayed limited","zh":"C22把C20的65,536中间版本和100,352最终版本放到六个相同起点，共十二次驾驶，权重始终冻结。四个案例跨过旧0.5距离后又继续了约0.2至2.8秒，没有一个回到旧距离带。最终版本从晚路段负偏移起点出发，过两段弯后到达剩余计分路线终点；其余十一例因参考点持续离开保守路内区域而结束。所有案例都没有技术失败。这确认旧规则确实会截断一些可继续的驾驶，同时也显示仅移除旧停止线没有产生可靠恢复。下一步需要让训练保留有效的偏离与恢复经验，并明确路外进展怎样计分。","en":"C22 evaluated the C20 intermediate checkpoint at 65,536 samples and final checkpoint at 100,352 from six matched starts, for twelve fixed-weight drives. Four cases continued beyond the old 0.5 distance threshold for approximately 0.2–2.8 simulated seconds. None returned inside that old band. The final policy from the late negative-offset start passed two bends and reached the endpoint of its remaining scoring route. The other eleven ended after sustained reference-point departure from the conservative road interior. There were no technical case failures. The result confirmed that the old rule could cut short a drive that still had room to continue. Removing it alone did not create dependable recovery. The next learning design therefore needed to retain valid departure and recovery experience, while explicitly defining how progress outside the road should be rewarded.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-147"},{"title_zh":"主方向从固定Warren路线转向真实生成道路池","title_en":"The main direction shifted from Warren to captured generated roads","zh":"最初回顾C21和C22时，建议先保留Warren，继续解决首个长右弯。随后我更重视一般道路跟随和不同方向经验，又提供了课程训练代码。决定因此改变：继续C21的98,304中间检查点，但主任务转到生成道路。三十二个模拟器分别保存首次实际加载的道路，二十四条训练、四条开发、四条保留评估。每次重置仍用同一条道路，不能说每回合都重新随机生成。课程代码提供了奖励分解和检查输入的方法，课程SAC权重则没有混进神经策略。这一步先记录选择变化，再由实际道路哈希验证运行条件。","en":"The first review after C21 and C22 recommended keeping Warren and targeting its first long right bend. I then prioritised general road following and experience in both directions, using the course training code as a reference. The decision changed: retain the C21 intermediate checkpoint at 98,304 additional samples, but move the main task to generated roads. Thirty-two simulator processes would capture their recorded scene-load roads: twenty-four for training, four for development and four reserved for evaluation. Each simulator reused its captured road after a car reset; roads were not regenerated every episode. Course code informed reward decomposition, reset handling and input inspection. Its SAC weights were not mixed into the neural policy. This stage records a genuine change of direction. Actual geometry hashes, rather than the map name or a presumed seed, would establish the roads used by each run.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-148","summary_en":"I moved the main task to generated roads while keeping the selected earlier checkpoint. Each simulator captured and reused its own road.","summary_zh":"我保留选中的早期检查点，把主任务转到生成道路。每个模拟器保存并反复使用自己的道路。"},{"title_zh":"道路池捕获成功，接收器计数器却没有初始化","title_en":"The road pool was captured, but a receiver counter was missing","zh":"C23第一次运行实际启动了三十二个图形环境，也保存了三十二条不同道路的几何哈希。但注册道路需要先接收相机，新的手动启动过程漏掉了相机接收器使用的计数器，因此每个注册都失败。87秒后作业停止，新训练样本和更新全为零。父检查点仍是C21的中间版本。下一版把计数器初始化放到首次相机接收之前，并修正另一个提前发现的接收容量设置，再单独提交。","en":"The first C23 run started thirty-two graphics environments and captured thirty-two distinct road geometry hashes. Road registration needed camera reception first, but the new manual bootstrap had omitted a counter used by the inherited receiver. Every registration failed. The job stopped after eighty-seven seconds with zero new training samples or updates. The C21 intermediate checkpoint remained the parent. The next version initialized the counter before the first camera advance and restored a separately identified receive-cap setting before another distinct submission.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-149","summary_en":"Roads were captured, but the receiver lacked a counter needed during setup. I initialized it before the next attempt.","summary_zh":"道路已经采集，接收程序却缺少初始化所需的计数器。我在下一次尝试前补上初始化。"},{"title_zh":"车辆朝向符合命令，却被另一段道路的方向拒绝","title_en":"The car matched its target yaw but was judged against another segment","zh":"第二次道路注册全部通过，随后初始训练重置又失败。一个记录里车辆实际航向约3.21373度，几乎正好等于命令目标；验收却用偏移位置投影到的相邻路段切线，算成了负2.119度误差。位置、静止和其他条件都通过，只有这个航向定义冲突。137秒后停止，仍无新学习。下一步保持原一度容差，改为直接比较车辆航向和原命令目标，同时保留两种方向供审计。","en":"The second attempt registered all roads, then failed during initial training reset. In one saved case, recorded yaw was approximately 3.21373 degrees, almost exactly the commanded target. Acceptance instead used the tangent of a neighboring projected segment and reported a heading error of minus 2.119 degrees. Position, stationary status and the other conditions passed; the heading definitions conflicted. The job stopped after 137 seconds without new learning. The next repair retained the one-degree tolerance, compared recorded yaw directly with the commanded target, and recorded both heading references.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-150","summary_en":"The car reached the requested heading, but the check compared it with a different road segment. I corrected the reference rather than loosening tolerance.","summary_zh":"车辆已达到要求朝向，检查却拿另一段道路作参照。我修正参照，没有放宽容差。"},{"title_zh":"先用保存帧复核新验收，再修正存储单位读取","title_en":"Recheck the new pose rule on saved frames, then correct quota units","zh":"航向修复先在原数据上检查：1,846个保存的定位帧重现了十八个原通过、六个仅航向失败的情况；新规则让二十四段观察序列都具有要求的连续二十帧。原先通过的端点没有改变。同时发现quota工具输出的是二进制单位，旧解析器按十进制理解，可能误报空间不足，于是改用精确KiB读数。这些都是源代码和保存数据准备，还不算真实重置通过。完成核验后才进入第三次实际学习作业。","en":"The heading repair was first checked against retained data. Across 1,846 saved placement frames, the audit reproduced eighteen original accepts and six heading-only failures. Under the revised predicate, all twenty-four observed sequences contained the required twenty-frame suffix, with original accepted endpoints unchanged. Preparation also found that the quota tool used binary units while the older parser assumed decimal units, so exact KiB readings were adopted. These were source and saved-data checks, not new physical reset trials. The third learning job followed only after that preparation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-151","summary_en":"The revised pose check passed on saved frames. I also corrected quota units before the next learning attempt.","summary_zh":"修改后的姿态检查在保存帧上通过。我还修正了配额单位，再开始下一次学习尝试。"},{"title_zh":"真实学习开始后，两个模拟器进程发生原生崩溃","title_en":"Two simulator processes crashed after real learning had begun","zh":"第三次终于通过道路和重置验收，优化了7,680个新样本、执行480次更新。接着两个Unity进程发生SIGBUS：一个堆栈在相机读回，另一个在物理同步。作业651秒后失败。下一次学习后驾驶评估原定在12,288样本，因此还没有到达。日志还揭示空StreamingAssets目录在复制中丢失，以及中断重置的所有权处理缺陷。它们值得修，但SIGBUS最初原因仍未确定。下一版保留这次已学权重和完整优化器状态，修明确工程问题后继续。","en":"The third attempt passed road and reset acceptance and optimized 7,680 new driving transitions in 480 updates. Two Unity processes then crashed with SIGBUS: one stack involved camera readback and the other physics synchronization. The job failed after 651 seconds. Its first learned-policy driving evaluation was scheduled for 12,288 samples and had not been reached. Logs also revealed a missing empty StreamingAssets directory and a defect in interrupted reset process control. Those were concrete repair targets, while the initiating cause of SIGBUS remained unresolved. The next version preserved the learned failure checkpoint and saved optimizer state before continuing.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-152","summary_en":"Training began, then two simulator processes crashed. I saved the learned checkpoint and investigated confirmed directory and reset-handling defects.","summary_zh":"训练已开始，随后两个模拟器进程崩溃。我保存已学习的检查点，并调查确认存在的目录和重置处理缺陷。"},{"title_zh":"修已确认的目录和重置所有权缺陷","title_en":"Repair the confirmed directory and reset process control defects","zh":"这次修复没有给SIGBUS补造根因。上游压缩包里本来有空目录，文件式复制把它遗漏了，因此新版明确保留。另一个源代码检查发现，等待重置被打断时，程序可能先解除所有权，却没有确认后台操作真的结束。新版保留所有权直到完成，并保留最初异常，避免后来的身份检查把它盖住。随后R4没有记录原生进程丢失，但这段健康运行本身不能确定旧SIGBUS原因。下一步继续同一学习谱系。","en":"This repair did not assign a new cause to SIGBUS. The upstream archive contained an empty directory that file-only cloning had omitted, so the new assets preserved it. Source review also found that an interrupted reset wait could release process control before confirming that the background operation had finished. The revision retained process control until quiescence and preserved the first exception instead of masking it with a later identity failure. R4 subsequently recorded no native process loss. That healthy interval still did not identify the earlier SIGBUS cause. Learning continued from the preserved checkpoint.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-153","summary_en":"I restored a missing empty directory and made interrupted resets finish before releasing the simulator. The earlier crash cause remained unknown.","summary_zh":"我补回缺失的空目录，并让中断的重置结束后才释放模拟器。此前崩溃的起因仍未查明。"},{"title_zh":"文件正在原子替换，扫描程序误把暂时消失当成失败","title_en":"An atomic file replacement exposed an output-scanning race","zh":"R4从上次7,680样本的失败检查点继续，又优化9,216个新样本。所有道路、初始重置和梯度检查通过，但还没到学习后驾驶评估。812秒时，输出扫描器先看到一个临时JSON文件，再读取属性时该名字已被原子替换，便把正常发布过程当成文件系统失败，停止学习。这次没有新的原生进程丢失。下一版针对已核验的原子写文件路径，做有界的整次清单重扫，保留真实永久缺失仍然报错的规则。","en":"R4 resumed the failure checkpoint after 7,680 samples and optimized another 9,216 new driving transitions. Roads, initial resets and gradient checks passed, but learned-policy evaluation was still not reached. At 812 seconds, the output scanner saw a temporary JSON filename that disappeared through atomic replacement before its attributes were read. It treated that normal publication race as a filesystem failure and stopped learning. No new native process loss was recorded. The next scanner used bounded whole-inventory retries for audited atomic-writer paths while continuing to reject permanent missing-file errors.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-154","summary_en":"Learning stopped because an output scan raced with a normal atomic file replacement. I made the scanner retry that bounded publication window.","summary_zh":"输出扫描恰好遇上正常的原子文件替换，学习因此停止。我让扫描程序在这个有界发布窗口内重试。"},{"title_zh":"扫描修复通过，实际二十四通道特征却不一致","title_en":"The scanner repair passed, but twenty-four-simulator features disagreed","zh":"R5先实际运行三十二个并发写文件子程序，修正后的扫描通过。道路注册和R4父检查点恢复也通过。它收集384条有效输入后，比较逐车与二十四通道一起计算的结果，神经特征超出既定范围，于是全部舍弃，没有更新权重。问题在于失败前尚未把具体维度和差异大小写出，这些量无法补回。237秒后作业停止。下一步改做固定输入数值诊断，先完整记录输出、状态、梯度和重复计算差异。","en":"R5 first exercised thirty-two concurrent metadata writers, and the repaired scanner passed. Road registration and restoration of the R4 parent also passed. After collecting 384 valid rows, it compared individual and twenty-four-simulator calculations. Neural features exceeded the existing tolerance, so those rows were discarded before any weight update. The failing dimension and error magnitude had not been written before the exception, and cannot be reconstructed from its message. The allocation stopped after 237 seconds. The next step was fixed-input diagnosis with complete output, state, gradient and repeatability check records.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-155","summary_en":"The scanner worked, but batched neural features failed their consistency check before any update. I prepared fixed-input numerical tests.","summary_zh":"扫描修好后，批量神经特征在更新前未通过一致性检查。我转而准备固定输入的数值测试。"},{"title_zh":"数值诊断在错误的资源检查处就停止","title_en":"The numerical diagnostic stopped at an incorrect resource guard","zh":"第一次数值诊断连模型都没加载。程序要求实际分配内存必须等于请求的64 GiB，但这个L40分区实际按GPU授予187950 MiB。两秒后检查拒绝，零比较、零更新、零车辆运行。这里失败的是我新增的资源守卫，不是数值候选。修正版把请求量与平台实际授予量分别核验，保留这个失败，再运行下一次独立诊断。","en":"The first numerical diagnostic did not reach model loading. Its resource guard required allocated memory to equal the requested 64 GiB, while this L40 partition granted 187950 MiB per GPU. The guard rejected the job after two seconds. There were no numerical comparisons, updates or vehicle runs. This was a newly added allocation-check error rather than a failure of the numerical candidate. The revised diagnostic validated requested and granted memory separately, preserving this failure before another distinct allocation.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-156","summary_en":"A resource check rejected the diagnostic before model loading because granted memory differed from requested memory. I checked those quantities separately.","summary_zh":"资源检查因实际分配内存不同于请求量，在模型加载前拒绝了诊断。我随后分开检查两者。"},{"title_zh":"资源检查修好后，启动器又漏了CUDA环境","title_en":"After the resource fix, the launcher omitted the CUDA environment","zh":"第二次诊断通过资源检查，却在导入计算包时找不到Torch，六秒后停止。原训练程序的主启动器会提前设置项目包路径、GPU绑定和隔离环境；这个直接诊断启动器没有完整复用它。模型和父检查点仍未加载，所有数值阶段都未执行，不能把默认的“未接受”状态解释成数值失败。下一版先走原来成功的主机启动过程，再进入同一个数值诊断。","en":"The second diagnostic passed allocation checking but could not import Torch, and stopped after six seconds. The successful training master had configured project packages, GPU binding and environment isolation before entering the wrapper. The direct diagnostic launcher omitted that complete setup. No model or parent checkpoint was loaded, and no numerical phase ran. Its default unaccepted status therefore represented an untested candidate. The next version reused the known host bootstrap before invoking the unchanged numerical procedure.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-157","summary_en":"The next diagnostic could not import Torch because the launcher omitted the established CUDA setup. I reused the working launch environment.","summary_zh":"下一次诊断因启动器漏掉已验证的 CUDA 设置而无法导入 Torch。我改用已有可工作的启动环境。"},{"title_zh":"固定批次形状后，前向通过但梯度仍有差异","title_en":"Fixed batch shape passed forward checks but not all gradients","zh":"第三次数值诊断真正加载了相同父权重和完整优化器状态，没有更新或开车。十七个阶段、一百七十六项前向和循环比较通过，原先二十四通道的特征失败没有复现。但一个读出层权重梯度有54个元素超出原容差，候选因此被拒绝。相同标量计算的重复字节也会变化，固定批次形状尚未解决问题。下一步研究确定性的稀疏计算实现，同时保留原失败，不把未复现直接当成修好了。","en":"The third diagnostic actually loaded the same parent and saved optimizer state, without updating weights or driving. Seventeen phases and 176 forward and recurrent comparisons passed. The historical twenty-four-simulator feature failure did not reproduce. However, fifty-four gradient elements in a readout-layer weight exceeded the original tolerance, so the candidate was rejected. Repeated scalar calculations also changed byte hashes. Fixed batch shape alone had not established a repair. The next step investigated deterministic sparse arithmetic while preserving the original failures and the fact that the live feature error remained unreproduced.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-158","summary_en":"Forward calculations passed, but some gradients still differed too much. Fixed batch shape alone had not solved numerical consistency.","summary_zh":"前向计算通过了，但部分梯度差异仍过大。只固定批量形状还未解决数值一致性。"},{"title_zh":"新计算可以重复，但与旧实现仍有差异","title_en":"The new calculation repeated reliably but differed from the old one","zh":"下一次把稀疏乘法换成确定性的COO计算，图、权重、公式和精度保持。新实现内部的48次标量与批量比较、八组梯度和48次重复计算都通过。但连续状态与旧实现比较时，部分特征和122个梯度元素仍超出原范围。因此按当时声明的兼容标准，候选仍被拒绝。下一步没有改写这项结果，而是单独声明算术迁移：用确定性标量作参照，再增加独立的解析与有限差分梯度检查。","en":"The next diagnostic used deterministic COO sparse arithmetic while retaining the graph, weights, equation and precision. Within the new implementation, forty-eight scalar-versus-batch comparisons, eight gradient sets and forty-eight repeated pairs passed. Comparisons with the legacy implementation still exceeded the old bounds for some continuous features and 122 gradient elements. Under the specified compatibility checks, the candidate remained rejected. The following step preserved that result and explicitly proposed arithmetic migration: use a deterministic scalar reference and add independent analytic and finite-difference gradient checks.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-159","summary_en":"The deterministic calculation repeated reliably but did not match the old implementation closely enough. I kept that result and tested a new reference explicitly.","summary_zh":"确定性计算能稳定重复，却与旧实现不够接近。我保留这个结果，再明确测试采用新数值参照。"},{"title_zh":"先检查重复性和梯度，再采用新算术","title_en":"Check repeatability and gradients before adopting new arithmetic","zh":"这一轮正式把确定性算法作为新计算参照，旧兼容失败继续归档。图、权重、单精度和比较阈值仍保留。208项同实现前向比较与208对重复计算完全一致，八组梯度通过，另外的小型有符号矩阵也通过解析与有限差分检查。父权重和优化器状态不变，没有执行更新或车辆。由此通过的是版本化的算术迁移准备。接下来R7还必须用真实采集数据完成更新、保存、重读、驾驶评估和重置，再进行长学习。","en":"This diagnostic formally adopted the deterministic implementation as the new reference, while retaining legacy compatibility failures in the record. Graph, weights, float precision and comparison thresholds were retained. All 208 same-backend forward comparisons and 208 repeated pairs were exactly equal. Eight gradient sets passed, and a separate small signed-matrix fixture passed analytic and finite-difference checks. Parent weights and optimizer state were unchanged, with no updates or vehicle execution. This accepted the versioned definition of the new arithmetic reference. R7 still had to complete a real collected-data update, checkpoint save and readback, driving evaluation and reset before sustained learning.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-160","summary_en":"The new arithmetic passed repeatability and independent gradient checks without changing the saved weights. It was ready for a real learning-cycle test.","summary_zh":"新算术通过重复性和独立梯度检查，保存权重未变。接下来可以检查真实学习循环。"},{"title_zh":"学习闭环跑完，四条开发路的改善小而不均","title_en":"The learning cycle completed, with small and uneven driving changes","zh":"R7直接继续R4的9,216样本失败检查点和优化器；中间数值诊断没有产生新训练祖先。采用已验证的新算术后，它完成22,528个新优化样本、1,351次更新，并通过实际保存、评估和重置闭环。四条开发道路平均合格前进由9.7676增到9.9659个单位，约增2.03%；两条退、两条升，没有终点。留出道路上有局部转弯，但没有同路初始父策略可算提升。更关键的是道路约250单位，观测速率下全程约需730秒，旧180秒回合不匹配。下一步转为原起点长时间驾驶，同时继续降低循环历史重算成本。","en":"R7 resumed the R4 failure checkpoint after 9,216 samples and its optimizer state directly. The intervening diagnostics had produced no trained descendants. With the accepted arithmetic implementation, R7 optimized 22,528 new driving transitions in 1,351 updates and passed the real save, evaluation and reset cycle. Across four development roads, mean qualified progress rose from 9.7676 to 9.9659 units, about 2.03 percent. Two roads worsened and two improved; none reached the endpoint. Reserved-road recordings contained local bend traversal, but lacked an initial parent evaluation on those same roads for measuring transfer improvement. A further review found a task mismatch: roads were about 250 units long, requiring roughly 730 seconds at the observed progress rate, versus a 180-second episode cap. The next design extended original-start driving while separately validating ways to reduce recurrent-history reconstruction cost.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-161"},{"title_zh":"训练结束后，打包程序因文件名中间的点而停止","title_en":"After training, metadata packaging rejected dots in a filename","zh":"R7训练和一次结算已经完成后，终态材料打包又失败。验证器只接受过窄的文件名形式，误拒绝包含中间点号的合法任务文件名。这个失败不涉及权重或驾驶。修正版只打包已有证据，不再次查询作业或结算，最终十七项元数据全部通过核验。这里保留原打包异常，避免让归档问题被误读成另一次训练失败，也避免重复计费。之后进入C24长路线任务。","en":"R7 training and its one-time settlement had already completed when terminal metadata packaging failed. A filename validator was too narrow and rejected a legitimate task filename containing intermediate dots. This did not affect weights or driving. The revised helper only packaged existing evidence; it did not query the scheduler or settle again. All seventeen final metadata payloads were verified. The original packaging failure remains visible so that it is not mistaken for another training failure or used to duplicate accounting. The project then moved to C24's longer driving task.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-162","summary_en":"Training was complete; only metadata packaging failed on a filename. I repaired the packaging helper without repeating training or settlement.","summary_zh":"训练已经完成，失败的只是元数据打包对文件名的检查。我修复打包程序，没有重复训练或结算。"},{"title_zh":"从原起点开始，允许更长驾驶","title_en":"Allow longer drives from the original start","zh":"C24继续C23最终22,528样本的权重和完整优化器状态。此前道路长度与速度显示180秒不足以走完，因此这次从道路原起点开始，允许1,200秒或6,000个动作，循环历史容量也一起延长。仍是二十四个训练环境、四个开发和四个保留环境，每个环境重置后重复自己的真实道路。新优化样本目标65,536，并在同一条本轮道路上比较父策略和后续版本。不同作业会捕获不同生成道路，原始驾驶时长不能直接横向当作改善。这套设计先要跨过恢复父检查点、数值检查和真实学习闭环。实际前两次未学，第三次才开始；更长上限也没有自动解决后续偏离失败。","en":"C24 resumed the final C23 checkpoint at 22,528 samples with its complete optimizer state. The measured route-length and speed mismatch motivated a longer task. Driving began from each road's original start and allowed 1,200 seconds or 6,000 actions, with recurrent-history capacity extended alongside those limits. The system retained twenty-four training environments, four development environments and four reserved environments. Each simulator reused its recorded road after resetting the car. The target was 65,536 newly optimized samples, comparing the parent and later policies on the same roads captured for that run. Different allocations captured different generated roads, so raw durations across jobs were not matched improvement measures. The design still had to pass parent restoration, numerical checks and a real learning cycle. The first two attempts learned nothing; the third reached training. A longer ceiling removed a task constraint without automatically solving departure behavior.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-163"},{"title_zh":"图数据没变，保存的文件路径却让恢复失败","title_en":"The graph bytes matched, but its recorded path broke restoration","zh":"第一次C24在66秒后停止，模型构造还没完成。保存的父检查点把连接组文件的实际路径也写进了严格合同。新任务把相同字节的图放到另一个目录，路径不同就被拒绝。没有训练样本或更新。这是来源元数据兼容问题。下一版先核验新旧文件哈希、尺寸、结构和其他合同，再只在调用原恢复器期间桥接这个路径字段，随后恢复实际新路径；图与检查点文件不改。","en":"The first C24 attempt stopped after sixty-six seconds before model construction finished. The parent checkpoint's strict restoration checks included the graph's physical source path. The new task placed byte-identical graph data in another directory, and that path difference caused rejection. There were no training samples or updates. The repair verified both graph files, dimensions, structure and remaining required fields, then bridged only the source-path metadata during the original loader call. It restored the new path afterward, without rewriting graph or checkpoint files.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-164","summary_en":"The graph bytes matched, but restoration rejected its new file path. I verified the graph and bridged only that path metadata.","summary_zh":"图数据相同，恢复程序却拒绝新路径。我核对图结构，只转换这项路径元数据。"},{"title_zh":"秒级申请被Slurm向上取整，启动检查又拒绝了","title_en":"Slurm rounded the time request, and startup rejected it","zh":"第二次修了图路径，但作业只运行三秒又退出。申请时间是11小时58分48秒，调度器按分钟向上取成11小时59分，检查程序却要求秒数完全相等。它在创建运行目录、加载模型和启动车辆前就停止了，图路径修复也还没有真实GPU恢复结果。下一版改成整分钟申请，并把依赖的阶段时限一起对齐，再执行同一长路线任务。","en":"The second attempt included the graph-path repair but stopped after three seconds. Its request was eleven hours, fifty-eight minutes and forty-eight seconds. Slurm rounded that upward to eleven hours and fifty-nine minutes, while startup required exact equality in seconds. The job stopped before creating its run directory, loading the model or starting a vehicle. Even the graph-path bridge remained untested on the GPU. The next version used a whole-minute request and aligned its dependent phase clocks before continuing the same long-route task.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-165","summary_en":"The scheduler rounded the requested duration, and an exact-equality check rejected it. I used a whole-minute request for the next attempt.","summary_zh":"调度器把请求时长向上取整，严格相等检查因此拒绝启动。我在下一次使用整分钟请求。"},{"title_zh":"真实学习进行到47936样本，被研究日志容量中断","title_en":"Real learning reached 47,936 samples before a research-log limit stopped it","zh":"第三次C24开始实际学习，共接受52,302条新记录、优化47,936个不同样本，执行2,996次更新。随后重置姿态反复写进单个审计日志，达到16 MiB上限，作业在7,629秒后失败。名字中有“numeric audit”，但实际是日志容量错误，记录没有指向数值爆炸。32,768样本的四条开发道路只有小幅改善，没有终点，47,936失败权重没有后续驾驶评估。下一版把完整姿态无损压缩成独立哈希文件，摘要只保留引用，并从失败权重继续新的学习量。","en":"The third C24 attempt reached real learning: 52,302 accepted records, 47,936 distinct optimized samples and 2,996 updates. Repeated full reset poses then filled a single sixteen-MiB audit log. The job failed after 7,629 seconds. Although the exception name included numeric audit, this was a research-log capacity error rather than recorded numerical divergence. At 32,768 samples, the four development roads showed only small gains and no endpoint. The 47,936-sample failure checkpoint had no subsequent driving evaluation. The next version stored complete poses in separate lossless, hashed compressed files, retaining compact references in the summary before continuing from that checkpoint.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-166","summary_en":"Learning stopped because repeated reset records filled a log limit. I moved complete poses into compressed files before continuing from the saved checkpoint.","summary_zh":"重复的重置记录填满日志上限，学习因此停止。我把完整姿态移入压缩文件，再从保存检查点继续。"},{"title_zh":"学习时只算需要的列，先核验状态与梯度是否相同","title_en":"Compute fewer learner columns only after checking states and gradients","zh":"这项工程检查发生在C24 R3内部、首次更新之前，后续R6又重新验收。此前大部分时间在重算循环历史，学习阶段许多固定计算列却没使用。候选让学习使用较窄形状，仍用当前权重重放完整保存历史，再与原固定三十二列计算比较。R3的896项数值比较、十六项梯度记录和二十四条实际采集概率重放都通过；父参数和优化器未变，检查本身不驾车。随后才采用新形状学习，保留失败时退回原实现的路径，没有从这项验收直接声称整体加速。","en":"This engineering check first ran inside C24 R3 before its first update, and was checked again in R6. History reconstruction dominated compute time while many fixed arithmetic columns were unused during learning. The candidate used a narrower learner shape, still rebuilding complete saved history under current weights, then compared it with the fixed thirty-two-column reference. R3 passed 896 numerical comparisons, sixteen gradient-check records and twenty-four collected probability replays. Parent parameters and optimizer state remained unchanged, and the check itself did not drive a vehicle. The accepted shape was then used for learning, with a preserved fallback path. Acceptance alone did not claim end-to-end speedup.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-167","summary_en":"History reconstruction wasted work on unused batch columns. I checked states and gradients before using a narrower learner calculation.","summary_zh":"重建历史时，未使用的批量列也在耗费计算。我先检查状态和梯度，再采用更窄的学习计算。"},{"title_zh":"车辆已在目标处，最近投影却跳到远处回环","title_en":"The car was at its target, but projection jumped to a distant branch","zh":"R4成功恢复R3的权重和完整优化器，也完成初始评估。但训练重置时，车辆虽然静止在命令起点，整个道路的最近投影却选中空间相邻、路线编号很远的另一段。保存的240帧都被旧偏移检查拒绝；按命令锚点检查，末帧偏移误差只有约0.00000394。397秒后停止，没有新训练。下一步用命令锚点附近的局部关联验收重置，同时保留全局投影作诊断，避免把错误路线关联当作放宽物理位置容差的理由。","en":"R4 restored the R3 weights and saved optimizer state and completed initial evaluations. During training reset, the car was stationary at its commanded start, but global nearest projection chose a spatially nearby branch much further along the route. All 240 saved frames failed the old offset check. Relative to the commanded anchor, the final offset error was only about 0.00000394. The job stopped after 397 seconds without new learning. The next repair used local commanded-anchor association for reset acceptance while preserving global projection as a diagnostic, rather than loosening physical placement tolerance.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-168","summary_en":"The car was correctly placed, but route matching jumped to a distant branch. I matched reset positions locally around the requested start.","summary_zh":"车辆放置正确，路线匹配却跳到远处支路。我改为在要求起点附近做局部匹配。"},{"title_zh":"三万二千次新样本后驾驶近乎不变，重置又多出一帧","title_en":"Driving barely changed after 32,768 new driving transitions, then reset ran one frame long","zh":"R5继续R3失败检查点，采用局部锚点重置。它优化32,768个新样本，开发道路的合格弯道仍是0、0、2、8，驾驶进展一例略升、三例略降。无损姿态文件展开后超过旧16 MiB限制，说明日志修复确实发挥作用。随后从评估返回训练，半秒不计分预热收到约0.8秒、十六个窗口，比允许量多一个窗口，于是拒绝。额外窗口原因未查明。下一步保留此失败，建立新的已核验静止边界，并根据梯度证据选择一个学习路径改动。","en":"R5 resumed the R3 failure checkpoint using local-anchor reset acceptance. It optimized 32,768 new driving transitions. Qualified development bends remained zero, zero, two and eight; progress increased slightly in one case and decreased slightly in three. Lossless pose records expanded beyond the old sixteen-MiB threshold, demonstrating that the logging repair worked. On return from evaluation, an unscored half-second warmup produced about 0.8 seconds and sixteen windows, one window beyond its accepted bound. It was rejected, and the extra window's cause remained unresolved. The next version preserved the failure, established a fresh verified stationary boundary and selected a focused learning-path change from gradient evidence.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-169","summary_en":"The logging fix held during training, but a later warmup exceeded its bound by a frame. Driving had changed little, so I next examined the learning signals.","summary_zh":"日志修复经受了训练，但随后预热多出一帧而超限。驾驶变化很小，我接着检查学习信号。"},{"title_zh":"让转向误差继续训练核心，把回报预测误差挡在核心之外","title_en":"Keep steering learning in the core and stop value errors at its boundary","zh":"R5的策略和内部参数都在变化，驾驶却近乎不变。少量分项检查显示，预测未来回报的误差有时比动作选择的误差更大，而且方向相反。于是R6只改一条学习路径：动作选择仍把误差传回神经核心；回报预测读取同样的下行神经元数值，但在核心边界截断它的误差。这叫梯度路由。外部共享读出仍由两种目标学习，旧优化器历史也保留。实际48次分项检查确认目标路径实施。65,536新样本后，两条开发路明显增加路内时间和弯道，另两条近乎不变，保留路提升很小、无终点。结论是实现生效、结果混合；接着优先修新批次首动作回显问题。","en":"R5 changed both actions and internal parameters while driving stayed almost flat. A small set of component probes showed that return-prediction errors sometimes produced larger, opposing core gradients than action-selection errors. R6 therefore changed one learning path. Action learning still propagated errors through the neural core. Return prediction read the same descending-neuron values, but its errors were stopped at the core boundary. This is gradient routing. The external shared head still learned from both objectives, and inherited optimizer history was retained. Forty-eight recorded component probes verified the intended routing. After 65,536 new driving transitions, two development roads gained substantial inside-road time and bend counts, while two changed little. Reserved-road gains were small and no endpoint was reached. The implementation worked, with mixed behavioral results. The next priority was a recurring command-echo problem on the first action after a learning barrier.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-170"},{"title_zh":"样本目标完成，二十九次旧命令回显被排除","title_en":"The sample target completed, with twenty-nine stale-command echoes excluded","zh":"R6正常完成65,536个新优化样本和4,096次更新，实际接受70,336条记录。二十九次无效间隔都发生在新采集批次的首动作，端点转向回显与上一批最后的动作吻合，而不是新请求。这些间隔被排除、车辆恢复，未生成奖励或训练行。其余4,800条未优化记录来自明确的批次裁切，属于另一类。作业用12,137秒，终态材料确认完成与一次结算。下一步调查更新后控制恢复的时序，保持原回显容差。","en":"R6 completed 65,536 newly optimized samples and 4,096 updates from 70,336 accepted records. Twenty-nine invalid intervals occurred on the first action of a new collection batch. Their endpoint steering echoes matched the preceding batch's last accepted command rather than the new request. These intervals were excluded and recovered, without producing reward or learning rows. Another 4,800 accepted but unoptimized records came from specified batch trimming, a separate category. The allocation lasted 12,137 seconds and retained terminal evidence confirms completion and one settlement. The next task investigated control resumption after updates while retaining the echo tolerance.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-171","summary_en":"Training completed, while stale command reports were excluded and reset separately. I investigated why they occurred just after learner updates.","summary_zh":"训练完成了，旧命令回传区间被单独排除并重置。我调查它们为何集中在学习更新后的首个动作。"},{"title_zh":"首动作修复尚未测试，重置先被陈旧检查挡住","title_en":"Reset failed before the first-action repair could be tested","zh":"R7从R6最终检查点开始，准备在恢复采集前确认新动作已经生效。但初始训练重置先失败：接收函数还没读取已排队的数据，就发现距上次接收超过一秒并拒绝。保存日志显示请求的回复后来在收尾时被读到了。作业1,032秒停止，新的接收交接与学习计数全为零，所以首动作修复没有被验收。下一版只针对不计分锚点查询，先建立有界、完整表示和静止的新接收边界。","en":"R7 resumed the final R6 checkpoint and intended to confirm fresh command acceptance before collection resumed. Initial training reset failed first. Before reading queued data, the receiver rejected the age of its last telemetry, which exceeded one second. Saved logs show that the requested reply was later read during cleanup. The job stopped after 1,032 seconds, with zero new handoffs or learning. The intended first-action repair was therefore untested. The next version targeted a bounded, represented and stationary fresh-receive boundary around the unscored anchor query.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-172","summary_en":"Reset rejected old telemetry before reading the queued reply, so the intended action fix was never tested. I repaired the receive boundary first.","summary_zh":"重置在读取队列中的回复前就拒绝了旧遥测，原动作修复尚未测到。我先修正接收边界。"},{"title_zh":"能读取消息后，回复预算又包含了主机处理时间","title_en":"After receiving worked, reply timing included host processing","zh":"R8实际进入接收和表示过程，不再只在旧时间戳前停止。但三十二个重置预检中十个仍失败，预算把相机表示、主机审计和生产者已经暂停的工作都算进原两秒回复窗口。131秒后停止，没有初始驾驶评估或新学习。另有一个环境的单次原始失败随后重试成功，不能与十个最终预检失败混为一谈。下一版记录真正接收活动和已核验暂停时间，保留完整帧与硬截止，再检验。","en":"R8 reached real receive and representation work instead of failing solely on the old timestamp. Ten of thirty-two reset preflights still failed. The reply budget included camera representation, host auditing and work done while the verified producer was paused. The job stopped after 131 seconds, before initial driving evaluation or new learning. A separate raw failure for one environment later retried successfully; it was distinct from the ten final preflight failures. The next revision recorded active receive and verified paused-host spans separately, retaining complete frames and hard deadlines.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-173","summary_en":"The reply timer included image processing while the simulator was paused. I separated active receiving time from paused host work.","summary_zh":"回复计时把模拟器暂停时的图像处理也算了进去。我分开记录实际接收与暂停期间的主机工作。"},{"title_zh":"同一状态切换用了两个时钟读数，记账出现重叠","title_en":"Two clock reads made one state transition overlap itself","zh":"R9增加了定量时间记录，却在核验中发现“运行中工作被计入暂停”。源代码与原日志显示，同一次恢复先记录一次真实时刻，随后记账又读一次；两者相差几微秒，就把运行事件放进旧暂停区间。二十六个标成接受的原始重置都没通过最终时序核验，另有六个真实截止失败，整个预检未发布，学习为零。下一步让同一切换共用一个实际捕获时刻；另外把同时重置限制为八个，保留严格的原进程身份检查，处理真实主机开销。","en":"R9 added quantitative timing records, but validation found running work inside a purported paused span. Source and retained logs showed two clock reads for one resume transition: one for the verification check record and a later one for accounting. A few microseconds placed the running event inside the previous paused interval. All twenty-six raw resets labelled accepted failed timing validation; six further resets hit real deadlines. Aggregate preflight was never published and learning remained zero. The next repair used one genuinely captured timestamp for the transition. Reset concurrency was also limited to eight, retaining the original strict process verification to address measured host overhead.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-174","summary_en":"Two clock reads gave contradictory running and paused intervals. I used one transition timestamp and reduced reset concurrency.","summary_zh":"同一次切换读取两次时钟，造成运行与暂停区间重叠。我改用单一切换时刻，并降低重置并发。"},{"title_zh":"更快身份检查曾写成候选，但没有投入运行","title_en":"A faster identity-check candidate was prepared but not deployed","zh":"时间分析发现，大部分活动预算与完整进程身份核验重叠。于是曾准备一个候选：在独占阶段两端做完整文件哈希，中间只核查进程和文件身份。它通过了纯测试，却没有被整合、部署或实际计时。最终选择先保留每次完整核验，把不计分重置分批，最多八个同时进行。这条未采用方案保留在时间线，说明我考虑过什么，也避免把源代码候选讲成已经验证的加速。","en":"Timing analysis showed that much of the active budget overlapped full process identity verification. One candidate proposed full file hashing at exclusive-scope boundaries, with process and file identity checks between them. Pure tests passed, but the candidate was not integrated, deployed or timed. The chosen approach instead retained full verification and ran unscored resets in groups of at most eight. The unused branch remains in the timeline to show what was considered, without presenting source-only work as a measured acceleration.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-175","summary_en":"A faster process-check design passed code tests but was not deployed. I kept full checks and chose smaller reset groups instead.","summary_zh":"更快的进程检查方案通过了代码测试，但没有部署。我保留完整检查，改选较小的重置分组。"},{"title_zh":"八个一批重置后训练完成，驾驶改善仍很小","title_en":"Eight-at-a-time resets enabled completion, but driving changed little","zh":"R10仍从R6最终65,536样本检查点继续；R7到R9都没有新优化。它把同一状态切换统一用一个真实时间戳，不计分重置最多八个一批，学习采集仍有二十四辆车。实际重置、动作交接、更新、保存、评估后返回训练的检查全部通过。最终优化49,152个新样本。开发道路弯道数仍为5、6、0、0，驾驶只小幅变化，选择器保留32,768中间检查点，而不是最新最终版本。留出道路上选中策略略有增加但无终点。下一步不再把参数更新当成驾驶进步，改用真实画面、转向变化、偏移和奖励分量寻找具体行为问题。","en":"R10 still resumed the final R6 checkpoint at 65,536 samples; R7 through R9 had performed no new optimization. It used one real timestamp per state transition and ran unscored resets eight at a time, while retaining twenty-four learning collectors. Actual reset, command handoff, update, save, evaluation and return-to-training checks passed. The run optimized 49,152 new driving transitions. Development bend counts remained five, six, zero and zero, with only small driving changes. Selection retained the intermediate checkpoint at 32,768 samples rather than the latest final version. The selected policy showed small reserved-road duration gains but no endpoint. The technical cycle was now reliable in this run. The next task examined original cameras, steering changes, deviation and reward components to identify a concrete behavioral intervention, instead of treating changed parameters as sufficient evidence of improved driving.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-176","summary_en":"Batched resets let the full learning cycle complete, but driving changed little. I kept the selected intermediate model and inspected the recordings.","summary_zh":"分组重置让完整学习循环跑通，但驾驶改善很小。我保留选中的中间模型，继续检查回放。"},{"title_zh":"明显偏离时仍获得较大前进奖励","title_en":"Substantial progress reward remained during visible deviation","zh":"回放显示转向并非常量，核心状态也在变化，但失败位置差不多，最终转向跳变反而增大。把同一动作的奖励拆开看，某个偏移0.509、航向误差负17.26度的时刻，仍有正0.04365奖励。前进项常比偏离项大，而动作变化代价很小。这不是看到正奖励就判定程序错误，而是给下一轮系数选择具体尺度。随后只在保存行为上重新计分检查，不能预测新策略轨迹，再制定R11的新奖励目标。","en":"The recordings showed variable steering and core state, but similar failure locations and larger final steering changes. Reward decomposition gave a concrete scale: one saved point with offset 0.509 and heading error minus 17.26 degrees still received positive reward of 0.04365. Progress often outweighed deviation cost, while action-change cost was very small. Positive reward alone was not treated as a software bug. These measurements motivated a new objective. Offline rescoring checked that objective on existing actions, without predicting how a newly trained policy would drive.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-177","summary_en":"Saved reward components showed that progress could outweigh substantial tracking errors. I used that measurement to design the next reward change.","summary_zh":"保存的奖励分解显示，明显偏离时前进奖励仍可能占优。我据此设计下一次奖励修改。"},{"title_zh":"提高偏离和平滑代价，再加入航向误差","title_en":"Increase deviation and smoothness costs, then add heading error","zh":"R11从R10选中的32,768样本检查点和完整优化器开始。根据回放里的奖励尺度，把偏离系数从0.05提高到0.20，转向变化系数从0.001提高到0.05，再加入随航向误差增大的代价。几何量只用于算奖励，策略仍只看相机输入。学习率、核心结构、动作、起点和控制验收保持。24,576个新样本完成后，四条开发路平均每步转向变化在选中的16,384版本减少约25.5%，最终减少约21.9%。驾驶和恢复只有小变，终点仍为零。因此当时结论是更平滑但还没有稳定解决大偏离；下一步检查未返回的具体轨迹，而不是继续只增加惩罚。","en":"R11 resumed R10's selected 32,768-sample checkpoint and saved optimizer state. Reward measurements motivated three specified changes: deviation coefficient from 0.05 to 0.20, steering-change coefficient from 0.001 to 0.05, and a new heading-error cost. Geometry was used only to compute reward; the policy still observed camera-derived input. Learning rates, core structure, actions, starts and physical acceptance were retained. The run completed 24,576 new driving transitions. Across four development roads, mean consecutive steering change fell by about 25.5 percent at the selected 16,384-sample checkpoint, and 21.9 percent at the final checkpoint. Driving and recovery changed only slightly, and endpoints remained absent. The result was smoother steering without a stable solution to large departures. The next diagnosis followed unrecovered trajectories and action-heading response instead of assuming that still larger penalties would solve them.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-178"},{"title_zh":"活跃导入改名误动历史声明，部署先拒绝了","title_en":"An active import rename accidentally changed a historical declaration","zh":"R11第一次源代码部署在历史清单检查处拒绝。为了切换当前策略而做的导入改名范围过大，也改到了必须原样保留的R7声明。它没有分配GPU或提交训练。修正版只恢复正确历史声明，并增加旧读取器和所有权清单的精确相等检查，放到新的部署目录。实际源代码入口核验通过后才提交一次R11。这个准备错误与后面的奖励实验结果分开记录。","en":"The first R11 source deployment failed a historical inventory check. An import rename intended to select the active policy was too broad and also changed an immutable R7 declaration. It allocated no GPU and submitted no training. The corrected version restored that history declaration, added exact checks for the old reader and process control inventory, and used a fresh deployment directory. Actual source-entry validation passed before one R11 submission. This preparation error remains separate from the later reward experiment's results.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-179","summary_en":"An import edit also changed a historical declaration and stopped preparation. I narrowed the edit before submitting the actual experiment.","summary_zh":"一次导入修改连带改到了历史声明，准备过程因此停止。我缩小修改范围后才提交实际实验。"},{"title_zh":"运行时恢复一次，与画面里的返回道路分别计数","title_en":"Count runtime recovery separately from behavioral return","zh":"R11作业正常完成，接受27,968条记录，优化24,576个新样本，执行1,536次更新。只有一次接口命令回显不符，记录被排除后恢复运行；20条审计记录描述普通批次保留和裁切；已接受但未用于优化的转移共有3,392条。作业用了5,322秒。选中的16,384样本版本在四条留出道路上时长略增，所有终点仍为零。这里的“一次恢复”指接口恢复，不是车辆从偏离中开回来。后者要用相机、位置和时间单独测，下一项就是这次行为复核。","en":"R11 completed normally with 27,968 accepted records, 24,576 newly optimized samples and 1,536 updates. One command-echo mismatch was excluded and followed by runtime recovery. Twenty other audit entries documented ordinary batch retention. Separately from the rejected interval, 3,392 accepted transitions were retained but not optimized. The allocation lasted 5,322 seconds. The selected 16,384-sample policy had slightly longer durations on four reserved roads, with no endpoints. Runtime recovery means restoring a usable interface; it is different from the car steering back after a departure. The following audit measured that behavior separately from camera, pose and time records.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-180","summary_en":"The run completed. I counted interface restarts separately from a car steering back to the road, since they measure different kinds of recovery.","summary_zh":"本次运行完成。我把接口恢复与车辆主动回路分别统计，因为两者测量的是不同事情。"},{"title_zh":"跨过中间参照后有返回，但这个能力原先就存在","title_en":"A middle-reference excursion returned, but the ability already existed","zh":"我观察到越过中线后容易失败，因此我复核二十次完整固定权重驾驶。这里先区分目标车道路径、道路中间参照和相机里实际油漆线。按明确的持续越侧与返回规则，找到二十一次越侧、三次稳定返回；三次其实是同一条开发道路上初始、选中、最终策略重复的一次早期偏移。返回延迟由7.20秒变成6.05或6.20秒，选中版本之后还开了118.55秒。其他十八次没有稳定返回。由此看到有限恢复原先就有，改善很小；这些相关重复不能当独立成功率。下一步继续看未恢复的大偏离过程。","en":"I noticed failures after middle-line crossings and inspected twenty complete fixed-weight drives. The target-lane route, the source-supported road midpoint reference and the visible painted line were kept separate. Under explicit sustained-crossing and return rules, the audit found twenty-one crossings and three stable returns. Those three were the same early excursion on one development road, repeated under initial, selected and final policies. Return delay changed from 7.20 seconds to 6.05 or 6.20 seconds. The selected policy then drove for another 118.55 seconds. Eighteen other crossings had no stable return. Limited recovery therefore already existed before R11 learning, with a small timing change rather than a new broad capability. These correlated repeats are not an independent success-rate sample. The next work focused on unrecovered large departures.","sequence_zh":[],"sequence_en":[],"id":"step-181","summary_en":"A few returns already existed in the parent policy and recurred on the same road. I examined the many larger departures that still had no stable return.","summary_zh":"父策略原先就有少量返回，并在同一道路重复出现。我接着检查那些仍未稳定返回的大偏离。"},{"title_en":"Teach correction from disturbed starts","zh":"到这里，系统已经能从普通起点驾驶，但“偏出去后回到中心”与“回去后保持住”还是两个问题。我选用R11在新增16,384个优化样本时保存的版本，同时恢复权重和优化器的记忆，不用它的最后版本。新增的选择是训练起点：每台车第一次仍从原处开始，之后按一半普通、四分之一向负侧外偏、四分之一向正侧外偏循环。偏移为0.20，朝外角度为5度。\n\n优先改起点，是为了让控制器实际遇到需要纠偏的状态。相机、动作、奖励和学习设置保持原样。我预先把结果分成进入目标带、连续保持五秒、再稳定十秒。这样，短暂经过中心就不会被写成稳定恢复。R12先完成了实现和检查，真正的学习却在启动预检前停住；同一科学问题随后由R13继续。","en":"At this point, ordinary starts were working, but returning toward the center and staying there were still separate problems. I selected the R11 checkpoint saved after 16,384 newly optimized transitions. I restored both its weights and the optimizer's saved memory. This was a selected intermediate checkpoint, not the last R11 model.\n\nThe new choice concerned training starts. Each car first used its original start. Later resets cycled through half ordinary starts, one quarter negative outward starts, and one quarter positive outward starts. The disturbed starts used an offset of 0.20 and an outward heading of five degrees. This gave the controller direct experience of correction while keeping the camera, actions, reward, and learning settings unchanged.\n\nI separated entering the target band, holding it for five seconds, and remaining stable for another ten seconds. R12 implemented this comparison, but its recorded job stopped during startup. R13 later ran the same scientific question.","title_zh":"把离开中心且朝外的起点纳入学习","id":"step-182"},{"title_en":"Make room for the recorded experiment","zh":"开始前，磁盘余量和文件条目都不满足原有启动检查。直接提交只会把问题推到运行中。我先找出已结束作业里字节完全相同的模拟器静态文件，把重复副本改成指向同一内容的硬链接。实际完成41,299个链接，释放约8.46GB分配块下界，重新读取的磁盘余量和63,154个空闲条目通过检查。研究数据、权重和失败记录保留。这一步解决的是运行空间，随后才准备R12入口。","en":"Before starting, the available disk space and file entries were below the existing startup limits. Submitting anyway would only move that failure into the run. I first found byte-identical simulator assets in completed jobs and replaced their duplicate storage with hard links. The operation completed 41,299 links and released a measured lower bound of about 8.46 billion allocated bytes. Fresh quota readings passed the original limits, including 63,154 free file entries. Research data, weights, and failure records were retained. This made room for the experiment; it produced no driving result.","title_zh":"先解决磁盘和文件数量不足","id":"step-183","summary_en":"Disk and file-entry limits blocked startup. Sharing verified duplicate simulator files restored capacity while preserving research records.","summary_zh":"磁盘和文件数限制阻挡启动。我让已核对的重复模拟器文件共享存储，在保留研究记录的同时腾出容量。"},{"title_en":"The submission entry could not import its new policy","zh":"准备阶段先修了部署端提前导入、旧训练量检查和恢复报告边界，形成最终A4。它部署成功后，提交端重建配置却又在设置导入目录前使用新policy，所以仍找不到模块。此时尚未调用Slurm，没有作业编号或GPU消耗。我保留A4，另加先核验文件、再建立11个真实导入根的外层入口。真实verify-only通过后，才产生唯一的2304927作业。部署端能运行，没有覆盖提交端这条实际路径。","en":"Preparation first repaired premature deployment-side imports, an old training-count check, and recovery-reporting boundaries, producing final package A4. Deployment passed, but the separate submission entry again used the new policy before establishing its import directories. It failed before Slurm was called, with no job ID or GPU allocation. I retained A4 and added an outer launcher that checked the files before establishing the eleven real import roots. An verification-only call then passed, followed by the single job 2304927. Successful deployment had not covered this separate submission path.","title_zh":"提交入口缺少新policy的导入根","id":"step-184","summary_en":"Deployment passed, but the separate submission script imported the new policy too early. I fixed and checked that entry before submitting once.","summary_zh":"部署检查通过，独立提交脚本却过早导入新策略。我修复并检查这个入口后，才进行一次正式提交。"},{"title_en":"A metadata preflight stopped before any model was built","zh":"真正的R12作业只运行了22秒。它先让32个子进程检查并发写记录，31个正常退出，第29号写者在停止信号原子发布附近读取控制文件时失败。此时还没有图形、神经模型、父权重恢复或学习。记录支持文件发布交界的身份竞态，但失败瞬间的链接数没有保存，具体旧inode原因仍是推断。下一步因此修文件读取协议，训练起点的科学设置不变。","en":"The recorded R12 job lasted only 22 seconds. Its first task was a 32-writer metadata preflight. Thirty-one children exited normally; writer 29 failed while reading the control file near publication of the stop signal. Graphics, the neural model, parent restoration, and learning had not started. The records support a race at the file-publication boundary. The failing inode's link count was not saved, so that particular low-level explanation remains an inference. The next revision therefore repaired the reader while retaining the planned training-start experiment.","title_zh":"R12在元数据写入预检结束时停止","id":"step-185","summary_en":"A metadata reader raced with a file replacement before graphics or learning started. I changed it to read one consistent file version.","summary_zh":"图形和学习启动前，元数据读取遇到文件替换冲突。我改为读取同一份一致的文件版本。"},{"title_en":"Read one coherent control-file version","zh":"我没有取消文件身份检查，而是让一次读取绑定到一个完整、仍有效的文件版本。新读取器在读前后核对同一文件描述符的九项身份，要求链接数仍为一；遇到已失效描述符，只能在原截止时间内有限重开。R13的实际32个I/O子进程全部正常结束，系统终于到达模型恢复和学习。历史失败的底层状态仍保留未知，但这个运行边界已经有了实测通过的版本。","en":"I kept the file-identity checks and changed how a coherent version was read. The new reader checked nine identity fields on the same descriptor before and after reading, and required its link count to remain one. An invalidated descriptor could be reopened only a bounded number of times within the original deadline. In R13, all 32 recorded I/O children exited normally, allowing model restoration and learning to begin. The exact historical inode state remains unknown, but the revised execution boundary now had a measured pass.","title_zh":"在原子替换时读取一个完整且仍有效的控制文件","id":"step-186","summary_en":"The revised reader verified one file descriptor throughout each read. The next run passed that check and reached learning.","summary_zh":"修改后的读取器在整次读取中核对同一文件描述符。下一次运行通过了检查，进入学习。"},{"title_en":"More recovery starts did not produce more stable recovery","zh":"R13重新从R11选中的16,384样本检查点开始，恢复完整优化器，再执行前面设计的双侧外偏起点训练。它接受17,280条新转移，其中16,384条进入优化，完成1,024次更新；每条优化样本被使用四次，合计65,536次样本使用。训练和52个评估案例都保留下来。\n\n结果把“能回去”和“能待住”分开了。父策略和新策略都在16个外偏起点进入目标带，但五秒确认从10例降到4例，随后十秒稳定从2例降到0例。普通道路有个别弯道改善，仍没有路线完成。因此，单靠增加外偏经历没有解决稳定纠偏。接下来我先查动作是否正确传到车上，再查奖励和更新怎样影响对齐。","en":"R13 restarted from the selected R11 checkpoint and restored the complete optimizer state. It then ran the planned training with outward starts on both sides. It accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 distinct transitions, and completed 1,024 updates. Each optimized transition was used four times, giving 65,536 sample uses. The training record and all 52 evaluation cases were retained.\n\nThe result separated returning from staying. Both the parent and the new policy entered the target band in all sixteen disturbed-start cases. However, five-second confirmations fell from ten cases to four. Stability for the following ten seconds fell from two cases to zero. Some ordinary-road bend results improved, but no normal drive completed its route.\n\nAdding correction experience had therefore not solved stable recovery. The next step was to check whether steering reached the car correctly, and then examine how the reward and updates treated alignment.","title_zh":"向外起点训练完成，但稳定恢复下降","id":"step-187"},{"title_en":"Check command delivery before changing the learning objective","zh":"R13再次偏航，首先要排除动作传递错误。我核对23,565个评估动作，要求转向与保存的执行回显只差浮点误差，没有发现新增缩放或整步延迟。再看原奖励：在偏移0.1、朝向5度、步长0.2秒时，两项误差代价合计约0.00198，典型进度奖励约0.07。坏动作的优势多数仍为负，所以没有直接发现PPO或GAE坏了。下一轮只检验更重视对齐的目标。","en":"Repeated drift first raised a practical question: was the requested steering reaching the car? I checked all 23,565 R13 evaluation actions. Requests and endpoint echoes agreed at floating-point precision, with no newly observed action scaling or whole-step delay. I then inspected the reward. At offset 0.1, heading error five degrees, and a 0.2-second step, the two tracking costs totaled about 0.00198 against typical progress reward around 0.07. Most recoverable bad-action advantages were still negative, so the analysis did not identify broken PPO or GAE. It motivated one alignment-objective experiment.","title_zh":"先排查转向传递，再检查奖励是否重视对齐","id":"step-188","summary_en":"Steering requests matched the car's reported commands. Reward inspection then motivated testing a stronger alignment objective.","summary_zh":"转向请求与车辆报告的命令一致。随后的奖励检查促使我测试更强的对齐目标。"},{"title_en":"A stronger alignment objective helped briefly, then relapsed","zh":"R14仍从同一R11选中检查点开始，避免把R13已经变化的权重也带进比较。它只替换距离和朝向代价：小误差按平方增长，大误差按线性增长；参考尺度分别是0.1距离单位和5度。在0.2秒步长的联合边界，两项代价合计变为0.04。动作、进度奖励、学习率和PPO保留。\n\n这次也完成16,384条新优化转移和1,024次更新。五秒确认由13/16升到15/16，随后十秒稳定由1/16升到4/16。不过，这四例后来全部再次离开窄带；一条普通保留路的驾驶时间从约562秒降到152秒。我得到的是有限时间窗的恢复收益与普通驾驶损失。下一步转向更新过程，检查共同裁剪是否把不同参数的学习绑在一起。","en":"R14 again started from the same selected R11 checkpoint. This avoided carrying the changed R13 weights into the new comparison. It replaced only the distance and heading costs. Small errors received quadratic costs, while large errors received linear tails. Their reference scales were 0.1 distance units and five degrees. At the joint boundary with a 0.2-second step, the two costs now totaled 0.04. Steering, progress reward, learning rates, and PPO were retained.\n\nThe run completed 16,384 newly optimized transitions and 1,024 updates. Five-second confirmations rose from 13 of 16 to 15 of 16. Stability for the following ten seconds rose from one case to four. But all four later left the narrow band again. One ordinary held-out drive also fell from about 562 to 152 seconds.\n\nThis was a finite recovery gain with an ordinary-driving cost. I next inspected the update process, especially the common gradient clipping shared by the head and core.","title_zh":"加重小偏离的代价，短期稳定有改善但随后仍离开","id":"step-189"},{"title_en":"The common gradient limit was active almost every update","zh":"共同裁剪会把一次更新的全部梯度一起缩小。R14的1,024次更新中，它触发了1,023次。我再看13个分量探针：核心收到了动作目标的梯度，价值目标在核心为零；外部读出却有动作与价值共享的中间层。共同限制确实把这些更新耦合起来，但记录没有显示每次都由价值梯度主导或更新爆炸。因此下一步只分开核心和读出的裁剪预算，检验这个具体选择。","en":"Common gradient clipping scales the update signals together when their combined norm is too large. It activated in 1,023 of R14's 1,024 updates. Thirteen component probes showed actor gradients reaching the core and zero value gradients there, while the external readout still contained a shared actor-and-value trunk. The common limit therefore coupled these updates. The records did not show value gradients dominating every probe or an explosive optimizer. The next experiment separated the head and core clipping budgets to test this specific choice.","title_zh":"共同梯度裁剪几乎每次触发","id":"step-190","summary_en":"The common gradient limit acted almost every update and coupled the core and readout. I tested separate limits in the next experiment.","summary_zh":"共同梯度限制几乎每次更新都会触发，把核心和读出绑在一起。下一次实验分别限制两者。"},{"title_en":"Give the head and core separate gradient budgets","zh":"下一项选择是分开限制核心和读出的更新信号。核心范数上限设为0.05，读出上限约0.4975；两个上限合在一起，原来0.5的总界限仍保留。我继续选R11的同一检查点和完整优化器，同时使用R14奖励与双侧起点。这样，改变的是当前梯度预算分配，学习率、损失和模型结构都没有一起换。\n\n这是为共同裁剪耦合提出的一次实验，数值不是已经找出的最优值。R15虽然准备并提交了这套配置，实际却在图形启动前失败，尚未训练。后面R16到R18依次解决图形、证明重放和路径边界，直到R19才完成这项科学配置的完整学习。源码版本前进，与权重父节点前进是两回事。","en":"The next choice was to limit the head and core update signals separately. The core norm cap was 0.05 and the head cap about 0.4975. Together they retained the original total bound of 0.5. I again selected the same R11 checkpoint and its complete optimizer state, while keeping the R14 reward and the two-sided training starts. The intervention concerned the current gradient-budget allocation; learning rates, losses, and model structure were retained.\n\nThese caps were a specified experiment, not measured optimal values. R15 prepared and submitted the configuration, but its recorded job failed before graphics startup and before training. R16 through R18 then addressed graphics, proof replay, and a path boundary. R19 eventually completed the full learning run for this scientific configuration.\n\nThis is why the diagram separates source revisions from weight ancestry. A later implementation number does not mean it continued the preceding failed job's learned weights.","title_zh":"分别限制核心和读出更新的梯度幅度","id":"step-191"},{"title_en":"A missing graphics-device directory stopped startup","zh":"这次作业运行27秒后结束。32个图形owner都在把已分配GPU的PCI身份映射到DRM路径时遇到文件不存在：实际上下文里没有/dev/dri。Xvfb、VirtualGL、Unity和神经模型都没有启动，裁剪实验也没有开始。我只确定了缺失的前提，没有足够历史状态把原因归到驱动升级或命名空间变化。下一步是在真实分配里做一次只读元数据检查。","en":"This job ended after 27 seconds. All 32 graphics processes failed while mapping the allocated GPU's PCI identity to its DRM path: the recorded context had no /dev/dri directory. Xvfb, VirtualGL, Unity, and the neural model had not started, so the clipping experiment had not begun. I located the missing prerequisite, but lacked comparable historical state to attribute it to a driver change or namespace change. The next step was one bounded metadata inspection inside a real allocation.","title_zh":"图形设备目录缺失，尚未开始测试裁剪","id":"step-192","summary_en":"Graphics startup stopped because a required device directory was missing. The learning experiment had not begun; I inspected the allocated environment.","summary_zh":"必要设备目录缺失，图形启动因此停止。学习实验尚未开始，我先检查实际分配环境。"},{"title_en":"Inspect the missing prerequisite in an allocated job","zh":"这次只读固定的设备、模块和运行上下文，没有建立图形或模型。真实分配中再次没有/dev/dri，记录中有NVIDIA模块，但没有nvidia_drm项。探针本身极短，Slurm主行的计时为零秒。这个结果说明缺失在容器之前就可见，仍没有测试EGL是否可用，也没有重建R15失败时的底层原因。于是我研究能直接按硬件身份选择EGL的普通账户可用的路径。","en":"This inspection read fixed device, module, and context metadata without creating graphics or a model. The allocated job again had no /dev/dri directory. NVIDIA modules were recorded, but no nvidia_drm entry was present. The probe was very short, and Slurm's main row reported zero elapsed seconds. The missing prerequisite was therefore visible before the container. EGL feasibility and the historical cause of R15's failure remained untested. I next investigated a user-level EGL selection path bound to the recorded hardware identity.","title_zh":"在真实分配内确认缺少DRM目录","id":"step-193","summary_en":"The same device directory was absent before entering the container. I investigated direct hardware rendering through the available account.","summary_zh":"进入容器前就已缺少同一设备目录。我转而检查当前账户能否直接使用硬件渲染。"},{"title_en":"The hardware context worked, but the pixel test failed","zh":"直接EGL试验先核对实际GPU的UUID和PCI，再建硬件图形上下文。初始化成功，渲染器确为L40；但2×2像素读回得到16个零，原颜色门失败。默认读写缓冲状态当时没有保存，因此不能把原因直接归给驱动。我保留这个一秒失败作业，下一版改用明确的RGBA8帧缓冲、明确读写目标和完整性检查，颜色容差保持原值。","en":"The direct-EGL test first bound the context to the allocated GPU's UUID and PCI identity. Initialization succeeded and the renderer was the L40. However, the two-by-two pixel readback returned sixteen zeros, failing the original color check. The default draw and read buffer state had not been retained, so the result did not identify a driver cause. I preserved this one-second failed job. The next probe used an explicit RGBA8 framebuffer, explicit read and draw targets, and completeness checks while retaining the original color tolerance.","title_zh":"EGL能建立硬件上下文，但像素读回门失败","id":"step-194","summary_en":"The hardware renderer initialized, but the pixel test returned zeros. I made the framebuffer and its readback settings explicit.","summary_zh":"硬件渲染器初始化成功，像素测试却读回全零。我明确指定帧缓冲及读回设置。"},{"title_en":"An explicit framebuffer passed the color check","zh":"改动只针对测量中的缓冲状态。四个像素实际都读回[32,127,223,255]，与目标[32,128,223,255]相差一，落在原容差内；当前图形上下文的UUID和PCI也匹配实际L40。这个一秒作业正常完成并清理退出。它为直接EGL路径提供了实测通过，但还没有启动VirtualGL或车辆。下一步把同样的身份和像素检查接到真实应用启动链。","en":"The change addressed the buffer state in the measurement. All four pixels read back as [32,127,223,255], within the original tolerance of one from the expected [32,128,223,255]. The current context's UUID and PCI identity also matched the allocated L40. This one-second job completed and cleaned up normally. It established a measured pass for direct EGL in that process. VirtualGL and the vehicle had not started yet, so the next step carried identity and pixel checks into the application startup chain.","title_zh":"显式帧缓冲的像素读回通过","id":"step-195","summary_en":"The explicit framebuffer returned the expected colours. I next carried those hardware checks into the application startup path.","summary_zh":"明确帧缓冲后，读回颜色符合预期。我接着把这些硬件检查接入应用启动流程。"},{"title_en":"Slurm rejected Windows line endings before allocating a job","zh":"R16第一次提交在Slurm入口被拒：脚本还是Windows换行。没有作业编号，也没有运行训练，但原reservation仍在。我保留原脚本和拒绝记录，只在新的执行封套中转换为LF，再做bash语法与真实verify-only检查。修正后才产生2318469，而且沿用同一reservation。这是提交格式问题，不该算作两个GPU训练作业。","en":"The first R16 submission was rejected at the Slurm entry because the script still used Windows line endings. No job ID was created and no training ran, although the original reservation remained. I retained the original script and rejection, then normalized the line endings to LF in a separate execution script. Bash syntax and an verification-only call were checked before the corrected submission created job 2318469. It used the same reservation. This was a submission-format failure, not two GPU training allocations.","title_zh":"提交脚本的Windows换行在Slurm入口被拒","id":"step-196","summary_en":"The scheduler rejected Windows line endings before creating a job. I converted the submission script and checked its real entry point.","summary_zh":"调度器在创建作业前就拒绝了 Windows 换行。我转换提交脚本，并检查真实入口。"},{"title_en":"The first X server crashed before the vehicle started","zh":"真正分配后的R16运行29秒。第一台owner的Xvfb在初始化扩展时崩溃，堆栈同时经过软件渲染和NVIDIA EGL相关库。第一owner门因此阻止另外31个启动。直接EGL、VirtualGL、Unity、模型和裁剪都未到达。我知道崩溃位置，却没有唯一底层原因。下一项选择是只给私有X server软件Mesa环境，让独立硬件渲染子进程保留干净的NVIDIA环境。","en":"The allocated R16 job lasted 29 seconds. Its first graphics process's Xvfb crashed while initializing extensions, with the stack passing through software-rendering and NVIDIA EGL-related libraries. The first-simulator process check prevented the other 31 simulator processes from starting. Direct EGL, VirtualGL, Unity, the model, and clipping were not reached. The crash location was known, but its unique underlying cause was not established. The next choice isolated the private X server in a software-Mesa environment while keeping the separate hardware-rendering children in clean NVIDIA environments.","title_zh":"第一台Xvfb在扩展初始化中崩溃","id":"step-197","summary_en":"The private X server crashed before the vehicle or model started. I isolated software display setup from hardware-rendering processes.","summary_zh":"专用 X 服务器在车辆和模型启动前崩溃。我把软件显示环境与硬件渲染进程隔离。"},{"title_en":"Separate software X and hardware rendering processes","zh":"这个三秒诊断只启动私有Xvfb及图形客户端。X server使用llvmpipe软件渲染，其库映射没有NVIDIA EGL/GBM；独立EGL和VirtualGL子进程则在实际L40上通过UUID、PCI和原像素门。九个拥有的进程记录都正常退出。这样得到的是图形启动链的有限通过，还没有Unity或学习结果。下一轮必须重新把真实车辆、32个owner和原科学短检查一起跑通。","en":"This three-second diagnostic started only the private X server and graphics clients. Xvfb used llvmpipe software rendering, and its library maps excluded NVIDIA EGL and GBM. Separate EGL and VirtualGL children passed the UUID, PCI, and original pixel checks on the allocated L40. All nine owned-process records ended cleanly. This was a bounded pass for the graphics startup chain, with no Unity or learning result. The next run still had to combine the real vehicle, 32 simulators, and the original scientific short checks.","title_zh":"软件X server和硬件渲染进程分开后通过","id":"step-198","summary_en":"The isolated display and hardware clients passed the graphics checks. The full simulator-and-learning test still had to follow.","summary_zh":"隔离后的显示服务和硬件客户端通过了图形检查。随后仍需测试完整模拟器和学习流程。"},{"title_en":"Recover file capacity using already-backed-up camera copies","zh":"图形修复期间还遇到文件条目不足。我只选择已完整下载、逐张核验的R13和R14远程相机副本，研究记录与权重另列保护。第一清理入口因login架构不同而安全拒绝，第二版只修文件操作的架构门，随后一次清理9,005张重复JPEG。新quota显示38,321个空闲条目。本地原档和所有回放素材仍在，接下来才能在原余量门下启动R17。","en":"File-entry capacity also became a startup constraint. I selected only remote R13 and R14 camera copies whose complete local backups had been checked, protecting research records and weights separately. The first cleanup entry safely rejected the login architecture. The second changed only that file-operation architecture guard and removed 9,005 duplicate JPEGs in one bounded operation. Fresh quota showed 38,321 free entries. The original local archives and replay material remained available. This restored capacity for R17 under the existing startup limits.","title_zh":"清理已经完整备份的远程相机副本以恢复文件余量","id":"step-199","summary_en":"Backed-up camera duplicates were using needed file entries. Removing only those verified copies made room for the next run.","summary_zh":"已有备份的相机副本占用了所需文件数。我只清理核对过的副本，为下一次运行腾出空间。"},{"title_en":"Short training passed, but a floating-point check stopped the long run","zh":"R17终于经过图形与学习短周期，接受并优化1,920条新转移，完成120次Adam更新，八个短检查文件都已发布通过。但主控在接受长训练屏障前，重新核算裁剪证明时要求浮点数完全相同，因而拒绝。实际返回的24次裁剪最大总范数仍小于0.5，记录没有显示越界。我保留这段真实学习，也把主控未接纳长训练写清，接下来专查两个运行环境的标量重算。","en":"R17 reached graphics and the learning short cycle. It accepted and optimized 1,920 new transitions and completed 120 Adam updates. All eight short-check files had been published as passing. Before accepting sustained learning, however, the coordinator replayed the clipping proof and rejected an exact floating-point equality. The returned callbacks' measured total norms remained below 0.5; the retained evidence did not show a clipping-cap violation. I preserved the real short learning while recording that the coordinator never allowed sustained training. The next diagnosis compared scalar recomputation across runtimes.","title_zh":"短时训练通过，浮点检查却挡住长训","id":"step-200","summary_en":"Short training completed, but the coordinator stopped the long run on an overly strict floating-point equality check. Recorded gradient norms stayed within the limit.","summary_zh":"短时训练完成，但协调程序因过严的浮点相等检查阻止长时训练。保存的梯度范数都在限制以内。"},{"title_en":"Exact norm equality differed across Python runtimes","zh":"我用同一份120次回调记录重算720个范数字段。本地Python3.12与保存值逐位一致，而login的Python3.9有203项不同，最大只差两个浮点末位单位；所有裁剪后范数仍在上限内。主控和学习端解释器不同，旧测试却只在同一解释器里回转JSON。下一版因此用已固定的客户端解释器执行原严格验证器，不改容差。原compute主控那次具体浮点值没保存，这一点保留为缺口。","en":"I recomputed 720 norm fields from the same 120 recorded callbacks. Local Python 3.12 matched the stored values bit for bit. The login host's Python 3.9 differed in 203 fields, by at most two units in the last place. Every post-clipping norm remained within its cap. The coordinator and learner used different interpreters, while earlier tests had round-tripped JSON within one interpreter. The next version therefore ran the original strict validator through the pinned client interpreter, retaining its tolerance. The original compute coordinator's exact recomputed floats were not saved.","title_zh":"两个Python版本对同一norm相差最多2 ULP","id":"step-201","summary_en":"Recomputing the same gradient norms differed slightly between Python versions. I ran the validator with the learner's pinned interpreter.","summary_zh":"不同 Python 版本重算同一批梯度范数时出现微小差异。我改用学习器指定的解释器执行验证。"},{"title_en":"Restore the original file-entry headroom again","zh":"R17保留之后，空闲文件条目再次低于30,000的原门。我另建计划，只处理已经本地备份的R10、R11和R17相机副本，保护469条研究、源和检查点路径。一次执行移除8,001张远程重复图像，新quota为33,513个空闲条目。删除数与净quota变化分别记录，旧素材没有丢。下一步才继续R18的真实入口检查。","en":"After preserving R17, free file entries again fell below the original 30,000-entry limit. A separate plan covered only backed-up R10, R11, and R17 camera copies, protecting 469 research, source, and checkpoint paths. One operation removed 8,001 remote duplicate images. Fresh quota then showed 33,513 free entries. The deletion count and net quota change were recorded separately, and the local material remained intact. Only then did R18 proceed to its entry checks.","title_zh":"R18前再次恢复原文件条目余量","id":"step-202","summary_en":"File capacity fell below the startup limit again. I removed verified remote image duplicates while protecting the retained local material.","summary_zh":"可用文件数再次低于启动要求。我清理已核对的远程图像副本，保留本地材料。"},{"title_en":"A relative task path was rejected before the replay child ran","zh":"R18把严格重放安排在图形和昂贵父评估之前，但运行22秒就停住。原shell传入相对task路径，调用者虽然已读取该task，却又把相对字符串交给要求绝对路径的证明构建器。32个I/O子进程正常结束；重放子进程、图形、模型都未启动。这是调用边界错误，原路径门本身应保留。R19接着在真实load_task之后统一路径，并把原recipe的实际参数纳入预检。","en":"R18 placed strict replay before graphics and expensive parent evaluations, but stopped after 22 seconds. The shell recipe supplied a relative task path. Although the caller had already read the task, it passed that relative string to a proof builder requiring an absolute path. All 32 I/O children exited normally; the replay child, graphics, and model never started. This was a caller-boundary error, and the strict path guard was retained. R19 normalized the verified path after the real task load and tested the recipe's argument during preparation.","title_zh":"相对task路径被严格metadata路径门拒绝","id":"step-203","summary_en":"A relative task path reached a helper that required an absolute path. I corrected the caller before trying the same experiment again.","summary_zh":"辅助程序要求绝对路径，调用方却传入相对任务路径。我修正调用方后，再尝试同一实验。"},{"title_en":"The completed clipping experiment still lost ordinary-road progress","zh":"R19修好调用边界后，终于完整执行分开裁剪预算的配置。它从R11选中版本恢复，不接R14或R17的权重。新接受17,280条转移，优化16,384条，完成1,024次更新；所有短检查和同客户端严格重放通过。\n\n这次恢复的五秒确认从11/16降到8/16，严格十秒稳定两边都没有观察到成功；其中候选四例确认后的跟踪不足，按删失保留。普通八路合格进度由513.15降到492.35，合格弯道47降到46，四路好、四路差，没有路线完成。保存的更新探针显示共同读出里价值与动作梯度可能相互干扰，但还不是失败的唯一原因。我先用现成的中间检查点做固定权重评估，判断局部收益是否曾出现再丢失，而不立即再训。","en":"After repairing the caller boundary, R19 finally completed the separate-clipping configuration. It restored the selected R11 model, rather than continuing R14 or the short R17 weights. It accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 distinct transitions, and completed 1,024 updates. The short checks and both strict client-runtime replays passed.\n\nFive-second recovery confirmations fell from eleven of sixteen to eight. Neither policy had an observed strict ten-second stable recovery. Four candidate confirmations lacked enough follow-up and remained censored. Across the eight normal roads, qualified progress fell from 513.15 to 492.35 and qualified bends from 47 to 46. Four roads improved, four worsened, and none reached its endpoint.\n\nRecorded probes suggested that value and action gradients could interfere in the shared readout trunk, without identifying a unique cause. Before training again, I chose to evaluate the saved intermediate checkpoints and see whether a local gain had appeared and then been lost.","title_zh":"独立裁剪预算完整训练后，普通路和恢复总体未改善","id":"step-204"},{"title_en":"Intermediate gains were brief and confined to one recovery case","zh":"R20没有继续学习。它把R11参考与R19的6,144、12,288、16,384三个检查点，依次放到同四条新开发道路和三个起点上，共48次固定权重驾驶。这样比较的是同一批路，而不是用不同随机道路拼出学习曲线。\n\n正常驾驶合格进度依次约131.62、65.80、64.23、63.72。两个中间版本各有1/8恢复通过十秒稳定，且是同一条路的同一负向外偏案例；分别在规定窗口结束约1.85秒和1.20秒后又破带。最后版本连这个有限收益也失去。所有检查点都没有全尾段稳定。我因此保留普通驾驶更强的R11作下轮父节点，只针对读出共享层的梯度路由提出新实验。","en":"R20 performed no further learning. It evaluated the R11 reference and the R19 checkpoints at 6,144, 12,288, and 16,384 optimized transitions. Each used the same four newly captured development roads and three starts, making 48 fixed-weight drives. This avoided building a learning curve from unrelated random roads.\n\nNormal qualified progress was about 131.62, 65.80, 64.23, and 63.72 across the four checkpoints. Both intermediate models passed the ten-second recovery test in one of eight cases. It was the same road and the same negative-outward start. They breached the band again about 1.85 and 1.20 seconds after the required follow-up ended. The final model lost even that finite gain. No checkpoint stayed stable throughout its recorded tail.\n\nI therefore retained R11's stronger ordinary-driving capability as the next parent and proposed one targeted change to gradient routing in the shared readout trunk.","title_zh":"检查学习中段：少数短暂恢复，没有找回普通路能力","id":"step-205"},{"title_en":"Keep current value gradients out of the shared driving trunk","zh":"R21再次从R11选中版本开始。动作和值预测共用的读出中间层，此前会同时收到两项目标的更新。现在只把这两个共享参数的当前梯度换成动作与探索项的导数；价值输出仍学习，其他梯度、前向计算和完整Adam历史保留。优先改这里，是为了单独检验已有探针指出的干扰可能。\n\n本轮完成16,384条新优化样本和1,024次更新。普通八路合格进度342.02变343.47，弯道26变25，结果混合。开发集十秒稳定仍为零，保留集从零变两例，恰是同一28号路的两个起点。它们更早确认、保持更久；后来一度只因朝向略超5度破带，约0.2秒后重入，不能说那一刻已离路。接下来我只用开发记录研究较长振荡，选择R21最后版本继续。","en":"R21 again began from the selected R11 model. The readout's shared trunk had previously received updates from both action selection and value prediction. I replaced the current gradients of those two shared parameters with the action-and-entropy derivatives. The value output still learned. Other gradients, forward computation, and the saved Adam optimizer state were retained. This tested the interference suggested by the probes with one targeted update change.\n\nThe run completed 16,384 newly optimized transitions and 1,024 updates. Normal qualified progress changed from 342.02 to 343.47, while bends changed from 26 to 25. Development-road ten-second stability stayed at zero. Held-out stability rose from zero to two cases, both starts on the same road 28.\n\nThose cases confirmed earlier and held longer. Later, small heading breaches were followed by reentry about 0.2 seconds later; those instants were not road departures. I next used development records to study the longer oscillations and selected R21's final checkpoint for continuation.","title_zh":"让价值预测的当前梯度不再改动共同驾驶读出","id":"step-206"},{"title_en":"Measure the real time between correction and renewed drift","zh":"要把一次纠偏与几秒后的后果联系起来，先要知道真实步长。我只看开发道路：R21十次首次破带里九次是朝向先超限，八个完整摆动周期中位数6.20秒；训练步长平均约0.233秒。将GAE的lambda从0.95改到0.99，按这个时钟，较早误差影响后续回报的衰减会更慢。它不是把循环记忆硬加长，而是一次更长信用分配的假说。下一轮只改这一项。","en":"To connect a correction with its consequences several seconds later, I first measured the real step clock. On development roads, nine of R21's ten first band breaches were heading-first. Eight complete oscillation cycles had a median of 6.20 seconds, while training steps averaged about 0.233 seconds. Raising GAE lambda from 0.95 to 0.99 would make earlier errors retain more weight over that timescale. This changed credit weighting, not a hard recurrent-memory length. The next run tested that factor alone.","title_zh":"从真实时钟判断纠偏后果跨越多少步","id":"step-207","summary_en":"The saved drives showed several seconds between correction and renewed drift. I tested giving earlier actions more weight over that timescale.","summary_zh":"保存驾驶显示，纠偏与再次偏离之间相隔数秒。我据此测试在这段时间尺度上增加早先动作的权重。"},{"title_en":"An outdated interface check blocked continuation","zh":"R22选择R21最终检查点，计划只把lambda改为0.99。但实际客户端仍导入旧group19的执行合约，而任务配置已经要求新policy的R21完整恢复。作业69秒后在这个重复入口检查被拒。32个真实图形owner已经通过GPU和Unity门，模型、优化器和学习尚未构建。这个结果属于整合错误，长信用分配没有得到科学检验。R23接着统一新合约，让准备期和真实客户端使用同一个验证函数。","en":"R22 selected the final R21 checkpoint and planned to change only lambda to 0.99. Its recorded client, however, still imported an outdated interface check from group 19, while the task correctly required the new policy's complete R21 restoration. The job was rejected at that duplicated entry check after 69 seconds. All 32 real graphics processes had passed GPU and Unity startup checks, but the model, optimizer, and learning had not been constructed. This was an integration error; longer credit assignment remained untested. R23 unified the interface requirements and the validator used by preparation and the real client.","title_zh":"旧接口检查阻挡续训","id":"step-208","summary_en":"A duplicated old interface check rejected the continuation before model construction. I made preparation and execution use the same check.","summary_zh":"重复保留的旧接口检查在模型构建前拒绝续训。我让准备和执行使用同一套检查。"},{"title_en":"Longer credit weighting gave a small normal-road gain","zh":"R23修正入口后，从R21最终权重和完整优化器继续，实际检验lambda0.99。其他设置保留。它接受17,280条新转移，优化16,384条，1,024次更新完成；52个评估案例和真实图像都保存。\n\n在这批实际配对道路上，普通合格进度由864.24升到886.27，约增加2.55%，弯道78变84，但两边都没有路线完成。恢复方面，16个起点两边都能五秒确认，随后十秒稳定却从8例变6例；全部尾段稳定从1例变0例。新策略16次首次破带都是朝向超限，其中13次一秒内重入。判断因此是普通路局部小增，持续纠偏没有总体改善。下一步先固定权重，检验执行端平滑是否有帮助。","en":"After repairing the entry, R23 continued from the final R21 weights and complete optimizer state to test lambda 0.99. The other settings were retained. It accepted 17,280 new transitions, optimized 16,384 distinct transitions, and completed 1,024 updates. All 52 evaluation cases and their recorded camera material were saved.\n\nOn this run's matched roads, normal qualified progress rose from 864.24 to 886.27, about 2.55 percent. Qualified bends rose from 78 to 84, but neither policy completed a route. All sixteen recovery starts achieved five-second confirmation in both policies. Stability over the following ten seconds fell from eight cases to six, and whole-tail stability fell from one case to zero. All sixteen first candidate breaches were heading-only; thirteen reentered within one second.\n\nThe judgment was a small local normal-road gain without overall sustained-correction improvement. I next froze the policies to test whether smoothing the executed steering would help.","title_zh":"更长回报权重略增普通路进度，整体稳定恢复仍未改善","id":"step-209"},{"title_en":"The fixed-node restriction came from graphics startup checks","zh":"R24排队时，另一台L40节点有空位。但旧图形探针把主机名固定为远程计算机，直接改队列节点会在启动检查失败。我只读检查后确认，这个限制来自图形实现，不是神经模型。我选择保留当前作业等待，下一次提交再实现按真实Slurm主机和GPU身份校验的可移植版本。这里没有取消、替换或多提交一次训练。","en":"While R24 was queued, another L40 node had capacity. However, the old graphics probe required one hardcoded hostname, so simply moving the queued job would fail its startup requirements. Read-only inspection located this restriction in the graphics implementation, not in the neural model. I chose to keep the current job and wait. Portability would be implemented for the next submission using the recorded Slurm host and GPU identity. No job was cancelled, replaced, or duplicated during this inspection.","title_zh":"发现等待固定节点并非模型限制","id":"step-210","summary_en":"A hardcoded graphics host prevented using another available GPU node. I kept the queued job and made the next graphics setup portable.","summary_zh":"图形程序写死了主机，无法使用另一空闲 GPU 节点。我保留排队作业，在下一版修复可移植性。"},{"title_en":"An extra EGL entry blocked the smoothing comparison","zh":"R24真正启动后仅12秒就停止。实际L40对应的EGL条目已经初始化，UUID和PCI也匹配；另一个条目不能初始化，也没有CUDA身份扩展，旧探针仍要求它具备映射，因而整体拒绝。四臂平滑比较尚无任何案例、模型加载或驾驶数据。这个失败不能回答平滑有没有用。R25接着严格核验被选中的实际GPU，同时记录其他不可用条目，不让它们代替或误伤正确设备。","en":"The allocated R24 job stopped after twelve seconds. The EGL entry for the recorded L40 had initialized and matched the required UUID and PCI identity. An additional entry could not initialize and lacked the CUDA identity extension, but the old probe still required its mapping and rejected the whole launch. No case, checkpoint load, or drive from the four-arm smoothing comparison had begun. This failure could not answer whether smoothing helped. R25 next verified the selected allocated GPU strictly while recording unusable additional entries without allowing them to select or block the correct device.","title_zh":"平滑对比在EGL枚举额外条目时提前停止","id":"step-211","summary_en":"The correct GPU passed, but an unusable extra graphics entry blocked startup. I changed how the allocated device was selected.","summary_zh":"正确 GPU 已通过检查，不可用的额外图形条目却阻挡启动。我修正了所分配设备的选择方式。"},{"title_en":"Smoother commands did not consistently improve driving","zh":"R25先修好可移植图形入口，再让R21和R23两个冻结检查点各用原始转向与alpha0.5平滑，在同四条开发路、三个起点上完成48次驾驶。没有新训练。平滑执行每次只接收一半新命令，另一半来自上次执行值。\n\n转向变化确实下降约16%到17%，但平均绝对朝向误差上升。四臂十秒稳定依次为2/8、2/8、3/8、2/8；R23普通合格进度从217.05降到175.42，约少19.2%。26号路有些案例获益，27号路两策略都恶化，所有普通驾驶仍未完成路线。因此没有采用这项平滑作默认。下一阶段保留R23原始转向，另问：让核心知道刚才的动作、速度和转动，是否更有帮助？","en":"R25 first repaired portable graphics startup checks. It then froze the R21 and R23 checkpoints and drove each with raw steering and alpha-0.5 smoothing. The same four development roads and three starts produced 48 formal drives, with no new training. The filter passed half of each new command and retained half of the previous executed command.\n\nSteering variation did fall by about sixteen to seventeen percent, but mean absolute heading error increased. Ten-second stability across the four arms was two, two, three, and two cases out of eight. For R23, normal qualified progress fell from 217.05 to 175.42, about 19.2 percent. Some road-26 cases benefited, while road 27 worsened for both checkpoints. No normal drive completed its route.\n\nI did not adopt this smoothing setting. The next stage kept R23's raw steering and tested a different question: could information about recent actions, speed, and turning help the neural core?","title_zh":"转向更平滑，普通路进度反而下降","id":"step-212"},{"title_en":"The filter saved action cost but increased tracking cost","zh":"平滑让动作变化小了，为何总效果更差？我按原公式重算48次保存驾驶的奖励，连终止代价也保留。动作变化代价确实减少，朝向和距离代价却增加。原奖励本来已经惩罚动作变化，所以再盲加同一项缺少依据。这个纯数据检查帮助我把下一步留给新的信息输入，而不是同时再改奖励。","en":"The filter reduced action changes, so why did overall driving worsen? I reconstructed the original reward for all 48 saved drives, including terminal failure costs. Action-change costs did decrease, but heading and distance costs increased. The reward already penalized changing steering, so blindly adding another version of that penalty lacked support. This saved-data audit kept the next experiment focused on additional input information instead of changing the reward at the same time.","title_zh":"检查平滑省下的动作代价是否抵消误差","id":"step-213","summary_en":"Smoothing saved steering-change cost but increased heading and distance costs. I kept the next experiment focused on movement information.","summary_zh":"平滑降低了转向变化代价，却增加朝向和距离代价。我让下一次实验专门测试运动信息。"},{"title_en":"Feed recent movement into the recurrent core","zh":"新的问题是：只看相机的控制器，能否从自身近期动作和运动得到帮助？我加入三项因果输入：上一次已接受的执行转向、测得车速，以及前后两个已接受端点算出的转动速度。它们不含道路偏移、道路朝向或正确转向答案。\n\n三项数值通过一个初始全零的映射送到3,324个R1–R6细胞，再经过原循环核心影响动作；没有直接接到动作头。映射共有9,972个权重，使用独立的新Adam状态。两条件都从同一R23最终检查点和完整旧Adam开始，同架构、同道路和训练量；一边收真实三项，另一边收零。零初始化让开始时仍等同原策略。真正比较之前，必须先核对在线采集、历史重算和更新看到的是同一段输入。","en":"The new question was whether a camera-only controller could use information about its own recent actions and movement. I added three causal values: the previous accepted executed steering command, measured speed, and yaw rate calculated from preceding accepted endpoints. They contained no road offset, route heading, or correct-steering answer.\n\nA new map sent these values into 3,324 R1–R6 cells, then through the original recurrent core before they could affect steering. There was no direct action-head shortcut. The map had 9,972 weights, started at exactly zero, and used a separate fresh Adam state.\n\nBoth conditions began from the same final R23 checkpoint and complete inherited optimizer state. They shared architecture, roads, and training targets. One received the three real values; the other received zeros. Before comparing driving, I had to verify that live collection, history reconstruction, and learning used the same input sequence.","title_zh":"把刚才如何转向、车速和转动送进神经核心","id":"step-214"},{"title_en":"The first gradient probe used actions with zero score derivative","zh":"R26运行173秒，两个正式训练臂都未开始。短诊断先用策略均值动作，再要求同策略重放时动作分数梯度非零；对正态策略，固定动作恰等于均值时，这个导数就是零。于是诊断本身退化，不能据此说核心不响应。失败前的64段body物理动作和相机有部分记录，但完整案例行与分量计数在门后才发布，已来不及保存。下一版改用真正抽样的诊断动作，并在判断之前先写出数据和各分量。","en":"R26 lasted 173 seconds, with neither formal training arm started. The diagnostic used the policy's mean action and then required a nonzero action-score gradient when replaying that fixed action under the unchanged policy. For a Normal policy, this derivative is zero when the action equals the mean. The diagnostic was therefore degenerate; it did not show an unresponsive core. Some physical-step and camera evidence survived, but complete case rows and component counts were published only after the failing check. The next version sampled genuine diagnostic actions and saved rows and component counts before judging the check.","title_zh":"用确定性均值动作检查PPO分数梯度，诊断设计退化","id":"step-215","summary_en":"The probe chose a mean action whose required derivative was zero by construction. I replaced it with sampled diagnostic actions.","summary_zh":"诊断选用了均值动作，其要求检查的导数按公式就是零。我改用抽样诊断动作。"},{"title_en":"The gradient paths passed, then candidate permission failed","zh":"R27改用抽样诊断动作后，实际核心、动作与价值输出路径都得到非零梯度证据，18项比较通过，参数和两个优化器也精确回滚。64条body诊断行先保存下来。随后新parity检查切入候选模式，却没取得旧R8包装器的门内许可，175秒后停止。零条件和正式学习仍未开始。下轮因此只修新增九参数叶的许可生命周期，旧八参数叶证明仍保留待定，不伪造为已通过。","en":"With sampled diagnostic actions, R27 obtained nonzero evidence for the required core, action, and value-output paths. Eighteen comparisons passed, and parameters plus both optimizers rolled back exactly. Sixty-four movement-feedback diagnostic records were saved first. The next parity check then selected candidate mode without obtaining the old R8 wrapper's in-check permission, stopping the job after 175 seconds. The zero condition and formal learning had not begun. The next revision repaired the new nine-leaf startup-check procedure while leaving the historical eight-leaf check record pending rather than relabeling it as passed.","title_zh":"梯度路径通过后，候选模式缺少旧wrapper许可","id":"step-216","summary_en":"The required gradient paths worked, but a permission flag blocked the next consistency test. I gave the new input map its own checked execution state.","summary_zh":"所需梯度路径正常，但许可标记阻挡了下一项一致性测试。我为新输入映射建立独立的执行检查状态。"},{"title_en":"Give the new map its own startup-check procedure","zh":"新增反馈参数后，不能借用旧模型的通过标记。R28给新的九参数叶证明单独管理临时许可：只在真实检查期间允许候选执行，成功才授予新运行许可，失败就清除并回到参考模式。重复的非零探针和零映射检查也要正常工作。源检查完成并封存后，CSC登录服务因安全事件中断，此时还没有R28 GPU作业。下一步换到官方仍可用的计算应用控制入口，科学源保持原样。","en":"The added feedback parameter could not borrow an old model's startup-check flag. R28 managed temporary permission for the new nine-leaf proof separately. Candidate execution was allowed only during the real check; success granted the new permission to use the checked calculation, while failure cleared permission and returned to reference mode. Repeated nonzero probes and zero-map checks also had to work. After source checks and sealing, CSC login access was interrupted by a security event. No R28 GPU job existed at that point. The next step used an available official compute-application control path while retaining the scientific source.","title_zh":"为新增反馈参数建立独立的候选许可","id":"step-217","summary_en":"The new feedback map needed its own checks rather than reusing an older model's pass flag. Access interruption then delayed deployment.","summary_zh":"新反馈映射需要自己的检查，不能借用旧模型的通过标记。随后访问中断又推迟了部署。"},{"title_en":"The first official compute-shell application was unusable","zh":"登录节点关闭后，官方计算应用仍可用。第一次申请的是独立的一CPU、2GiB控制作业，不是训练GPU。应用缺少tmux，处理程序又尝试了已关闭的登录SSH路径，所以没有可用终端。我通过官方界面取消这个已有作业；实际326秒和0.067917 CPU BU保留。下一次是单独保留预算、经过诊断的官方VS Code应用，不把这次管理失败藏进科学实验。","en":"When login-node access closed, official compute applications remained available. The first request was a separate one-CPU, two-GiB control job, not a training GPU. Its application lacked tmux, and the handler tried the unavailable login SSH path, leaving no usable terminal. I cancelled that existing job through the official interface and retained its recorded 326 seconds and 0.067917 CPU BU. The next attempt was a separately reserved official VS Code application. This administrative failure remains part of the process rather than disappearing into the scientific experiment.","title_zh":"官方Compute shell应用缺tmux，改用VS Code应用","id":"step-218","summary_en":"The first official CPU control application provided no usable terminal. I stopped that application and tried the official editor application separately.","summary_zh":"第一个官方 CPU 控制应用没有提供可用终端。我停止该应用，再单独尝试官方编辑器应用。"},{"title_en":"VS Code provided a real, separately accounted control context","zh":"第二个官方应用提供了可用VS Code终端。我核对账户身份、进程、作业cgroup与Slurm身份，只允许这个控制作业存在时提交独立GPU子作业。它分配一CPU、2GiB，不训练模型；GPU也不依赖终端一直在线。后来实际CPU主行是7,209秒，比原上限多九秒，真实费用1.501875 CPU BU如实保留。接下来用独立控制程序包部署原R28科学源。","en":"The second official application provided a usable VS Code terminal. I checked its real user, process, job cgroup, and Slurm identity, and allowed GPU submission only with that validated control job present. It used one CPU and two GiB without training a model. The GPU child also ran independently of the terminal's lifetime. Its eventual CPU main row was 7,209 seconds, nine beyond the requested limit, and the recorded 1.501875 CPU BU was retained. The next step deployed the unchanged R28 scientific source through a separate control capsule.","title_zh":"VS Code计算应用提供可用控制终端","id":"step-219","summary_en":"The editor application provided a valid control terminal. The GPU job could run independently after submission.","summary_zh":"编辑器应用提供了有效控制终端。提交后，GPU 作业可以独立运行。"},{"title_en":"Move the control layer without changing the scientific trial","zh":"R29是控制层版本，不是另一个训练条件。它负责核验CPU上下文、部署、一次提交、资金与结果检查；GPU主控仍调用封存的R28图形和学习程序。提交子进程清理继承的Slurm变量，让新分配拥有自己的真实身份。我也修了排序JSON导致上下文摘要不一致的问题。真实准备核验和verify-only通过后，只创建一个GPU作业2355497。这样访问方式变了，科学问题没有一起改变。","en":"R29 was a control-layer revision, not another training condition. It validated the CPU context and handled deployment, one submission, funding, and inspection. The GPU coordinator still called the sealed R28 graphics and learning programs. The submission child cleared inherited Slurm variables so the new allocation received its own real identity. A sorted-JSON context-digest mismatch was also repaired. After recorded verified preparation records and verification-only checks passed, the pipeline created one GPU job, 2355497. The access method changed while the scientific question stayed fixed.","title_zh":"把控制层移到官方CPU应用，科学源保持原R28","id":"step-220","summary_en":"I changed the deployment and submission route while keeping the scientific program fixed. This was a control-layer revision, not a new feedback condition.","summary_zh":"我改变部署和提交途径，保持科学程序不变。这是控制流程修订，没有增加反馈实验条件。"},{"title_en":"The feedback arm stopped after 7,680 optimized transitions","zh":"R28这次真正进入学习，body臂接受9,543条新转移，优化7,680条，完成480次更新。零反馈臂还没有开始，所以等量比较尚未完成。故障发生在20号环境：请求转向约−0.4861，回显却是−0.6152，物理时间已经前进；该步被拒，没有奖励或学习行。\n\n接着暴露第二个错误。已接受的数据和反馈历史还停在旧端点，更新前bootstrap却去查询新物理端点；普通重置又排在优化完成之后。旧历史检查正确地拒绝了这种拼接。我因此能定位bootstrap、反馈历史和reset的顺序问题，却仍不知道最初echo为何不匹配。保存的28个评估只是父基线与早期技术检查，没有7,680样本版本的最终驾驶结果。下一版先保护旧prefix，再重置，再允许更新。","en":"R28 now entered learning. The movement-feedback condition accepted 9,543 new transitions, optimized 7,680, and completed 480 updates. The zero-feedback arm had not started, so the matched comparison remained incomplete. In environment 20, the requested steering was about minus 0.4861, but the echo was minus 0.6152 after physical time had advanced. The interval was rejected and created no reward or learning row.\n\nA second error then became visible. The accepted data and feedback history still described the earlier endpoint, but pre-update bootstrapping queried the later physical endpoint. The normal reset was scheduled after optimization. The stale-history guard correctly rejected that splice.\n\nThis located an ordering problem in bootstrapping, feedback history, and reset. The original echo mismatch remained unexplained. The 28 saved evaluations were parent baselines and early technical checks, not final driving tests of the 7,680-sample model. The next version protected the accepted prefix, reset first, and only then allowed updates.","title_zh":"反馈臂训练到7680新样本后在拒绝动作的历史衔接处停止","id":"step-221"},{"title_en":"Keep valid earlier steps before resetting a failed simulator","zh":"R30针对已定位的顺序错误修复。拒绝动作之前，先缓存与同一车道、策略版本、相机、循环状态和反馈历史绑定的价值；异常车道用它给旧prefix做bootstrap，不向新端点继续前向。重置必须真正完成并join后，才允许裁剪数据或Adam更新，旧历史保护仍开启。这一阶段先完成源与纯数据检查，远程维护尚未恢复。两条件真实短检查和完整比较留到后续实际运行时验证。","en":"R30 repaired the observed ordering error. Before a possibly rejected action, it cached a value bound to the same simulator, policy version, camera observation, recurrent state, and feedback history. A simulator with a rejected action used that value to bootstrap its accepted prefix instead of forwarding from the later endpoint. A real joined reset had to finish before trimming or Adam updates, and the stale-history guard remained active. Source and saved-data checks were prepared while remote maintenance continued. The recorded two-condition recovery checks and comparison remained for the later integrated run.","title_zh":"重置故障模拟器前，先保留此前有效步骤","id":"step-222","summary_en":"A rejected action had moved the physical car beyond its saved history. I cached the earlier value estimate and completed reset before learning could resume.","summary_zh":"被拒绝动作已把真实车辆带到保存历史之后。我缓存此前的价值估计，并要求重置结束后才继续学习。"},{"title_en":"Use a fresh official control job after service restoration","zh":"服务恢复后，旧VS Code作业已经结束，不能复用同一页面冒充有效计算上下文。新的2384782仍是一CPU、2GiB官方控制应用，用来取得旧作业真实主行、结算并部署R30/R31。GPU子作业在它生存期内独立提交。它后来实际运行7,219秒，十九秒超限和1.503959 CPU BU单独保留。R31只是控制程序包，接下来科学结果看R30的2386994。","en":"After service restoration, the previous VS Code job had ended. Its old page could not be reused as a valid compute context. New job 2384782 was another official one-CPU, two-GiB control application, used to obtain genuine old main rows, settle existing work, and deploy R30 with R31 control. It submitted an independent GPU child during its valid lifetime. The CPU later ran 7,219 seconds; its nineteen-second overrun and 1.503959 CPU BU were retained separately. R31 was the control capsule; the scientific outcome belonged to R30 job 2386994.","title_zh":"服务恢复后，新的官方CPU控制应用","id":"step-223","summary_en":"The old control terminal had expired. A new CPU application supplied a valid context for deploying and submitting the independent GPU job.","summary_zh":"旧控制终端已到期。新的 CPU 应用为部署和提交独立 GPU 作业提供了有效环境。"},{"title_en":"A real echo failure interrupted the parent baseline before learning","zh":"R30的两个全局短检查都通过了，包括成功物理步之后人为标记拒绝的恢复检查。但body臂进入真正的父策略普通驾驶基线时，26号开发路在2,615次已接受决策之后出现了真实异常：新的极小负转向发出并刷新后，连续四个真实帧仍回显旧的正转向。差值超过原1e−5门，该步被拒并刹车。\n\n完整八路父基线门因此中止，body新学习和零臂学习都为零。这也揭示了短检查范围：成功step后的人为拒绝，没有覆盖env.step本身抛错的分支。另一条正指数格式小命令能正常反映，所以不能把根因直接归给科学记数法。下一步做有限、无模型的命令矩阵，并补上生产采集与评估中的真实异常恢复检查。","en":"Both short R30 system checks passed, including recovery after a deliberate rejection added following a successful physical step. But during the real parent normal-driving baseline, development road 26 failed after 2,615 accepted decisions. A tiny negative steering command was sent and refreshed, yet four genuine telemetry frames still echoed the previous positive command. The difference exceeded the original 1e-5 check. The interval was rejected and braking followed.\n\nThe complete eight-road parent-baseline requirement then stopped the run. Movement-feedback learning was zero and the zero-feedback condition never started. This exposed the short check's scope: rejecting after a successful step had not exercised an exception thrown by env.step itself.\n\nA different positive exponent-form command had worked, so scientific notation alone was not an established cause. The next work used a finite model-free command matrix and added recorded exception-branch recovery checks for production collection and evaluation.","title_zh":"短检查之后的真实父评估仍出现转向echo未更新","id":"step-224"},{"title_en":"Trace the command boundary without inventing a cause","zh":"我回看原始事件，而不是先改动作门。165个成功动作也曾出现一到三个旧echo帧，其中11次到第四帧才匹配；失败例四帧仍旧。静态代码里没有找到接近零时特殊截断的分支，另有PID写者虽在代码中存在，实际是否激活没有记录。命令处理、采集和遥测时序因此值得检查，但echo本身只是请求字段，不是机械轮角。下一项有限诊断保留这些未定原因，不预先宣布修好了哪一种故障。","en":"I inspected the original events before changing the acceptance check. Even 165 successful actions had one to three old-echo frames; eleven matched only on the fourth frame. The failure still showed the old value in all four. Static code inspection found no special near-zero truncation branch. Another PID writer existed in code, but its recorded activation was unobserved. Command handling and telemetry timing therefore deserved investigation. The echo remained a requested-control field, not a mechanical wheel-angle measurement. The finite next diagnostic retained these uncertainties rather than declaring a cause already repaired.","title_zh":"在原始帧中追踪旧echo和新命令的边界","id":"step-225","summary_en":"The saved messages showed delayed command reports, but did not establish their cause. I kept the command check and designed a finite diagnostic.","summary_zh":"保存消息显示命令回传存在延迟，却没有查明起因。我保留命令检查，设计有限次诊断。"},{"title_en":"A new control context supported the finite diagnosis","zh":"旧控制作业自然超时后，继续诊断需要新的真实上下文。2393329是一次另行授权的官方CPU应用，一CPU、2GiB、两小时，无GPU；旧账本的超限和阻塞状态都没有清除。它支持后面的R32到R35有限诊断，自身在7,218秒后自然结束，十八秒超限和1.503750 CPU BU保留。下一次生产修复使用另一个已核验的新上下文，不能延长或复用这个过期终端。","en":"Once the old control job naturally timed out, diagnosis required a fresh valid context. Job 2393329 was a separate official CPU application: one CPU, two GiB, two hours, and no GPU. Historical overruns and the sidecar's blocked state were retained. It supported the finite R32-to-R35 diagnostics and naturally ended after 7,218 seconds. Its eighteen-second overrun and 1.503750 CPU BU remained recorded. Production repair then used another validated context rather than extending or reusing this expired terminal.","title_zh":"echo诊断使用新的官方CPU应用","id":"step-226","summary_en":"The control terminal expired before diagnosis finished. I used a fresh CPU application and recorded its resource use separately.","summary_zh":"诊断完成前控制终端到期。我使用新的 CPU 应用，并单独记录其资源用量。"},{"title_en":"The model-free diagnostic checked an unrelated legacy launcher","zh":"R32原本只想测试命令和接收过程，不建神经模型。但新入口沿用了旧上下文的默认CUDA启动器核验，检查了一个与当前无模型协议不相干的启动器。作业四秒就被拒，还没有运行目录、模拟器进程或驾驶。我把它作为入口整合遗漏保留。R33只显式选择无模型上下文，同时独立核验真正使用的官方解释器，不删除源身份检查。","en":"R32 was intended to test commands and receiving behavior without constructing a neural model. Its new entry inherited a context default that checked an unrelated legacy CUDA launcher. The job was rejected after four seconds, before a run directory, simulator process, or drive existed. I retained this as an entry integration omission. R33 explicitly selected the model-free source context while independently checking the official interpreter actually used. Source-identity verification remained in place.","title_zh":"无模型诊断误用旧CUDA launcher上下文门","id":"step-227","summary_en":"A command-only diagnostic stopped because its launcher checked an unrelated model program. I selected the correct diagnostic environment.","summary_zh":"纯命令诊断因启动器检查了无关模型程序而停止。我修正为该诊断自己的运行环境。"},{"title_en":"The same path named different files across the container boundary","zh":"R33接着在两秒内被解释器身份门拒绝。原因是同一路径在宿主机上是2,432字节shell启动器，在官方容器内却是约31MB的Python3.12.13二进制；旧检查把两个命名空间里的对象当成同一个文件。随后同CPU的纯标准库检查实际确认了这个边界，没有运行模型或车辆。R34因此分别固定外层启动器和内层二进制，并在真实容器里先做API预检。","en":"R33 was rejected by its interpreter-identity check after two seconds. The same path named a 2,432-byte shell launcher on the host and an approximately 31-MB Python 3.12.13 binary inside the official container. The check had treated objects from two namespaces as the same file. A standard-library inspection on the same CPU then confirmed that boundary without running a model or vehicle. R34 pinned the outer launcher and inner binary separately and performed API startup checks inside the recorded container before allocating the diagnostic.","title_zh":"同一路径在host是shell、container里是Python二进制","id":"step-228","summary_en":"The same path referred to different files on the host and in the container. I verified the launcher and interpreter separately.","summary_zh":"同一路径在主机和容器内指向不同文件。我分别核对启动脚本和解释器。"},{"title_en":"The real environment expected one steering value","zh":"R34已经过真实容器预检，也启动了一个通过GPU、帧缓冲、VirtualGL、Unity和道路重置的owner。但第一段诊断前缀就传错了动作形状：旧环境要一个策略转向值，诊断却给了两个数。原C15转换器本来负责再加固定油门。作业65秒后停止，未完成命令探测。这次失败于是只修三个step调用点的单值适配，并让真实转换器同时进入预检。","en":"R34 passed checks inside the container and started one simulator with GPU, framebuffer, VirtualGL, Unity, road registration, and neutral reset checks. Its first diagnostic prefix then supplied the wrong action shape. The inherited environment expected one policy steering value, but the diagnostic passed two values. The original C15 converter already owned the addition of fixed throttle. The job stopped after 65 seconds without completing a command probe. The next revision repaired the three step call sites with one scalar adapter and exercised the real converter during preflight.","title_zh":"第一个真实诊断步传入了错误的动作形状","id":"step-229","summary_en":"The diagnostic sent two action values to an interface expecting steering alone. I fixed the adapter before testing command delivery.","summary_zh":"诊断向只接受转向值的接口发送了两个动作值。我先修正适配器，再测命令传递。"},{"title_en":"All 36 command probes matched, without reproducing the intermittent fault","zh":"R35把六种字面命令各重复三次，分别走原env.step和新的连续采集加查询路径，共36次。全部端点匹配请求的float32值；35次首帧就匹配，一次普通小数命令到第二帧才匹配。原失败的极小指数值六次都首帧匹配，所以没有复现原间歇故障。\n\n记录范围也要说清：144个探测遥测帧保存了数值，新路径保存72张JPEG和注册图；旧通用回调被C10接收函数绕过，未达到最初“全部相机帧”的声明。下一版因此在真正解码wire的位置保存图像，并测试多owner和真实异常分支。","en":"R35 repeated six literal commands three times in each of two modes: the original env.step path and a continuous-capture/query path. All 36 endpoints matched the requested float32 values. Thirty-five matched on the first frame; one fixed-decimal command matched on the second. The original tiny exponent-form value matched on the first frame in all six trials, so the intermittent fault was not reproduced.\n\nThe retained scope matters. All 144 numeric probe frames survived, and the new path saved 72 JPEGs plus registration. The old general callback was bypassed by C10 receiving, so the original all-camera declaration was not met. The next revision captured at real wire decoding and tested multi-simulator production exceptions.","title_zh":"36个命令对比都匹配，间歇故障没有复现","id":"step-230","summary_en":"Every command probe matched its requested endpoint, so the intermittent fault did not recur. Missing image capture led to a change in recording location.","summary_zh":"所有命令探针的终点都与请求匹配，间歇故障未再出现。图像采集缺失促使我改变记录位置。"},{"title_en":"Capture continuously and exercise the real exception branches","zh":"生产修复不再借用失效回调。新接收节奏一次连续取得四个真实源帧，再暂停、排空和按原时钟处理，保留原截止时间与1e−5端点门。图像在真正wire解码边界保存。采集分支遇到真实typed echo异常时，用缓存bootstrap、先join重置再Adam；固定权重评估则保留失败attempt，只允许同路同起点完整重做一次。评审又补齐超时、清标记和次要异常处理。源码通过仍不是实际车辆通过，下一步在多owner短检查里验证。","en":"The production repair no longer relied on the inactive callback. It captured four genuine source frames in one continuous run, then paused, drained, and processed them with their original clocks, deadlines, and 1e-5 endpoint check. Images were retained at recorded wire decoding. Collection handled real typed echo exceptions with cached bootstrapping and a joined reset before Adam. Fixed-weight evaluation preserved the failed attempt and permitted at most one complete same-road, same-start replacement. Review also repaired deadline, flag-cleanup, and secondary-error paths. Source checks still required multi-simulator validation next.","title_zh":"连续取四帧，并补上真正拒绝动作的两条恢复路径","id":"step-231","summary_en":"I recorded images where messages were decoded and tested the real command-error branches. Reset had to finish before updates or replacement evaluation.","summary_zh":"我在消息解码位置记录图像，并测试真实命令异常分支。更新或替代评估前都必须先完成重置。"},{"title_en":"The GPU supervisor continued after the control application ended","zh":"2393329自然结束后，生产集成使用新的2397480官方CPU应用。一CPU、2GiB的控制上下文重新核验，重排队关闭，旧超限全部保留。它支持R36与R38的准备和提交；到7,218秒自然超时后，R38 GPU监督器仍独立运行。十八秒超限和1.503750 CPU BU单独记录。这让我能把控制终端寿命与真正的训练寿命分开，不把终端结束误写成训练中断。","en":"After 2393329 ended naturally, production integration used a new official CPU application, 2397480. Its one-CPU, two-GiB context was revalidated, requeue was disabled, and historical overruns remained visible. It supported R36 and R38 preparation and submission. When it naturally timed out after 7,218 seconds, the R38 GPU supervisor continued independently. Its eighteen-second overrun and 1.503750 CPU BU were recorded separately. This separates the control terminal's lifetime from the training lifetime, rather than describing terminal expiry as a training interruption.","title_zh":"生产修复与最终比较使用独立CPU控制应用","id":"step-232","summary_en":"The GPU supervisor continued after the CPU control application expired. Control access and training therefore had separate lifetimes.","summary_zh":"CPU 控制应用到期后，GPU 管理程序继续运行。控制访问和训练因此有各自的生命周期。"},{"title_en":"Resetting all 32 simulators at once exceeded the time limit","zh":"R36先做32owner负载与恢复检查，却在任何评分动作之前运行164秒后失败。新增诊断直接让32台一起重置，绕过了原来每批最多八台并等待完成的调度器，耗尽原两秒有效接收预算。所有原始重置结果和图像仍被保存。这是我新增门的接线错误，没有复现R30的转向故障。R38只恢复原分批重置路径，评分负载仍保留32台同时运行，科学条件和时间门不改。","en":"R36 was meant to validate 32-simulator load and recovery before training, but failed after 164 seconds before any scored action. The added diagnostic reset all 32 simulators together, bypassing the original dispatcher that reset at most eight at a time and joined each batch. This exhausted the unchanged two-second active receive budget. Raw reset outcomes and images were retained. It was an error in my added startup test, not a reproduction of R30's steering fault. R38 restored the original batched reset path while retaining 32 simultaneous simulators for scored load testing and unchanged scientific settings.","title_zh":"同时重置32个模拟器，耗尽接收时限","id":"step-233","summary_en":"My load test reset every simulator at once and exceeded the receive-time limit. I restored the original batched resets for the next run.","summary_zh":"我的负载测试同时重置全部模拟器，超过了接收时限。我在下一次运行恢复原来的分组重置。"},{"title_en":"Both conditions passed load and command-error recovery checks","zh":"R38恢复分批重置后，两个条件各完成32台乘16步的负载检查，再完成各64步全局短检查。还各自在采集和固定权重评估中，用明确的错误wire命令制造真实typed拒绝。旧prefix保留，拒绝步没有奖励或PPO行，重置完成后才接受下一步；评估失败attempt保留，整例重做而不拼接。合计1,162个已接受诊断动作、四个受控拒绝，参数与两个优化器不变。这次门真正覆盖生产异常分支，然后才允许正式学习。","en":"After restoring batched resets, both R38 conditions completed the 32-by-16-step load test and their 64-step short system checks. Each also used an explicitly wrong wire command to trigger real typed rejection in collection and fixed-weight evaluation. The accepted prefix survived, the rejected interval created no reward or PPO row, and reset completed before the next accepted step. Evaluation retained the failed attempt and repeated the whole case rather than splicing trajectories. Across startup checks there were 1,162 accepted diagnostic actions and four controlled rejections, with parameters and both optimizers unchanged. These checks now covered the production exception branches before formal learning.","title_zh":"两个条件通过负载和命令异常恢复检查","id":"step-234","summary_en":"Both feedback conditions passed load and deliberately triggered command-error checks. Valid earlier steps survived, rejected actions stayed out of learning, and resets finished first.","summary_zh":"两个反馈条件都通过负载和人为触发的命令异常检查。此前有效步骤得到保留，拒绝动作不进入学习，重置先行完成。"},{"title_en":"The completed feedback comparison stayed close to its parent","zh":"最后，R38的两个条件都完成了预定学习。它们各自从同一个R23最终检查点和完整旧Adam开始，另建独立的零映射和新Adam。真实反馈与零输入是预定差别；道路、起点、奖励、原始转向、学习率和更新设置一致。两边的旧连接增益和读出都继续训练，固定参数与图结构保持。每边接受17,280条新转移，优化16,384条，1,024次更新使用65,536个样本；896条接受数据未优化。\n\n每边13批评估首次完成，没有技术替换。最后普通驾驶合格进度为440.69和444.90，真实反馈在八条配对路都略低。双方各通过175个可用弯道中的32个，路线完成都是0/8，全部最终普通驾驶止于大偏离门。\n\n恢复结果混合。五秒确认是15/16对16/16；随后十秒稳定是3/16对2/16。零条件24号开发路负向起点在60秒上限前没有足够后续窗口，结局未知；真实反馈26号路正向起点约36.4秒结束，未五秒确认。同一父策略重复评估已经出现0对1例稳定差。我因此说，在这次预算和单次续训下没有清楚的总体收益，保留全部案例供检查。","en":"R38 finally completed both conditions. Each restored the same final R23 checkpoint and saved state of the inherited Adam optimizer, with its own fresh zero-initialized map and new optimizer. Real movement feedback versus zero input was the specified difference. Roads, starts, reward, raw steering, learning rates, and update settings were matched. Both conditions continued training inherited connection gains and the readout; fixed parameters and graph topology stayed unchanged. Each accepted 17,280 new transitions and optimized 16,384 through 1,024 updates, producing 65,536 sample uses. Another 896 accepted transitions were not optimized.\n\nAll thirteen evaluation batches per condition completed at the first attempt. Final normal qualified progress was 440.69 with movement feedback and 444.90 with zeros. Movement feedback was slightly behind on all eight paired roads. Both passed 32 of 175 available bends and completed zero of eight routes.\n\nRecovery was mixed: five-second confirmation was 15 versus 16 of sixteen; ten-second stability was three versus two. One zero-feedback follow-up was censored at the sixty-second cap. The identical parent repeats already differed by one stable case. Within this budget and one continuation per condition, there was no clear overall benefit.","title_zh":"最终双臂完成，反馈没有给出清楚的总体收益","id":"step-235"},{"title_en":"Both conditions retained the same one-sided terminal pattern","zh":"汇总表之后，我检查全部16个开发路普通驾驶，而不是挑一段。把父与最终、两个条件的四条路都放进分析，共27次进入较大正偏移且反向朝向误差的区域，没有镜像区域案例，也没有随后回到窄对齐带。每条最后一次访问在记录结束处截尾。相机采样、下行神经元特征和转向仍在变化，失败并非所有输入输出都停住。它们共同呈现迟迟不结束转弯的模式；保存特征不等同完整内部神经活动。","en":"After the aggregate comparison, I inspected all sixteen development-road normal drives: both parents and finals, in both conditions. There were 27 visits to the specified large-positive-offset, opposite-heading-error region, no mirrored-region visits, and no later observed return to the narrow alignment band. Each drive's final visit was censored by the recording end. Camera samples, descending-neuron features, and steering were still changing, so the failure was not a complete freeze of input and output. Together they showed the retained late-turning pattern. These saved features are not a recording of all internal neural activity.","title_zh":"最终两条件都保留同一侧的迟迟不结束转弯模式","id":"step-236","summary_en":"The final recordings retained the same prolonged-turn failure pattern. The recorded images and output features were still changing throughout it.","summary_zh":"最终记录仍保留转弯过久的失败模式。在这个过程中，图像和输出特征仍在变化。"},{"title_en":"Final preservation required one separate control job","zh":"完整MAIN下载和核验之后，旧控制终端已经结束。我在真实队列为空、另行预留CPU预算后，只启动一个新官方控制应用2404865，用于终端核算与封存。它仍是一CPU、2GiB，无GPU；R38科学运行已经结束，这个新上下文支持它的一次结算。所读记录只给出这个CPU的有效上下文和计划结束时间，自身最终会计仍待核，不能据两小时预约猜实际费用。这个行政缺口与已经完成的双臂科学结果分开。","en":"After the complete main archive was downloaded and verified, the previous control terminal had ended. With a fresh empty owned queue and a separate CPU reservation, one new official application, 2404865, supported terminal accounting and preservation. It used one CPU, two GiB, and no GPU. The scientific run had completed; this context supported its once-only settlement. The retained records provide this CPU's valid context and scheduled ending, but leave its own final accounting pending. I did not infer a charge from the two-hour request. That administrative gap is separate from the completed scientific comparison.","title_zh":"最终MAIN完整核验后另启CPU做终端核算","id":"step-237","summary_en":"One final CPU application supported archiving and accounting after the scientific run was complete. Its own final charge was not present in the retained record.","summary_zh":"科学运行完成后，最后一个 CPU 应用用于归档和结算。保留记录中仍缺少它自身的最终费用。"},{"title_en":"The 0.080 percent ratio measures final input-drive amplitude","zh":"这里的0.080%回答的是输入有多强。我使用R38真实反馈最终检查点的映射权重和24个最终评估里10,671次已接受决策，按保存输入重算注入公式，没有再运行网络或车辆。运动与相机输入都用全部176,422个神经元作共同分母计算均方根幅度，分别约0.00002095和0.02625；前者是后者的约0.080%。八次普通驾驶单独计算约0.078%。\n\n映射的9,972个权重全部非零，但均方根仅0.000433。它说明这个从零开始、在本预算内学出的额外驱动很弱，为表现接近父策略提供一种合理解释。它测量最终检查点的输入幅度，没有直接测量循环核心放大多少、下降输出改变多少，或最终行为改变百分之几。","en":"The 0.080 percent figure answers an input-amplitude question. I used the final R38 movement-feedback map and 10,671 accepted decisions from its 24 final evaluation cases. Saved inputs were substituted into the injection formulas without running the network or vehicle again.\n\nBoth movement and camera drives used all 176,422 neurons as the common denominator for pooled root-mean-square amplitude. Their values were about 0.00002095 and 0.02625. The movement drive was therefore about 0.080 percent of the camera drive. The eight normal drives alone gave about 0.078 percent.\n\nAll 9,972 map weights were nonzero, but their RMS size was only 0.000433. The added drive had grown weakly from zero within this budget, offering one plausible explanation for near-parent performance. This measured the final checkpoint's injected input. It did not measure downstream recurrent amplification, descending-output changes, or a percentage change in behavior.","title_zh":"0.080%测量最终map注入幅度，尚未追踪到行为影响","id":"step-238","summary_en":"I compared the final model's two input amplitudes using saved decisions. Movement input was very small at entry; the separate driving comparison measured the resulting behaviour.","summary_zh":"我用保存决策比较最终模型的两路输入幅度。运动信号在进入网络时很小；两条件的驾驶表现由单独的评估比较。"}];
